(1141, 0, 'hr_vbulletin_connect', 1, '1.1.0', 4049, 174, 'vBulletin user sync', 'Sync vBulletin user and Typo3 fe_users. It allows Single sign on.', 0, 0, 4, 1177870314, 'a:0:{}', 'Herbert Roider', 'herbert.roider@utanet.at', 'bertl', '98c36bb40e7865b82e33f3c7a582109a', 'The vbulletin files are not included on every page in frontend. This improves the speed. Therefore other changes are necessary so I increase the sub version from 1.0.x to 1.1.0.', '', 1001000, 0, 0),
