(1482, 0, 'cron_accessiblemenus', 1, '0.4.0', 3667, 130, 'Accessible Menus', 'Allows the generation of accessible menus (with accesskeys and dfn numbering). Accessibility  Barrierefreiheit.', 2, 0, 2, 1129116000, 'a:1:{s:7:"depends";a:3:{s:5:"typo3";s:11:"0.0.2-0.0.2";s:3:"php";s:11:"0.0.2-0.0.2";s:3:"cms";s:0:"";}}', 'Ernesto Baschny', 'ernst@cron-it.de', 'baschny', 'b4faf88b4ca164cd4fda9b5d93327205', '[] added dfn.menuSet settings, which allows to continue the counter in the dfn across multiple TMENUs;\r\n[] added dfn.stdWrap setting to be able to wrap something around the dfn-content;\r\n[] added dfn.start setting to be able to start counting from a', 'cron IT GmbH', 4000, 0, 0),
