(1484, 0, 'cron_accessiblemenus', 1, '0.6.0', 3667, 497, 'Accessible Menus', 'Allows the generation of accessible menus (with accesskeys and dfn numbering). Accessibility  Barrierefreiheit.', 2, 0, 2, 1137405312, 'a:1:{s:7:"depends";a:3:{s:5:"typo3";s:11:"0.0.2-0.0.2";s:3:"php";s:11:"0.0.2-0.0.2";s:3:"cms";s:0:"";}}', 'Ernesto Baschny', 'ernst@cron-it.de', 'baschny', '515c032d169718dda827c6c22f9b5957', 'Suggestion by Bjoern Kraus: added new option accessKeys.noAutoGenerated to use only gov_accessible access-keys; no hardcoded : after the dfn anymore. You can add the : or any other string after the dfn value using the dfn.stdWrap property', 'cron IT GmbH', 6000, 0, 0),
(1485, 0, 'cron_accessiblemenus', 1, '0.7.0', 3667, 2025, 'Accessible Menus', 'Allows the generation of accessible menus (with accesskeys and dfn numbering). Accessibility  Barrierefreiheit.', 2, 0, 2, 1145346029, 'a:0:{}', 'Ernesto Baschny', 'ernst@cron-it.de', 'baschny', '1dbb246b9a44d1e648bdaaab83043b69', 'Added new option dfn.inATag and updated documentation, which now discourages the usage of accesskeys, linking to an article about accessible menus (suggestions by Ingo Renner).', 'cron IT GmbH', 7000, 1, 0),
