(2342, 0, 'doc_tut_quickstart', 1, '0.0.4', 1572, 237, 'Getting Started', 'Gets you started hands on with your first TYPO3 website. Will explain the basic principles of TYPO3 and gives you hands on experience. After this tutorial you will have idea of the capabilities of TYPO3 as well as complexities involved.', 2, 1, 8, 1071996093, 'a:1:{s:7:"depends";a:2:{s:5:"typo3";s:0:"";s:3:"php";s:0:"";}}', 'Kasper Skrhj', 'kasper@typo3.com', 'docteam', '870b0ce6375b9816ad5cae175f83caf7', '', 'Curby Soft Multimedia', 4, 0, 0),
