(2999, 0, 'fe_mail', 1, '0.0.1', 1069, 429, 'FE Internal Mail', 'FE Plugin to allow front end users to send mail to each other.', 1, -1, 3, 1111357964, 'a:1:{s:7:"depends";a:3:{s:5:"typo3";s:0:"";s:3:"php";s:0:"";s:3:"cms";s:0:"";}}', 'Joshua Preston', 'jpreston@americatab.com', 'jpreston', 'c5102f2aeb4777c4b318e83258d8e5bb', 'Initial Release\r\n\r\n\r\nNeeds two pages and one record storage.\r\n\r\nCompose has fully functional RTE with normal text area fallback for unsupported browsers.  RTE works in Firefox, Mozilla, IE 5.0, maybe more.\r\n\r\nWill post messages, and hide message', '', 1, 0, 0),
