(3061, 0, 'formwidgets', 1, '2.0.0', 2294, 648, 'Form Widgets', 'This extension uses a DHTML techique (a javascript behaviour/presentation layer) that converts standard checkboxes & radiobuttons to a working graphical equivalent.\r\nThe extension works independantly of whether Javascript or CSS is enabled (it degrades co', 2, 0, 2, 1137438071, 'a:1:{s:7:"depends";a:3:{s:5:"typo3";s:11:"0.0.3-0.0.3";s:3:"php";s:11:"0.0.3-0.0.3";s:3:"cms";s:0:"";}}', 'Peter Klein', 'peter@umloud.dk', 'pmk65', 'dfe62939896b2ab6f781f7ae841ecdac', 'Changed the onLoad handler, so it now works with TMENU_LAYERS/GMENU_LAYERS and other extensions that uses the onLoad handler.', 'Umloud', 2000000, 0, 0),
