(3073, 0, 'freesite', 1, '0.1.0', 1448, 8, 'Freesite', 'A module which automates the creation of a new standard template websites including a backend user, filemounts and dummy page set.', 2, 0, 1, 1231153174, 'a:1:{s:7:"depends";a:4:{s:5:"typo3";s:11:"3.5.0-0.0.0";s:3:"php";s:11:"3.0.0-0.0.0";s:3:"cms";s:0:"";s:18:"tstemplate_ceditor";s:0:"";}}', 'Kasper Skrhj', 'kasper@typo3.com', 'inshadow', '4ea4eee21180f58b924af0fe98a187e5', ' Added the possibility to translate uids in Typoscript through the use of a marker.\r\n Added a Secondary Domain field', 'Curby Soft Multimedia', 1000, 0, 0),
