(3224, 0, 'gov_accessibility', 1, '0.1.0', 6162, 286, 'Accessible XHTML Template (gov.typo3.com)', 'This extension produces a multilingual, tableless xhtml template for your (gov-)site and makes sure your template and contents validate W3C XHTML, Bobby AAA, WAI, WCAG 1.0/2.0 and BITV Level 2 - This extension still needs a lot of cleaning up. Example Out', 1, 0, 4, 1093355170, 'a:1:{s:7:"depends";a:5:{s:5:"typo3";s:0:"";s:3:"php";s:0:"";s:3:"cms";s:0:"";s:18:"css_styled_content";s:0:"";s:18:"css_styled_imgtext";s:0:"";}}', 'Jan Wischnat', 'jan@wischnat.de', 'janman', '991b922cef76a9795427eefe7f50a08d', 'Added field to table pages: accesskey, (i used the alias-field before, no good idea...), Minor bug fixes', 'netzwerte.de', 1000, 0, 0),
