(3313, 0, 'gst_selectpro', 1, '1.0.0', 3888, 1467, 'Select Pro', 'Dynamically selects and displays a number of records according to free definable sql statements. Full output control including a link to the original content element. Comes with many predefined templates. Profund knowledge about MySql and Typo3 required.', 1, 0, 3, 1136191444, 'a:1:{s:7:"depends";a:3:{s:5:"typo3";s:0:"";s:3:"php";s:0:"";s:3:"cms";s:0:"";}}', 'Pascal Grttner', 'gruettner@gst-im.de', 'pascal', 'f5d5340cbbb43694b1a7664fcdc24fa9', 'Feature updates, esp. using GET-variables within queries.', 'GST Informationsmanagement GmbH', 1000000, 1, 0),
