(3783, 0, 'kb_conttable', 1, '0.4.1', 4515, 78, 'KB Content Table', 'Contentelement for enhanced table editing and content element integration', 2, 0, 2, 1342200841, 'a:1:{s:7:"depends";a:3:{s:5:"typo3";s:11:"4.7.0-0.0.0";s:3:"php";s:11:"5.0.0-0.0.0";s:3:"cms";s:0:"";}}', 'Bernhard Kraft', 'kraftb@seicht.co.at', 'kraftb', '29670a73d5d8ff82ea762fd4399bf380', ' Fixed bug: At some places the deprecated/removed method "t3lib_div::GPvar" has been used. Changed this occurences to use "t3lib_div::_GP"\n Fixed bug: The XCLASSing of "template.php" didnt work anymore because t3lib_div now caches the names of c', '', 4001, 0, 0),
