(3869, 0, 'ke_smallads', 1, '1.0.0', 7662, 214, 'Smallads', 'Submit, display and admin smallads (Classified advertisements, Announcements). FE Users can edit and delete ads they have submitted. Picture upload is possible. Easy to install.', 2, 0, 3, 1163694072, 'a:0:{}', 'Christian Buelter', 'buelter@kennziffer.com', 'kennziffer', '207cbf3b269913383771f3d3edbabc5f', 'New feature: Logged in users may now edit their own smallads or delete them.\nNew feature: Users may now set the time for the smallad until it disappears (in days).\nThe order of the smallads in the list view can now be set via typoscript.\nAn error message', '', 1000000, 0, 0),
