(4158, 0, 'ltg_googlesearch', 1, '0.1.1', 2134, 347, '[LTG] Google Search', 'Simple plugin to add google search to your site. With the advantage that search result is showed inline.', 1, 0, 3, 1124142050, 'a:1:{s:7:"depends";a:4:{s:5:"typo3";s:0:"";s:3:"php";s:0:"";s:3:"cms";s:0:"";s:10:"eim2nusoap";s:0:"";}}', 'R. van Twisk', 'ries@livetravelguides.com', 'ries', 'f9165a376456b307c8651a6f884fd6a4', ' - fixed one bug\r\n   Added a onErrorGotoGoogle  parameter, it will redirect to www.google.com whenever we dont get any response from google.', '', 1001, 0, 0),
