(4312, 0, 'mda_autopublish', 1, '0.0.0', 793, 52, 'AutoPublish', 'Automatically publishes client-cacheable pages as static html files as they are requested. It thus aims to increase FE performance.\r\nRequires at least Typo 3.8 with enabled simulateStaticDocuments and enabled cache-control headers.\r\n\r\nWarning: very alpha', 0, 0, 2, 1119794234, 'a:1:{s:7:"depends";a:2:{s:5:"typo3";s:0:"";s:3:"php";s:0:"";}}', 'Michael Husler', 'michael@akatose.de', 'haeusler', 'cdffaf2ec3f86aaa6a30f3ce41eaa825', 'initial release\r\n\r\nTo Do:\r\n- react properly on shift reload\r\n- find a better way to clear the cache than the curren combination of redirect and unlink\r\n- keep track of written files, so they can be removed, when FE cache is cleared', '', 0, 0, 0),
(4313, 0, 'mda_autopublish', 1, '0.0.1', 793, 722, 'AutoPublish', 'This extension automatically publishes client-cacheable pages as static\r\nhtml files as they are requested. If such a file exists, it can be\r\ndelivered directly by the web server without the need to start Typo3.\r\nIt thus aims to increase FE performance.\r\n\r', 0, 0, 2, 1119914322, 'a:1:{s:7:"depends";a:2:{s:5:"typo3";s:0:"";s:3:"php";s:0:"";}}', 'Michael Husler', 'michael@akatose.de', 'haeusler', '93f1608b959a70e187c9c61d4fa3519e', ' [add] react properly on shift reload (regenerate page)\r\n [change] directly include the Typo3 main index.php file, if a page must be regenerated (no redirects anymore)\r\n [doc] added some documentation in README.txt\r\n\r\n05-06-26 Michael Husler  michael', '', 1, 1, 0),
