(4367, 0, 'mh_accesskey', 1, '0.1.0', 1076, 223, 'Accesskey', 'Every page can get an accesskey which should be used within menu', 0, 0, 3, 1102942885, 'a:1:{s:7:"depends";a:3:{s:5:"typo3";s:11:"0.0.3-0.0.3";s:3:"php";s:11:"0.0.3-0.0.3";s:3:"cms";s:0:"";}}', 'Martin Holtz', 'typo3@martinholtz.de', 'maholtz', '76dd2023da4bd2d3878fbb30ccb3730a', 'should be easy to use now.\r\nIf there is a accesskey "i" with an title "Index" the result will be "uI/undex".\r\n\r\nTS Code:\r\ntemp.menuvorlage  TMENU\r\ntemp.menuvorlage {\r\n  IProcFunc  tx_mhaccesskey_pi1-user_mh_accesskey\r\n....\r\n\r\nShould be compatible w', '', 1000, 0, 0),
