(4370, 0, 'mh_accesskey', 1, '0.2.0', 1076, 38, 'Accesskey', 'Every page can get an accesskey which should be used within menu', 0, 0, 3, 1136655947, 'a:1:{s:7:"depends";a:3:{s:5:"typo3";s:11:"0.0.4-0.0.4";s:3:"php";s:11:"0.0.4-0.0.4";s:3:"cms";s:0:"";}}', 'Martin Holtz', 'typo3@martinholtz.de', 'maholtz', 'd9f9459cc5a28bd1b0e29327f70a6acb', 'Works now with doNotLinkIt\r\nTakes the subheader for the title-Tag', '', 2000, 0, 0),
(4371, 0, 'mh_accesskey', 1, '0.3.0', 1076, 37, 'Accesskey', 'Every page can get an accesskey which should be used within menu', 1, 0, 3, 1138623867, 'a:1:{s:7:"depends";a:3:{s:5:"typo3";s:11:"0.0.5-0.0.5";s:3:"php";s:11:"0.0.5-0.0.5";s:3:"cms";s:0:"";}}', 'Martin Holtz', 'typo3@martinholtz.de', 'maholtz', 'dc7c3df87a75e04e081d002e2b0844d8', 'Fixed bug wrong parsing with "ATagBeforeWrap1" \r\n\r\nAdded individual wrapping:\r\n Wraps the accesskey with i/i\r\nplugin.tx_mhaccesskey_pi1.wrap  i/i\r\n\r\n Added title-attribute output, does not\r\n work with subtitle//header only one field is allow', '', 3000, 0, 0),
(4372, 0, 'mh_accesskey', 1, '0.3.1', 1076, 13, 'Accesskey', 'Every page can get an accesskey which should be used within menu', 0, 0, 3, 1138626534, 'a:1:{s:7:"depends";a:3:{s:5:"typo3";s:11:"0.0.5-0.0.5";s:3:"php";s:11:"0.0.5-0.0.5";s:3:"cms";s:0:"";}}', 'Martin Holtz', 'typo3@martinholtz.de', 'maholtz', 'cbde8cf683bbe0f4927f2fdc16c9880a', 'fixed bug: only one latter will be wrapped now, if there is an upcase letter, it will be wrapped. The first lowercase letter will only be wrapped, if there is no upcase letter.\r\nImpressum  I[u]m[/u]pressum\r\nImpressuM  Impressu[u]M[/u]', '', 3001, 0, 0),
