(4562, 0, 'ms_survey', 1, '0.1.10', 2533, 260, 'Advanced Surveys', 'A survey generator with neat options, very customizable and easy to use.', 0, 0, 3, 1100283028, 'a:1:{s:7:"depends";a:3:{s:5:"typo3";s:11:"0.0.4-0.0.4";s:3:"php";s:11:"0.0.4-0.0.4";s:3:"cms";s:0:"";}}', 'Michael Scharkow', 'mscharkow@gmx.net', 'disappearer', 'bbdd0f5f7b7624202f946380778907c2', '- Lots of cleanups in the code, thanks Steffen Mller (xonx) for the great work\r\n- Confirmation-Emails can now be sent to those who successfully filled out the survey. Look at the new ts constants on how to activate this. You must include an item named "e', '', 1010, 0, 0),
