(4617, 0, 'mt_slide', 1, '0.2.1', 1615, 534, 'SlideImage', 'Slides an image in all directions with JavaScript mouseOver event. Size and repeating of the image and directions are configurable. Also creates and slides a banner of several images.', 2, 0, 3, 1127333401, 'a:1:{s:7:"depends";a:3:{s:5:"typo3";s:11:"3.6.5-0.0.6";s:3:"php";s:11:"4.3.9-0.0.6";s:3:"cms";s:0:"";}}', 'Martin Tschosnig', 'martin.tschosnig@udo.edu', 'matin', '10d2677bbf0ce8197f1a0ae0fe8f7712', 'now more than one image per page possible,  full mozilla support ,removed minor CSS-bug', '', 2001, 0, 0),
