(4674, 0, 'dmmjobcontrol', 1, '1.11.0', 5755, 34, 'JobControl', 'Job database to show (paginated) lists with job offers on your site, with a detailview, search function, apply form and RSS feeds. It is possible to show the most recent jobs and/or the searchform on all pages. Easy to setup yet powerful and flexible.', 2, -1, 3, 1197976227, 'a:0:{}', 'Kevin Renskers [DMM Development]', 'kevin@dauphin-mm.nl', 'abandoned_extensions', '7119ea66889b9d164dedb7b6c514a068', 'You can now make fields in the apply form required, and the long awaited "contact person" table has been added.', 'DMM Development', 1011000, 0, 0),
