(5000, 0, 'nsb_cat2menu', 1, '0.0.1', 1755, 1526, 'Category table to HMENU', 'Displays a menu from a category table to display the records in a compatible extension.', 0, 0, 3, 1133871973, 'a:1:{s:7:"depends";a:2:{s:5:"typo3";s:0:"";s:3:"php";s:0:"";}}', 'Sami Ben-yahia', 'sittinggoat@hotmail.com', 'sittinggoat', '15c28ffc50fdc87bf6c5905e1456beea', 'Allows the creation of a fe menu to navigate through a category tree.\r\nWorks with extensions that uses pivars to select records.\r\nSee ext_typoscript_setup', '', 1, 1, 0),
