(5003, 0, 'nsb_swf', 1, '0.1.1', 876, 12, 'flash plugin', 'not so basic flash plugin', 0, 0, 3, 1128341821, 'a:0:{}', 'Sami Ben-yahia', 'sittinggoat@hotmail.com', 'sittinggoat', 'ddb7e6d607aab4f0bcb4815fbad095e0', '  the alt content is a RECORDS instead of a CONTENT, removed the page selector from tceform\r\n  fixed - flexform language overlay\r\n  fixed - required version, now minor and revision are set to 0 if not defined\r\n  performance - the plugin is now a user', '', 1001, 0, 0),
