(5462, 0, 'popup_sitemap', 1, '1.0.1', 1632, 495, 'Popup-Sitemap', 'Adds 2 elements to menu/sitemap. 1: Generates link to Popup-Sitemap, 2: Generates Popup-Sitemap', 1, 0, 3, 1155483495, 'a:0:{}', 'Volker Golbig', 'vgolbig@machwert.de', 'mandelbrot', '1a7740112d68e641f2f6b7faf3ed689b', '1.  Implemented Mulilanguage Support (L-Parameter is appended if existent).\n2. Links open in parent window now, only if called from Popup-Sitemap Link (Before there was a problem if the sitemap was e.g. called by a google-link, as the sitemap-links opened', '', 1000001, 0, 0),
(5463, 0, 'popup_sitemap', 1, '1.0.2', 1632, 213, 'Popup-Sitemap', 'Adds 2 elements to menu/sitemap. 1: Generates link to Popup-Sitemap, 2: Generates Popup-Sitemap', 1, 0, 3, 1155485311, 'a:0:{}', 'Volker Golbig', 'vgolbig@machwert.de', 'mandelbrot', '37e4140747e9503499ea65f1aa9f8526', '1.  Implemented Mulilanguage Support (L-Parameter is appended if existent).\r\n\r\n2. Links open in parent window now, only if called from Popup-Sitemap Link (Before there was a problem if the sitemap was e.g. called by a google-link, as the sitemap-links ope', '', 1000002, 0, 0),
