(5508, 0, 'qcom_htmlcleaner', 1, '2.0.0', 8253, 761, 'Enhanced HTML cleaner', 'Extension to the built in HTML cleaner, basically defining valid Tags and Attributes for HTML. Enables you to automatically remove invalid tags / attributes.', 2, 0, 0, 1113853918, 'a:1:{s:7:"depends";a:3:{s:5:"typo3";s:11:"0.0.8-0.0.8";s:3:"php";s:11:"0.0.7-0.0.7";s:3:"cms";s:0:"";}}', 'Marc Whlken', 'woehlken@quadracom.de', 'maxhb', '09019229de90df4269921b9eaa04c4ba', 'Completly new configuration interface and  remapping of Windows-Latin1 chars to html entities - this should fix most problems created by text copied from MS-Office and other applications to the RTE.', 'Quadracom', 2000000, 0, 0),
