(6052, 0, 'rvt_adodb', 1, '0.1.0', 2272, 217, 'ADOdb Interface', 'Make a interface to ADOdb (for PHP programmers)', 0, 0, 4, 1168011205, 'a:1:{s:7:"depends";a:3:{s:5:"typo3";s:6:"4.0.0-";s:3:"php";s:11:"4.3.0-5.1.9";s:5:"adodb";s:0:"";}}', 'R. van Twisk', 'ries@vantwisk.nl', 'ries', '355945b44b9c4be7989bd546f0154c97', ' - Added creation of typo3temp/adodb_cache to store cache information when using CacheExecute(..) functions which can dramatically speed up teh applications on tables that are static or are not updated/inserted much.', '', 1000, 0, 0),
(6053, 0, 'rvt_adodb', 1, '0.1.1', 2272, 208, 'ADOdb Interface', 'Make a interface to ADOdb (for PHP programmers)', 0, 0, 4, 1170726909, 'a:1:{s:7:"depends";a:3:{s:5:"typo3";s:6:"4.0.0-";s:3:"php";s:11:"4.3.0-5.1.9";s:5:"adodb";s:0:"";}}', 'R. van Twisk', 'ries@vantwisk.nl', 'ries', '4f0134f9df38bb759575d00d8345416f', ' - Added a function to initialize the methods form ajax calls. Please check the function rvt_be_adodb_init().\r\nThis is needed because apaprently the call tslib_eidtools::connectDB(); doesnt call the hook connectToDB (which is a bug I think).', '', 1001, 0, 0),
(6054, 0, 'rvt_adodb', 1, '0.1.2', 2272, 257, 'ADOdb Interface', 'Make a interface to ADOdb (for PHP programmers)', 0, 0, 4, 1173537991, 'a:1:{s:7:"depends";a:3:{s:5:"typo3";s:11:"4.0.0-0.0.0";s:3:"php";s:11:"4.3.0-5.1.9";s:5:"adodb";s:0:"";}}', 'R. van Twisk', 'ries@vantwisk.nl', 'ries', '999625bcec586c4b8764fcdc1911fe39', 'For some reason there was all of a sudden a VERY old release on TER.\r\nThis update is is the current one and includes a option do a setDBinit for each separate DB. setDBinit will be executed against each DB after the connection has been made.', '', 1002, 0, 0),
(6055, 0, 'rvt_adodb', 1, '0.2.0', 2272, 94, 'ADOdb Interface', 'Make a interface to ADOdb (for PHP programmers)', 0, 0, 4, 1178230575, 'a:1:{s:7:"depends";a:3:{s:5:"typo3";s:6:"4.0.0-";s:3:"php";s:11:"4.3.0-5.1.9";s:5:"adodb";s:0:"";}}', 'R. van Twisk', 'ries@vantwisk.nl', 'ries', 'e9a5c7255a318aba0bf2b1d288a536d2', ' - Added a nice tool for PostgreSQL to create tablespaces and to move over all indexes from a given database to a different table space.\r\nThe interface looks kinda ugly right now but feel free to update it and send me a new / improved version. This was do', '', 2000, 0, 0),
(6056, 0, 'rvt_adodb', 1, '0.2.1', 2272, 41, 'ADOdb Interface', 'Make a interface to ADOdb (for PHP programmers)', 0, 0, 4, 1180719334, 'a:1:{s:7:"depends";a:3:{s:5:"typo3";s:11:"4.0.0-0.0.0";s:3:"php";s:11:"4.3.0-5.1.9";s:5:"adodb";s:0:"";}}', 'R. van Twisk', 'ries@vantwisk.nl', 'ries', 'd5bf1c2693276c3dca54b3faca1faca6', 'Add a __distructor (NOT PHP4!!) so when the script ends all connections gets closed again. We had sume problems during high load where PHP opened many many connections to the remote server. CLose the connection seems to solve that. \r\nAs always, see readm', '', 2001, 0, 0),
(6057, 0, 'rvt_adodb', 1, '0.2.2', 2272, 5, 'ADOdb Interface', 'Make a interface to ADOdb (for PHP programmers)', 0, 0, 4, 1187810918, 'a:1:{s:7:"depends";a:3:{s:5:"typo3";s:11:"4.0.0-0.0.0";s:3:"php";s:11:"4.3.0-5.1.9";s:5:"adodb";s:0:"";}}', 'R. van Twisk', 'ries@vantwisk.nl', 'ries', 'cc5745c2e1b8afeebb6403459f7f7c92', 'Small bug fix. if the host was not filled in, then under some conditions the system tries to connect to teh a apache DB, which doesnt exists - RVT', '', 2002, 0, 0),
