(6062, 0, 'rvt_permapi', 1, '0.2.0', 539, 147, '[RVT] Permissions API', 'This a a API  that provides a API for extention developers to create permissions for users and groups in there FE extention. The API is kept very simple. All permission settings are done in the backend using a clickmenu.', 1, 0, 4, 1112209497, 'a:1:{s:7:"depends";a:2:{s:5:"typo3";s:11:"3.7.2-3.7.2";s:3:"php";s:11:"4.1.2-4.1.2";}}', 'R. van Twisk', 'ries@vantwisk.nl', 'ries', '532aee43d3fdccc390433e2561938e83', '- Added a super user bit, if bit95 of MAIN is set, then the hasRight(..) function will return always true. Moving over to a 0.2.0 beta now.', 'R. van Twisk', 2000, 0, 0),
