(6104, 0, 'sb_akronymmanager', 1, '0.5.0', 3403, 1300, 'Akronymmanager', '', 1, -1, 2, 1143007650, 'a:0:{}', 'Thomas Wendt/Uwe Kiefer', 'kiefer@sunbeam-berlin.de', 'laborenz', '2eb2cd10cf4262a8035effaeddb4c557', '	 Phrases can be used now\r\n	 Hyphens can be used now\r\n	 Technical terms can be used for further markings\r\n	 Unnecessary span tags are avoided\r\n	 Considering forbidden tags\r\n	 Wrong behavior of single zeros is fixed', '', 5000, 0, 0),
