(6177, 0, 'sf_books', 1, '1.5.1', 2761, 72, 'Book Library', 'Ever tried to keep track on all your books? This library will help you to keep track of all books.', 2, 0, 4, 1253028888, 'a:1:{s:7:"depends";a:3:{s:5:"typo3";s:11:"4.1.0-0.0.0";s:3:"php";s:11:"5.0.0-0.0.0";s:3:"cms";s:0:"";}}', 'Sebastian Fischer', 'typo3@fischer.im', 'sfischer', 'dd0c66a5847e76a054c43c7bd22739c8', 'This update contains a new revision of the manual. It explains how to add rooms, which arent stored in database but are entries in pageTSconfig', '', 1005001, 0, 0),
