(6514, 0, 'sj_list_element', 1, '0.0.4', 2403, 222, 'ListElement(SJ)', 'Working with different Typo3 setups showed that every now and then RTE problems like ignoring certain html tags occured. Instead of adding typoscript fragments here and there this EXT can simply be used as a new page content type. The WYSIWYG option is th', 2, 0, 3, 1064831462, 'a:1:{s:7:"depends";a:3:{s:5:"typo3";s:0:"";s:3:"php";s:0:"";s:3:"cms";s:0:"";}}', 'Sven Gainsky', 'sgalinsky@fs-edv.de', 'sgalinsky', '256cedb395d42f65b78e79bd1e1a3a05', '', '', 4, 0, 0),
