(6641, 0, 'sourceopt', 1, '0.2.1', 11538, 649, 'SourceOptimization', 'Optimization of the final page: removal of new lines, quotes, moving css into external files and more', 1, 0, 2, 1073638230, 'a:1:{s:7:"depends";a:3:{s:5:"typo3";s:0:"";s:3:"php";s:0:"";s:3:"cms";s:0:"";}}', 'Boris Nicolai', 'boris.nicolai@andavida.com', 'spyker', 'eeb1de189b0beb536be56520dc0fbe95', 'New options: \r\n- Keep the copyright comment if you remove comments\r\n- Replace the clear.gif with a string eg. 1.gif\r\n- Remove attributes from the body\r\nFix:\r\n- Its now also possible to remove the blur-script under typo 3.6.0 RC1', '', 2001, 0, 0),
