(7217, 0, 'sys_workflows', 1, '2.0.1', 13434, 602, 'UserTask Center, Tasks, Workflow', 'Workflow system based upon the To-Do list. It allows a straight line workflow with redirects, groups, reviewers and an editor for finalizing.', 1, 0, 1, 1126177409, 'a:1:{s:7:"depends";a:3:{s:5:"typo3";s:0:"";s:3:"php";s:0:"";s:9:"sys_todos";s:0:"";}}', 'Christian Jul Jensen', 'julle@typo3.org', 'just2b', 'e835fb2e683cd67286e43d09da0aeab9', 'A bunch of minor bugs and annoyances have been fixed. And now a manual is included. Unfortunately I didnt manage to finish the manual before leaving for TYCON3. Will happen soon.', 'BEE3 ApS (http://BEE3.com)', 2000001, 0, 0),
