(7226, 0, 't3quixplorer', 1, '1.5.0', 40536, 1899, 'Typo3 Quixplorer', 'This extension introduces Quixplorer for Typo3! A backend module that makes you capable of exploring the files and folders of your entire webserver without using an external ftp client. Features: - Browse directories. - View and edit ascii files (supports', 2, -1, 1, 1123523673, 'a:1:{s:7:"depends";a:2:{s:5:"typo3";s:11:"3.6.4-0.0.2";s:3:"php";s:11:"0.0.4-0.0.4";}}', 'Mads Brunn', 'brunn@mail.dk', 'madsbrunn', '5898b4ae782398cd287365ae6567a43b', 'IMPORTANT UPDATE. Corrects some serious bugs. Please upgrade to this version if you already installed a previous version of Quixplorer! Additional changes: (1) Its no longer nescessary to set the home_dir. The extension works out of the box! (2) Editab', '', 1005000, 0, 0),
(7227, 0, 't3quixplorer', 1, '1.6.0', 40536, 6449, 'Typo3 Quixplorer', 'This extension introduces Quixplorer! A backend module that makes you capable of exploring the files and folders of your entire webserver. Browse directories. View and edit ascii files. Create, copy, move, delete, archive files and directories. Download a', 2, -1, 1, 1127298230, 'a:1:{s:7:"depends";a:2:{s:5:"typo3";s:11:"3.6.4-0.0.2";s:3:"php";s:11:"0.0.4-0.0.4";}}', 'Mads Brunn', 'brunn@mail.dk', 'madsbrunn', '5f909656d44ea0eb75496a43b6ca8122', '[] Fixed a bug that causes Quixplorer to display an error if the current folder contains non-readable elements. Thanks to Dimitrij Denissenko for providing the solution [] You can now type the path you want to go to instead of clicking your way through', '', 1006000, 0, 0),
(7228, 0, 't3quixplorer', 1, '1.7.0', 40536, 19339, 'Typo3 Quixplorer', 'This extension introduces Quixplorer! A backend module that makes you capable of exploring the files and folders of your entire webserver. Browse directories. View and edit ascii files. Create, copy, move, delete, archive files and directories. Download a', 2, -1, 1, 1171007345, 'a:1:{s:7:"depends";a:2:{s:3:"php";s:6:"3.0.0-";s:5:"typo3";s:6:"3.6.4-";}}', 'Mads Brunn', 'brunn@mail.dk', 'madsbrunn', '3b7a0193254440b6cf3bf71d5c538450', 'Lots of bugfixes and new features. See changelog.txt for details.', '', 1007000, 0, 0),
