(7314, 0, 'tcdirectmail', 1, '0.2.0', 7011, 247, 'TypoConsult Directmail', 'Directmail extension with simple to setup and use mailer, and a very extensible recipient configuration.', 0, -1, 4, 1139906408, 'a:0:{}', 'Daniel Schledermann', 'daniel@typoconsult.dk', 'daniel_schledermann', '0e13d4fb3b7d14017479c4004ff818fb', 'Code rework:\r\n- Everything inside classes now.\r\n- Unused files removed.\r\n\r\nCouple of bug fixes:\r\n- Line separator changed to from rn to n. Seems to be making trouble with Novell Groupwise. Hope it doesnt screw up anything else now. Seems to be working', 'TypoConsult A/S', 2000, 0, 0),
