(7358, 0, 'templavoila', 1, '0.6.0', 313479, 3418, 'TemplaVoila!', 'An alternative template engine for TYPO3. Features include a mapping tool for creating templates, a new page module, the ability to create flexible content elements and an API for developers.', 1, 0, 4, 1140705360, 'a:2:{s:7:"depends";a:5:{s:3:"php";s:6:"4.3.0-";s:5:"typo3";s:6:"3.9.9-";s:18:"static_info_tables";s:0:"";s:3:"cms";s:0:"";s:4:"lang";s:0:"";}s:9:"conflicts";a:3:{s:15:"kb_tv_clipboard";s:6:"-0.1.0";s:14:"templavoila_cw";s:6:"-0.1.0";s:12:"eu_tradvoila";s:6:"-0.1.0";}}', 'Kasper Skrhj / Robert Lemke', 'kasper@typo3.com / robert@typo3.org', 'alex_schnitzler', '02136a7a7cd99a5ac83a6adbed684486', 'Recent snapshot from CVS. Dont use this in a production enviroment! Works only with TYPO3 4.0beta3 or higher. There are some known problems with workspaces and localization.', 'TYPO3', 6000, 0, 0),
