(7435, 0, 'tfc_splashpage', 1, '0.0.1', 180, 175, 'TFC Splash Page', 'Allows a splash page for the site. Access is controlled by a cookie.', 1, 0, 2, 1131131205, 'a:1:{s:7:"depends";a:2:{s:5:"typo3";s:0:"";s:3:"php";s:0:"";}}', 'Tony McCallie', 'TonyMcCallie@tfchurch.org', 'tonymccallie', 'ceb293af959598206f1d410d17a5f61f', 'Initial Upload\r\n(Cookie currently set to 24 hours, edit ext_loconf.php to change)\r\nTo use:\r\n1. Install Extension\r\n2. On main template TS enter:\r\npage  PAGE\r\npage.typeNum  0\r\npage.10  TEXT\r\npage.10.value  SPLASH_CONTENT\r\n[userFunc  tx_tfcsplashpage_se', '', 1, 1, 0),
