(7508, 0, 'th_ultracards', 1, '0.2.0', 2191, 18, 'ultraCards', 'This is a powerful eCard extension. It allowes the fe-user to compose his own cards from a pool of front- and backgroundimages.\r\nThe extension also collects some statistics about the sended and viewed cards.\r\nPlease notice, that this extension is not read', 1, -1, 3, 1088341267, 'a:1:{s:7:"depends";a:3:{s:5:"typo3";s:11:"0.0.2-0.0.2";s:3:"php";s:11:"0.0.2-0.0.2";s:3:"cms";s:0:"";}}', 'Thomas Hempel (n@work Internet Informations Systeme)', 'thomas@work.de', 'matrikz', 'b31fca69388899e77234c615d5592bd6', ' some improvements in the pi1/locallang.php\r\n little changes in button behavior.\r\n Fixed some IE bugs\r\n some little other changes and fixes.\r\n------------------\r\n The extension is useable now. Feel free to send me you comments', '', 2000, 0, 0),
