(7690, 0, 'tm_contentaccess', 1, '0.19.5', 10473, 276, 'Content Access and Extended Interface Control', 'Adds new access control features for individual content elements. In addition this plugin adds new TypoScript configuration options and CSS classes for many core files of Typo3 in order to customize the BE interface and frontend editing interface. Note. T', 1, 0, 0, 1153680952, 'a:0:{}', 'Tapio Markula', 'tapio.markula@atwebteam.com', 'tmarkula', '145a7b7661d44477608e4f72eb70509b', 'A small preset bugfix.', 'www.atwebteam.com', 19005, 0, 0),
(7691, 0, 'tm_contentaccess', 1, '0.19.6', 10473, 218, 'Content Access and Extended Interface Control', 'Adds new access control features for individual content elements. In addition this plugin adds new TypoScript configuration options and CSS classes for many core files of Typo3 in order to customize the BE interface and frontend editing interface. Note. T', 1, 0, 0, 1154511881, 'a:0:{}', 'Tapio Markula', 'tapio.markula@atwebteam.com', 'tmarkula', 'a22ee264ef3db5850d945a411c0f775c', 'tiny fixes', 'www.atwebteam.com', 19006, 0, 0),
(7692, 0, 'tm_contentaccess', 1, '0.19.7', 10473, 196, 'Content Access and Extended Interface Control', 'Adds new access control features for individual content elements. In addition this plugin adds new TypoScript configuration options and CSS classes for many core files of Typo3 in order to customize the BE interface and frontend editing interface. Note. T', 1, 0, 0, 1154949196, 'a:0:{}', 'Tapio Markula', 'tapio.markula@atwebteam.com', 'tmarkula', '7f33572d2eee2be33df5a0bfe46c8b85', 'Tried to make both compatible with Typo4 4.0.x and Typo3 3.8.1 - all such XCLASSES checked, which relate with core classes. Because they need version-related conditions, bugs may exist. Corcerning relation to other plugins, read the manual.', 'www.atwebteam.com', 19007, 0, 0),
(7693, 0, 'tm_contentaccess', 1, '0.19.8', 10473, 216, 'Content Access and Extended Interface Control', 'Adds new access control features for individual content elements. In addition this plugin adds new TypoScript configuration options and CSS classes for many core files of Typo3 in order to customize the BE interface and frontend editing interface. Note. T', 1, 0, 0, 1155190183, 'a:0:{}', 'Tapio Markula', 'tapio.markula@atwebteam.com', 'tmarkula', 'b719f6973a854d33b02f3c3d321d1407', 'Tried to make compatible with kb_nescefe, compatible with both Typo4 4.0.1 and Typo3 3.8.1 - all such XCLASSES checked, which relate with core classes. Because they need version-related conditions, bugs may exist - please report me directly bugs. Corcerni', 'www.atwebteam.com', 19008, 0, 0),
(7694, 0, 'tm_contentaccess', 1, '0.19.9', 10473, 210, 'Content Access and Extended Interface Control', 'Adds new access control features for individual content elements. In addition this plugin adds new TypoScript configuration options and CSS classes for many core files of Typo3 in order to customize the BE interface and frontend editing interface. Note. T', 1, 0, 0, 1155212212, 'a:0:{}', 'Tapio Markula', 'tapio.markula@atwebteam.com', 'tmarkula', 'ac27c6929ee556d1ec5cd0c980351e0d', 'Added clearer creation new pages and content elements. Tried to make compatible with kb_nescefe, compatible with both Typo4 4.0.1 and Typo3 3.8.1 - all such XCLASSES checked, which relate with core classes. Because they need version-related conditions, bu', 'www.atwebteam.com', 19009, 0, 0),
(7695, 0, 'tm_contentaccess', 1, '1.0.0', 10473, 308, 'Content Access and Extended Interface Control', 'Adds new access control features for individual content elements. In addition this plugin adds new TypoScript configuration options and CSS classes for many core files of Typo3 in order to customize the BE interface and frontend editing interface. Note. T', 1, 0, 0, 1155929918, 'a:0:{}', 'Tapio Markula', 'tapio.markula@atwebteam.com', 'tmarkula', '5b1624759ab6359dd17b96006303ea09', 'Tiny preset changes. Added TS Config for pages in order to select, if the content element wizard of the standard page module or TemplaVoila has been used, when TemplaVoila has been installed. Added clearer creation new pages and content elements and new p', 'www.atwebteam.com', 1000000, 0, 0),
(7696, 0, 'tm_contentaccess', 1, '1.0.1', 10473, 145, 'Content Access and Extended Interface Control', 'Adds new access control features for individual content elements. In addition this plugin adds new TypoScript configuration options and CSS classes for many core files of Typo3 in order to customize the BE interface and frontend editing interface. Note. T', 1, 0, 0, 1156838383, 'a:0:{}', 'Tapio Markula', 'tapio.markula@atwebteam.com', 'tmarkula', 'dd666e0d247b7397edbb644b0cecb4cc', 'Made compatible with pixe_feediting. Some code security fixes. Replaced using direct $_GET and $_POST variables using corresponding api functions. Added also bug fixes for erotea_date2cal. Using this plugin erotea_date2cal works also in the QuickEd', 'www.atwebteam.com', 1000001, 0, 0),
(7697, 0, 'tm_contentaccess', 1, '1.0.2', 10473, 298, 'Content Access and Extended Interface Control', 'Adds new access control features for individual content elements. In addition this plugin adds new TypoScript configuration options and CSS classes for many core files of Typo3 in order to customize the BE interface and frontend editing interface. Note. T', 1, 0, 0, 1158823071, 'a:0:{}', 'Tapio Markula', 'tapio.markula@atwebteam.com', 'tmarkula', '5d03a28d6ece56cc81ccdde80224bfb1', 'Made compatible with pixe_feediting and made some improvement for it. Deleted an option because corresponding option will be added to skin_grey_2. Made also some other configuration changes. Please delete existing configuration from localconf.php!', 'www.atwebteam.com', 1000002, 0, 0),
(7698, 0, 'tm_contentaccess', 1, '1.0.3', 10473, 244, 'Content Access and Extended Interface Control', 'Adds new access control features for individual content elements. In addition this plugin adds new TypoScript configuration options and CSS classes for many core files of Typo3 in order to customize the BE interface and frontend editing interface. Note. T', 2, 0, 0, 1159207092, 'a:0:{}', 'Tapio Markula', 'tapio.markula@atwebteam.com', 'tmarkula', '6256b334f2aee81cbf1f9aca87258f13', 'Fixed tiny path bug and added better support for erotea_date2cal or date2cal. As a request of a user added mod.web_layout.disableAjax for TS config for users/user groups. Made compatible with pixe_feediting and made some improvement for it. Delete', 'www.atwebteam.com', 1000003, 0, 0),
(7699, 0, 'tm_contentaccess', 1, '1.0.4', 10473, 345, 'Content Access and Extended Interface Control', 'Adds new access control features for individual content elements. In addition this plugin adds new TypoScript configuration options and CSS classes for many core files of Typo3 in order to customize the BE interface and frontend editing interface. Note. T', 2, 0, 0, 1162971024, 'a:0:{}', 'Tapio Markula', 'tapio.markula@atwebteam.com', 'tmarkula', '31a9f56b54e9a25d97c3c4501e486fff', 'Fixed some frontend editing related bugs.', 'www.atwebteam.com', 1000004, 0, 0),
(7700, 0, 'tm_contentaccess', 1, '1.0.5', 10473, 302, 'Content Access and Extended Interface Control', 'Adds new access control features for individual content elements. In addition this plugin adds new TypoScript configuration options and CSS classes for many core files of Typo3 in order to customize the BE interface and frontend editing interface. Note. T', 2, 0, 0, 1164648304, 'a:0:{}', 'Tapio Markula', 'tapio.markula@atwebteam.com', 'tmarkula', 'dc31ef19275a9bdb384265f50be3bd6c', 'Fixed a TemplaVoila related bug. Added possibility to create new buttons for editing records and better possibility to define alternative starting page (needs skin_grey_2 installed).', 'www.atwebteam.com', 1000005, 0, 0),
(7701, 0, 'tm_contentaccess', 1, '1.0.6', 10473, 220, 'Content Access and Extended Interface Control', 'Adds new access control features for individual content elements. In addition this plugin adds new TypoScript configuration options and CSS classes for many core files of Typo3 in order to customize the BE interface and frontend editing interface. Note. T', 2, 0, 0, 1164786226, 'a:0:{}', 'Tapio Markula', 'tapio.markula@atwebteam.com', 'tmarkula', '12399376341e66eeb885e31de9238976', 'Finally fixed a TemplaVoila and a FE editing related bug. Added possibility to create new buttons for editing records. Sorry, but TemlaVoila fix was missing last time.', 'www.atwebteam.com', 1000006, 0, 0),
(7702, 0, 'tm_contentaccess', 1, '2.0.0', 10473, 479, 'Content Access and Extended Interface Control', 'Adds new access control features for individual content elements. In addition this plugin adds new TypoScript configuration options and CSS classes for many core files of Typo3 in order to customize the BE interface and frontend editing interface. Tm_cont', 1, 0, 0, 1168264648, 'a:0:{}', 'Tapio Markula', 'tapio.markula@atwebteam.com', 'tmarkula', '0bc171277b24642cd357e36fd819c29a', 'This update has some tiny bug fixes. Made remarkable improvement for TemplaVoila 1.x and some improvements for frontend editing. Update also skin_grey_2, if you use it. Disabled support for TemplaVoila 0.4 and erotea_date2cal (use date2cal instead).', 'www.xetpoint.com', 2000000, 0, 0),
(7703, 0, 'tm_contentaccess', 1, '2.1.0', 10473, 259, 'Content Access and Extended Interface Control', 'Adds new access control features for individual content elements. In addition this plugin adds new TypoScript configuration options and CSS classes for many core files of Typo3 in order to customize the BE interface and frontend editing interface. Tm_cont', 1, 0, 0, 1173829186, 'a:0:{}', 'Tapio Markula', 'tapio.markula@atwebteam.com', 'tmarkula', 'be9b699de13409f8f74830b6de80630d', 'Made compatible with TemplaVoila 1.3 and Typo3 4.1. Made also improvements for frontend editing. Last time I send incorrect files - hopefully now correct.', 'www.xetpoint.com', 2001000, 0, 0),
