(8016, 0, 'newsletter', 1, '2.3.3', 36, 0, 'Newsletter', 'Send any pages as Newsletter and provide statistics on opened emails and clicked links.', 2, 0, 1, 1428499031, 'a:1:{s:7:"depends";a:4:{s:3:"cms";s:0:"";s:3:"php";s:11:"5.3.7-0.0.0";s:5:"typo3";s:13:"6.1.0-7.99.99";s:9:"scheduler";s:5:"6.1.0";}}', 'Ecodev', 'contact@ecodev.ch', 'ecodev', '9d442be2806c48aeb6b76e3d5cbca39c', 'Release version 2.3.3\n\nThis version keep the focus on unit tests to strengthen the code base.\nIn doing so we fixed several issues, as well as issues reported by users:\n\n Compatibility with TYPO3 7.1\n Using more than one advanced marker messed up the co', 'Ecodev', 2003003, 0, 0),
