(8240, 0, 'wa_printlinkpage', 1, '1.0.0', 5871, 82, 'Printlink Page', 'Make a new Pagetype to open the current Page as Print Page (typeNum98).\r\n\r\n1.) Install the Extension in the EM.\r\n\r\n2.) Define a Template with typeNum98\r\n\r\n3.) Make a Menu like this\r\n  10  HMENU\r\n  10 {\r\n    special  userfunction\r\n    special.userFunc', 2, 0, 2, 1105798644, 'a:1:{s:7:"depends";a:3:{s:5:"typo3";s:0:"";s:3:"php";s:0:"";s:3:"cms";s:0:"";}}', 'Dieter Bosli', 'ter@webactive.ch', 'dbosli', '17c19319ace09b71c0af0bb651c8b39c', '', 'webActive', 1000000, 0, 0),
