(8305, 0, 'wec_connector', 1, '1.5.0', 3489, 144, 'WEC Prayer Connector', 'Connecting people with prayer requests as well as other needs and services such as job board, help board, posting board, business directory, etc.', 2, 0, 3, 1148068897, 'a:0:{}', 'Web-Empowered Church Team', 'connector@webempoweredchurch.org', 'webempoweredchurch', '8648c80691dda090449ba9b928da6b62', 'Fixed email problem with htmlspecialchars removed. Fixed CSS problems with entry form/Add Entry and choose category. Added all text to locallang file and put in single quotes. Added extra security handling for delete & moderate.', 'Foundation For Evangelism', 1005000, 0, 0),
