(8310, 0, 'wec_connector', 1, '1.6.1', 3489, 228, 'WEC Prayer Connector', 'Connecting people with requests or needs or services such as prayer requests, job board, help board, need posting board, business directory, etc.', 2, 0, 3, 1174509615, 'a:0:{}', 'Web-Empowered Church Team', 'connector(at)webempoweredchurch.org', 'webempoweredchurch', '088c2f6d0fc4ab04a1e08d72ac3a3f6b', 'Fixed category selection db query and handling. Improved numlinks_allowed spam checking so http:// is considered a link. Allow to pre-set values in form. Minor fixes in template.', 'Foundation For Evangelism', 1006001, 0, 0),
