(8316, 0, 'wec_connector', 1, '1.7.0', 3489, 42, 'WEC Prayer Connector', 'Connecting people with requests, needs or services such as prayer requests, job board, help board, need/help board, business directory, etc.', 2, 0, 3, 1206032656, 'a:0:{}', 'Web-Empowered Church Team', 'connector(at)webempoweredchurch.org', 'webempoweredchurch', '9e62ceb64447f9875ddaa4382e907527', 'Added Static Templates (must add to ext template). Made message and subject not required  you can choose.	Can set delay time (or remove) check for duplicate posts. Can list subscribers if admin. Emails better formatted.', 'Foundation For Evangelism', 1007000, 0, 0),
