(8318, 0, 'wec_connector', 1, '1.7.2', 3489, 59, 'WEC Prayer Connector', 'Connecting people with requests, needs or services. Examples of use: prayer requests, job board, help board, need/help board, business directory, etc.', 2, 0, 3, 1211379633, 'a:1:{s:7:"depends";a:1:{s:3:"cms";s:0:"";}}', 'Web-Empowered Church Team', 'connector(at)webempoweredchurch.org', 'webempoweredchurch', 'dc8e6183334b97248da2334b44f4d206', 'Fix warning message for PHP 5. Fixed email issues and updated formatting. Allow https/ssl support.  Support UTF-8. XHTML improvements. Other minor fixes.', 'Christian Technology Ministries International Inc.', 1007002, 0, 0),
