(8358, 0, 'wec_discussion', 1, '0.9.1', 11555, 15, 'WEC Discussion Forum', 'Allows a discussion forum, blog, or comments on a page.', 1, -1, 3, 1131755178, 'a:1:{s:7:"depends";a:3:{s:5:"typo3";s:0:"";s:3:"php";s:0:"";s:3:"cms";s:0:"";}}', 'Web-Empowered Church Team', 'discussion@webempoweredchurch.org', 'webempoweredchurch', 'af80155326c00ee9bdcf479c7d4676f9', 'Fixed security issue with forms, delete bug, and minor template issues.', 'Foundation For Evangelism', 9001, 0, 0),
(8359, 0, 'wec_discussion', 1, '0.9.2', 11555, 182, 'WEC Discussion Forum', 'Allows a discussion forum, blog, or comments on a page.', 1, -1, 3, 1137700890, 'a:1:{s:7:"depends";a:3:{s:5:"typo3";s:0:"";s:3:"php";s:0:"";s:3:"cms";s:0:"";}}', 'Web-Empowered Church Team', 'discussion@webempoweredchurch.org', 'webempoweredchurch', 'd181411bc35a2ae4561c844997d70393', 'Added Dutch translation (thanks Onno S!). \r\nRefined language file and template. \r\nAdded date formatting option in language file. Updated doco file  especially Template File table', 'Foundation For Evangelism', 9002, 0, 0),
(8360, 0, 'wec_discussion', 1, '1.0.0', 11555, 80, 'WEC Discussion Forum', 'Allows a discussion forum, blog, or comments on a page.', 1, -1, 3, 1138388460, 'a:1:{s:7:"depends";a:3:{s:5:"typo3";s:11:"3.7.1-3.8.2";s:3:"php";s:11:"4.2.4-5.0.6";s:3:"cms";s:0:"";}}', 'Web-Empowered Church Team', 'discussion@webempoweredchurch.org', 'webempoweredchurch', '4157473a5a5c5a5d34c67031a4ad00c3', 'Removed tx_wecdiscussion_user table and code  not used.  Fixed problem if have a discussion and a preview of a discussion on same page (esp. when used in conjunction with WEC_Devo). Redid template and CSS so better fits in most templates. Fixed process m', 'Foundation For Evangelism', 1000000, 0, 0),
(8361, 0, 'wec_discussion', 1, '1.0.1', 11555, 116, 'WEC Discussion Forum', 'Allows a discussion forum, blog, or comments on a page.', 1, -1, 3, 1139000513, 'a:1:{s:7:"depends";a:3:{s:5:"typo3";s:11:"3.7.1-3.8.2";s:3:"php";s:11:"4.2.4-5.0.6";s:3:"cms";s:0:"";}}', 'Web-Empowered Church Team', 'discussion@webempoweredchurch.org', 'webempoweredchurch', 'e0fa3ed6e8f4445519ea41c54b33f1eb', 'Fixed problem with show comments and not needing a subject. Also added a notify_email in Flexform so can receive an email everytime a new post or reply is added to forum.', 'Foundation For Evangelism', 1000001, 0, 0),
(8362, 0, 'wec_discussion', 1, '1.1.0', 11555, 267, 'WEC Discussion Forum', 'Allows a discussion forum, blog, or comments on a page.', 1, -1, 3, 1142449070, 'a:0:{}', 'Web-Empowered Church Team', 'discussion@webempoweredchurch.org', 'webempoweredchurch', '4bd6e51ea9dd65df382ddac028c5785e', 'Fixed security issues with Postvars and SQL. Added startingPoint option for Flexform so can specify storage page. Allow so can add as plugin type for pageContent new content element.', 'Foundation For Evangelism', 1001000, 0, 0),
(8363, 0, 'wec_discussion', 1, '1.1.1', 11555, 391, 'WEC Discussion Forum', 'Allows a discussion forum, blog, or comments on a page.', 1, -1, 3, 1143224364, 'a:0:{}', 'Web-Empowered Church Team', 'discussion@webempoweredchurch.org', 'webempoweredchurch', 'f1b665f563070e091e6e1de02716054f', 'Made XHTML compliant.', 'Foundation For Evangelism', 1001001, 0, 0),
(8364, 0, 'wec_discussion', 1, '1.2.0', 11555, 327, 'WEC Discussion Forum', 'Allows a discussion forum, blog, or comments on a page.', 1, -1, 3, 1147980008, 'a:0:{}', 'Web-Empowered Church Team', 'discussion@webempoweredchurch.org', 'webempoweredchurch', '9325ff4ac850a1e632f331823245067a', 'Made template XHTML compliant.  Made so Post Message button can be turned off (i.e., if Blog and not a user). Added German translation (thanks Franz) and Finnish translation (thanks Katja). Fixed problems with two	htmlspecialchars on post. Fixed issues wi', 'Foundation For Evangelism', 1002000, 0, 0),
(8365, 0, 'wec_discussion', 1, '1.2.1', 11555, 398, 'WEC Discussion Forum', 'Allows a discussion forum, blog, or comments on a page.', 1, -1, 3, 1151098763, 'a:0:{}', 'Web-Empowered Church Team', 'discussion@webempoweredchurch.org', 'webempoweredchurch', 'a22a9d65811909dddd5c9df40a5b75b9', 'Fixed problem with previews so now they respect Display Amount (Weekly/Last 7 Days/Last 10/etc). Fixed bug with toggle comments -- now added separate option for that. Changed all locallang double quotes to single.', 'Foundation For Evangelism', 1002001, 0, 0),
(8366, 0, 'wec_discussion', 1, '1.2.2', 11555, 162, 'WEC Discussion Forum', 'Allows a discussion forum, blog, or comments on a page.', 1, -1, 3, 1159387265, 'a:0:{}', 'Web-Empowered Church Team', 'discussion@webempoweredchurch.org', 'webempoweredchurch', 'f498bc7f92cef6decb8c487a32b97138', 'Fixed preview so does not show moderated. Fixed bug with dropdown so showcat is appended correctly. Also extension was accidentally set to shy - now it is outgoing!', 'Foundation For Evangelism', 1002002, 0, 0),
(8367, 0, 'wec_discussion', 1, '1.2.3', 11555, 581, 'WEC Discussion Forum', 'Allows a discussion forum, blog, or comments on a page.', 1, -1, 3, 1159808635, 'a:0:{}', 'Web-Empowered Church Team', 'discussion@webempoweredchurch.org', 'webempoweredchurch', 'a8312e534f47496ae77a73564675c2fe', 'fixed minor bug in last update.', 'Foundation For Evangelism', 1002003, 0, 0),
(8368, 0, 'wec_discussion', 1, '1.3.0', 11555, 332, 'WEC Discussion Forum', 'Allows a discussion forum, blog, or comments on a page.', 2, -1, 3, 1170269157, 'a:0:{}', 'Web-Empowered Church Team', 'discussion@webempoweredchurch.org', 'webempoweredchurch', 'aa8e2ad1c211934a985f75c1c55d1f01', 'Revised Flexform (have to set options again on upgrade  save your options if customized). Added Spam Control options like image and text captcha, and HTML & link control.  Added search capability. Made dates use strftime instead of date() so can localiz', 'Foundation For Evangelism', 1003000, 0, 0),
(8369, 0, 'wec_discussion', 1, '1.3.1', 11555, 265, 'WEC Discussion Forum', 'Allows a discussion forum, blog, or comments on a page.', 2, -1, 3, 1172289073, 'a:0:{}', 'Web-Empowered Church Team', 'discussion@webempoweredchurch.org', 'webempoweredchurch', '7cbbcfd2c27a44b53b5fc763836ee404', 'Fixed bug with category display and selecting. Fixed bug under certain configs with ReplyForm url.\r\nFixed editing message with image bug. Added Spanish translation (thanks Diego L!). Put spam words in constants. Fixed several minor bugs.', 'Foundation For Evangelism', 1003001, 0, 0),
(8370, 0, 'wec_discussion', 1, '1.3.2', 11555, 576, 'WEC Discussion Forum', 'Allows a discussion forum, blog, or comments on a page.', 2, -1, 3, 1172892657, 'a:0:{}', 'Web-Empowered Church Team', 'discussion@webempoweredchurch.org', 'webempoweredchurch', '345d66627f1f0316e35798b6f0c5f1a7', 'Fixed bugs in archive display & handling. Fixed bug in spam control / filter.', 'Foundation For Evangelism', 1003002, 0, 0),
(8371, 0, 'wec_discussion', 1, '1.4.0', 11555, 139, 'WEC Discussion Forum', 'Allows a discussion forum, blog, or comments on a page.', 2, -1, 3, 1177098149, 'a:0:{}', 'Web-Empowered Church Team', 'discussion(at)webempoweredchurch.org', 'webempoweredchurch', '98fdc4ccd22293d3c95039997ce322ff', 'Added RSS feed capability. Added single view of message (with comments) for search and preview. Archive link shows whole month. Can set length to display of posts (adds "more..." if too long). Can spam protect just comments (i.e. for blog). Updated templa', 'Foundation For Evangelism', 1004000, 0, 0),
(8372, 0, 'wec_discussion', 1, '1.4.1', 11555, 456, 'WEC Discussion Forum', 'Can have a discussion forum, a blog, or add comments to a page. Supports RSS feed and preview.', 2, -1, 3, 1178204306, 'a:0:{}', 'Web-Empowered Church Team', 'discussion(at)webempoweredchurch.org', 'webempoweredchurch', '46b36358ac9dfe2a2095f7d32128e2d9', 'Fixed subscribe feature -- now sends out emails correctly. Added title to RSS so "Subscribe to TITLE". Fixed preview back pid bug. Enhanced character length (More...) so respects div and p tags. Added name to filter.\r\n', 'Foundation For Evangelism', 1004001, 0, 0),
(8373, 0, 'wec_discussion', 1, '1.5.0', 11555, 179, 'WEC Discussion Forum', 'Can have a discussion forum, a blog, or add comments to a page. Supports RSS feed and preview of posts.', 2, -1, 3, 1181933191, 'a:0:{}', 'Web-Empowered Church Team', 'discussion(at)webempoweredchurch.org', 'webempoweredchurch', 'c0e908b34225ec11ed8969778162d8ff', 'Added Archive view and fixed archive bugs. Updated template including setting for width. Can restrict posts by usergroup. Records can now be hidden. Added converter from TIMTAB to wec_discussion format. Added generic hide/show toggle for messages. Added F', 'Foundation For Evangelism', 1005000, 0, 0),
(8374, 0, 'wec_discussion', 1, '1.5.1', 11555, 1512, 'WEC Discussion Forum', 'Can have a discussion forum, a blog, or add comments to a page. Supports RSS feed and preview of posts.', 2, -1, 3, 1183577597, 'a:0:{}', 'Web-Empowered Church Team', 'discussion(at)webempoweredchurch.org', 'webempoweredchurch', '0fecd8782d074bb5740e30ac5737893d', 'BUGFIX: message length, fixed RSS feeds with RTE content. ADDED: can now have link to single view in listing. Added title to archive/category listing. Archive shows selected & can put subscribe to feed at bottom. UPDATED: template & CSS. Made XHTML comp', 'Foundation For Evangelism', 1005001, 0, 0),
