(8927, 0, 'vjchat', 1, '0.3.0', 10261, 66, 'AJAX Chat', 'A rich featured ajax chat for TYPO3.', 1, -1, 3, 1195433539, 'a:0:{}', 'Vincent Tietz', 'vincent.tietz@vj-media.de', 'vtietz', 'eee34081567a6c6532b3b595f7fe32d6', 'If updating please review your plugins (flex) form(s), because some settings moved to another tab. The main improvements are customizable userlist and tooltip and extended room overview. See ChangeLog (e.g. in the documentation) for more details.  \n', '', 3000, 0, 0),
