(8967, 0, 'skin_grey_2', 1, '0.0.11', 20310, 251, 'Gray-orange-green skin for TYPO3 3.8.x-4.0.x', 'Flexible skin for TYPO3 3.8.x-4.0.x. Allows installation level and user/user group level congifigurations. It is for example possible to use your own module icons.', 2, 0, 4, 1151415817, 'a:0:{}', 'Lasse Nrby/Tapio Markula', 'zamiams@hotmail.com /tapio.markula@atwebteam.com', 'tmarkula', '650f21de36dec1991319beb9a7a5630c', 'More descriptive alternative Windows XP style module icons. Some previous chages: added localization for some record types (Backend user, Backend usergroup and Filemount), changed icons in ver. 0.9.0 has been put into a reserve folder, added possibility t', '', 11, 0, 0),
