(8969, 0, 'skin_grey_2', 1, '0.1.0', 20310, 303, 'Gray-orange-green skin for TYPO3 3.8.x-4.0.x', 'Flexible skin for TYPO3 3.8.x-4.0.x. Allows installation level and user/user group level congifigurations. It is for example possible to use your own module icons.', 2, 0, 4, 1152434982, 'a:0:{}', 'Lasse Nrby/Tapio Markula', 'zamiams@hotmail.com /tapio.markula@atwebteam.com', 'tmarkula', '8a43c2b0fbb5159da51b10783f7f6328', 'Added personal user setup options in order to configure the skin. Changes also the default behavior of user setup. If administrator has overrided some options, users dont even have possibility to try to change overrided values. Some previous chages: adde', '', 1000, 0, 0),
(8970, 0, 'skin_grey_2', 1, '0.1.1', 20310, 378, 'Gray-orange-green skin for TYPO3 3.8.x-4.0.x', 'Flexible skin for TYPO3 3.8.x-4.0.x. Allows installation level and user/user group level congifigurations. It is for example possible to use your own module icons.', 2, 0, 4, 1153681861, 'a:0:{}', 'Lasse Nrby/Tapio Markula', 'zamiams@hotmail.com /tapio.markula@atwebteam.com', 'tmarkula', '9f34ae5b1509f75f651ea314332fb1f9', 'Added more personal user setup options in order to configure the skin. Supported languages for extra language labels: English, Finnish and German (partial support). Changes also the default behavior of user setup. If administrator has overrided some optio', '', 1001, 0, 0),
(8971, 0, 'skin_grey_2', 1, '0.1.2', 20310, 327, 'Gray-orange-green skin for TYPO3 3.8.x-4.0.x', 'Flexible skin for TYPO3 3.8.x-4.0.x. Allows installation level and user/user group level congifigurations. It is for example possible to use your own module icons.', 2, 0, 4, 1153938737, 'a:0:{}', 'Lasse Nrby/Tapio Markula', 'zamiams@hotmail.com /tapio.markula@atwebteam.com', 'tmarkula', 'e50d35262e4a078b807f26a5cc9cce77', 'Added more personal user setup options and reorganized existing in order to configure the skin. Supported languages for extra language labels: English, Finnish and German (partial support). Changes also the default behavior of user setup. If administrator', '', 1002, 0, 0),
(8972, 0, 'skin_grey_2', 1, '0.1.3', 20310, 490, 'Gray-orange-green skin for TYPO3 3.8.x-4.0.x', 'Flexible skin for TYPO3 3.8.x-4.0.x. Allows installation level and user/user group level congifigurations. It is for example possible to use your own module icons.', 2, 0, 4, 1154949346, 'a:0:{}', 'Lasse Nrby/Tapio Markula', 'zamiams@hotmail.com /tapio.markula@atwebteam.com', 'tmarkula', 'bc9c3bedcec2ec515dadcf8a3a65c42e', 'Changed some logic of controlling personal user setup options. Some previous chages: Added more personal user setup options, reorganized existing and changed also the default behavior of user setup (if administrator has overrided some options, users dont', '', 1003, 0, 0),
(8973, 0, 'skin_grey_2', 1, '0.1.4', 20310, 631, 'Gray-orange-green skin for TYPO3 3.8.x-4.0.x', 'Flexible skin for TYPO3 3.8.x-4.0.x. Allows installation level and user/user group level congifigurations. It is for example possible to use your own module icons.', 5, 0, 4, 1156552558, 'a:0:{}', 'Lasse Nrby/Tapio Markula', 'zamiams@hotmail.com / tapio.markula@atwebteam.com', 'tmarkula', '34c13a763826fe95a52cc49b335c2845', 'Marked as obsolete. That doesnt indicate that the plugin would not work but I have stopped public mainteinance of this plugin and I ask if it would be removed from the TER. Reason: either unjustified or insulting rating.', '', 1004, 0, 0),
(8974, 0, 'skin_grey_2', 1, '0.1.5', 20310, 614, 'Gray-orange-green skin for TYPO3 3.8.x-4.0.x', 'Skin for TYPO3 3.8.x-4.0.x with advanced features. Configuration through User  Setup (includes improvements to the module itself and some options for tm_contentaccess), install options and TS Config users/user groups. New top menu (base on Peter Kleins', 2, 0, 4, 1161068895, 'a:0:{}', 'Lasse Norby/Tapio Markula', 'tapio.markula@atwebteam.com', 'tmarkula', '89cb62a9c86f959137892cf7cd2b5205', 'Tiny bug fixes: better CSS for topmenu if TinyMCEStyles are not enabled, added CSS for highlight color for page/file tree. Changed the name of primary author and send a new manual. Entire new top menu (basic script made by Peter Klein). Added User  Setup', '', 1005, 0, 0),
(8975, 0, 'skin_grey_2', 1, '0.1.6', 20310, 718, 'Gray-orange-green skin for TYPO3 3.8.x-4.0.x', 'Skin for TYPO3 3.8.x-4.0.x with advanced features. Configuration through User  Setup (includes improvements to the module itself and some options for tm_contentaccess), install options and TS Config users/user groups. New top menu (base on Peter Kleins', 2, 0, 4, 1164730277, 'a:0:{}', 'Lasse Norby/Tapio Markula', 'tapio.markula@atwebteam.com', 'tmarkula', '10cbd227bf40a4a7ee2e460b99472683', 'Added possibility to save active main module, when new top menu has been used. Fixed some minor setup bugs.', '', 1006, 0, 0),
(8976, 0, 'skin_grey_2', 1, '1.0.0', 20310, 304, 'Gray-orange-green skin for TYPO3 3.8.x-4.0.x', 'Skin for TYPO3 3.8.x-4.0.x. Skin_grey_2 is more than just a skin. If adds also some extra functionalities, for example new menu type for selecting modules, configuration through User  Setup (includes improvements to the module itself and some options for', 2, 0, 4, 1168353697, 'a:0:{}', 'Lasse Norby/Tapio Markula', 'tapio.markula@atwebteam.com', 'tmarkula', '9675b436063024e053416110d1b5abdf', 'Fixed some CSS bugs. Added possibility to store last used page, active main and submodule into database. Two color themes (original skin_grey and fullgray). Better working top menu. Better support for changed page modules (classic and TemplaVoila) using t', 'www.xetpoint.com', 1000000, 0, 0);
