(8978, 0, 'skin_grey_2', 1, '1.1.1', 20310, 354, 'Gray-orange-green skin for TYPO3 3.8.x-4.0.x', 'Skin for TYPO3 3.8.x-4.0.x. Skin_grey_2 is more than just a skin. If adds also some extra functionalities, for example new menu type for selecting modules, configuration through User  Setup (includes improvements to the module itself and some options for', 2, 0, 4, 1169153043, 'a:0:{}', 'Lasse Norby/Tapio Markula', 'tapio.markula@atwebteam.com', 'tmarkula', '492f7f7cfd40c68879760e1986010b0b', 'Changed handling of defining starting main and sub module. Better support for plugin htmlarea. Previous changes: added possibility to store last used page, active main and submodule into database; two color themes (original skin_grey and fullgray); bett', 'www.xetpoint.com', 1001001, 0, 0),
