(9029, 0, 'caddy', 1, '6.3.0', 0, 0, 'Caddy - responsive Shopping Cart', 'http://typo3-caddy.de. Caddy is the TYPO3 responsive Shopping Cart. It is optimised for desktops, tablets and smartphones. Caddy is e-commerce for small budget and small-scale enterprises. You are welcome to install Caddy with one mouse-click - ready-to-use. See: TYPO3 Quick Shop. Caddy provides ready-to-use templates for both responsive frameworks: bootstrap and foundation. You can use caddy for your own needs with your own database and without Quick Shop. Manual at http://typo3-caddy.deEXT:caddy/doc/manual.pdf. ', 1, 0, 3, 1450651158, 'a:1:{s:7:"depends";a:3:{s:9:"powermail";s:0:"";s:8:"t3_tcpdf";s:0:"";s:5:"typo3";s:12:"4.5.0-6.2.99";}}', 'Dirk Wildt (Die Netzmacher)', 'http://wildt.at.die-netzmacher.de', 'dwildt', 'e3f58b934d708c878c856b4f3e1e6898', 'New Feature: Ready-to-use templates for Bootstrap. WARNING: You have to include the static template again: Caddy [6]  Powermail 2.x Foundation', '', 6003000, 0, 0),
