(9240, 0, 't3colorbox', 1, '7.6.0', 0, 0, 'Colorbox (jQuery lightbox)', 'T3Colorbox brings famous Colorbox (jQuery Lightbox) to TYPO3. HTML5 validated and with 6 different Layouts included. Slideshow can be enabled. Use it standalone or with ext:t3jQuery. Fully customizable with Typoscript. Supports different languages and individual labels.', 2, 0, 2, 1476554149, 'a:1:{s:7:"depends";a:1:{s:5:"typo3";s:12:"7.6.0-7.6.99";}}', 'Thomas Lampret u. Dirk Wohlrabe', 'email@quadronet.de', 'arniezilla', '22c882c3caeb87c285075e5ed060f83c', 'Lightbox for TYPO3 Version 7.6, with 7 css-styles. You can set it over constanst-editor. ', '', 7006000, 0, 0),
