(9243, 0, 't3colorbox', 1, '7.6.3', 0, 0, 'Colorbox (jQuery lightbox)', 'T3Colorbox brings famous Colorbox (jQuery Lightbox) to TYPO3. HTML5 validated and with 6 different Layouts included. Slideshow can be enabled. Use it standalone or with ext:t3jQuery. Fully customizable with Typoscript. Supports different languages and individual labels.', 2, 0, 2, 1477756423, 'a:1:{s:7:"depends";a:1:{s:5:"typo3";s:12:"7.6.2-7.6.99";}}', 'Thomas Lampret u. Dirk Wohlrabe Quadronet', 'email@quadronet.de', 'arniezilla', '70595e8d4e65536f759b1fc03a7892fc', 'New colorbox -  lightbox 1.6.4, comes  with 10 different layouts / design. You can  select the design over TS. ', '', 7006003, 0, 0),
