(9621, 0, 'pp_lib', 1, '1.1.2', 6693, 347, 'Popy librarie', 'Librarie to use in frontent plugins. Add some function to plugins (when they inherit from tx_pplib), a new option in kickstarter and a new field type in TCEforms', 2, 0, 2, 1153057592, 'a:0:{}', 'Popy', 'popy.dev@gmail.com', 'popy', 'bb5ce27c200e3d5179f6ae675127c677', '	 new method : doCachedQuery. Similar to t3lib_db-exec_SELECTgetRows, but manage a cache (in order to make the same query only one time)\n	 method touchPage updated : no clear cache for ALL users !\n', '', 1001002, 0, 0),
(9622, 0, 'pp_lib', 1, '1.1.3', 6693, 220, 'Popy library', 'Library to use in frontent plugins. Add some function to plugins (when they inherit from tx_pplib), a new option in kickstarter and a new field type in TCEforms', 2, 0, 2, 1153312019, 'a:0:{}', 'Popy', 'popy.dev@gmail.com', 'popy', '4e4d08dd15e51eb324d6fdded5092961', '	 new method : st_playHooks. Launch a list of hooks and keep the hook-objects in memory (in order not to have to re-build it each time a hook-object is needed). Usage similar to t3lib_div::callUserFunction, but made to do it faster.\n	 tool tx_httpreques', '', 1001003, 0, 0),
