(10002, 0, 'pp_searchengine', 1, '0.1.2', 1928, 221, 'Specialized search Engine', 'This search Engine calls objects or URLs to get search results, instead of indexing words in pages. Extentions can add themselves in the search engine.', 0, 0, 3, 1144950637, 'a:0:{}', 'Popy', 'popy.dev@gmail.com', 'popy', 'df1b5476f3c5e642f37515b2c756f723', 'Added a more powerfull parser for search words. Now support AND, OR and resolve parenthesis priorities.\r\n\r\nNext version will implement a result browser and a tempory cache for browsing.', '', 1002, 0, 0),
