(10034, 0, 'pixe_feediting', 1, '2.0.0', 3518, 61, 'Pixelsound FE Editing', 'Streamlined FE editing with menu bar at the top. \n		Allows Publishers to easily change between edit and view mode, create new pages, upload files or edit content elements easily using a dropdown menu on the top of the page in frontend editing .\n		Simply i', 2, 0, 0, 1190957736, 'a:0:{}', 'Bernie Pfister/Tapio Markula', 'tapio.markula@xetpoint.fi', 'tmarkula', 'dbc692698cf5191cd759dd503b65a4a5', 'Totally new version with change maintainer. Added possibility to tailor frontend menu and flexible support of the frontend editing mode Forms on page. Note. This plugin is incompatible with tm_contentaccess 2.2.3 and older.', 'Bernie Pfister (Pixelsound Web Design Perth), Tapio Markula (Xetpoint)', 2000000, 0, 0),
