(10529, 0, 'kj_imagelightbox2', 1, '1.4.0', 70549, 88, 'KJ: Image Lightbox v2', 'Nice image feature for frontend. Also if you click on a picture, it will open in a animated JavaScript window and the whole background will be in a grey colour.', 2, -1, 2, 1156639554, 'a:2:{s:7:"depends";a:2:{s:3:"cms";s:0:"";s:5:"typo3";s:6:"3.8.0-";}s:9:"conflicts";a:1:{s:15:"mp_em_forimages";s:0:"";}}', 'Julian Kleinhans', 'typo3@kj187.de', 'kj187', '8bcf79eb9516a2fff1b1c4c5342a5aa7', 'Update manual\nRefactoring the code\nFix bugs\nadd extension configuration.\n - you can set your own backgroundcolor\n - you can turn on/off dividers2tabs\n - you can set your own animation speed\n - you can set your own images for the close and loadingimage\n -', '', 1004000, 0, 0),
