(10581, 0, 'formsrecipient', 1, '0.0.5', 612, 365, 'Dynamic Formmail-Recipient', 'This extension enables you to assign FE-Users and/or BE-Users to any FE-User. If this user is logged in and submits a form, this form will be sent to the email-addresses of the users connected with the logged-in user. Useful if you would like to assign ea', 0, 0, 2, 1147858989, 'a:1:{s:7:"depends";a:3:{s:3:"cms";s:0:"";s:3:"php";s:11:"3.0.0-4.3.4";s:5:"typo3";s:4:"4.0-";}}', 'S. Regniet, Notos Media', 's.regniet@notos-media.de', 'willky', '06c73ac5e0a2568e371eeb5fd896859e', '', 'NotosMedia GmbH', 5, 1, 0),
