(10680, 0, 'photobook', 1, '0.0.1', 1222, 247, 'Photobook', 'A flexible photobook which is integrated with tt_news.', 0, 0, 2, 1148388512, 'a:0:{}', 'Luc Franken', 'typo3@tentoday.com', 'djluc', '286a2511dce2b6c9485d7a7aded4fe7f', 'First working version!\r\nJust install the exension and copy the typoscript code in the example file to the SETUP part of your template!\r\n\r\nThis will show you a nice functional photobook which uses the photos supplied in the tt_news record!', '', 1, 0, 0),
