(11582, 0, 'pm_tour', 1, '0.0.13', 1679, 147, 'Tour Extension', 'Upload you GPS Tour data as GPX File. Tracks, routes and waypoints are displayed using Google Maps. An altitude profile can be rendered with Google Charts.', 1, 0, 3, 1266362090, 'a:0:{}', 'Patrick Matusz, Markus Barchfeld', 'Markus.Barchfeld@gmx.de', 'mbarchfe', 'c9f138a7f0978450f9698f52674e39b1', ' overview with configurable type and\r\n tidied up layout with css\r\n fixed url for tourpoint images, added elevation attribute for tourpoints\r\n simplified the format for declaring custom icons\r\nMany thanks to Daniel Nicke (d.nicke@gmx.de) who initiated ', 'webdesign.matusz.ch, www.markusbarchfeld.de', 13, 1, 0),
