(11976, 0, 'hl_dam_gallery', 1, '0.6.0', 9080, 7424, 'DAM Photo Gallery', 'FE plugin, that extends existing elements (image, text /w image) to a fully featured gallery.  Can also be used as a replacement for the showimage-popup window.', 1, 0, 3, 1167945267, 'a:1:{s:7:"depends";a:5:{s:3:"cms";s:0:"";s:3:"dam";s:0:"";s:13:"dam_ttcontent";s:0:"";s:18:"css_styled_content";s:0:"";s:9:"mmforeign";s:0:"";}}', 'Heiner Lamprecht', 'typo3@heiner-lamprecht.net', 'hlamprecht', '54b0d9f4a08ae3b9a07974ff35570715', 'Added general support for Lightbox2 as replacement of displaying images in extra window. Updated and extended user manual.', '', 6000, 1, 0),
