(12580, 0, 'tagpack', 1, '0.7.0', 1209, 23, 'Tag Pack', 'All purpose tagging suite. Use tags for almost any allowed table without having to create new DB fields for each of them. Create multifunctional tag clouds using surf or filter mode together with time based settings, a tag breadcrumb menu and a searchbox', 1, 0, 4, 1239289220, 'a:0:{}', 'JoH asenau', 'jh@eqony.com', 'cybercraft', '5c141a772343d8e3d1ff73f9308d0cd8', 'Tag manager module is close to stable now.\r\nMerging of tags is now possible while assigning their relations to the replacement tag.\r\n"Translate" will be a feature for the 1.x branch though.', '', 7000, 0, 0),
