(12892, 0, 'kik_rssfeeds', 1, '2.1.2', 1297, 93, 'kik RSS Feeds', 'Should handle rss feeeds from 0.91 and 2.0 format with cURL instead of fopen.', 2, 0, 3, 1164009972, 'a:0:{}', 'Cristian Domide', 'cristian.domide@kik-ag.ch', 'kik-ag', 'ce8e1c8006237c49ecd7ea151ded88e7', 'The "kik_rssfeeds"-extension is based on the "tw_rssfeeds"-extension but instead of the unsecure fopen command it uses cURL to get the RSS-Feed-URL. This increases the server security and decreases the risks of a malicious attack', '', 2001002, 0, 0),
