(12989, 0, 'flatmgr', 1, '1.0.0', 5040, 126, 'Flat Manager', 'Vacation flat manager, shows the booking of vacation flats in a calendar', 1, -1, 3, 1177576307, 'a:0:{}', 'Joachim Ruhs', 'postmaster@joachim-ruhs.de', 'joachim_ruhs', '3dcf771a5f7268dac7d56f8c05b7f039', 'flexform configuration added, normal calendar view added, bookings over the change of a year are possible, displays now the booking of a flat immediately if there is only one flat in the database', '', 1000000, 0, 0),
