(13427, 0, 'debug_mysql_db', 1, '0.5.6', 1345, 0, 'Debug Mysql DB', 'Extends TYPO3CMSCoreDatabaseDatabaseConnection (former t3lib_db) to show Errors and Debug-Messages. Useful for viewing and debugging of sql-queries. Shows error messages if they occur. (For Typo3 V4.3-4.7 see versions 0.4.x)', 2, 0, 4, 1434696586, 'a:2:{s:7:"depends";a:2:{s:3:"php";s:13:"5.2.5-5.5.999";s:5:"typo3";s:13:"6.1.0-6.2.999";}s:9:"conflicts";a:1:{s:4:"dbal";s:11:"0.0.0-0.0.0";}}', 'Stefan Geith', 'typo3dev2013@geithware.de', 'franzholz', '7d3e1d67929dd36317ae4e4ada84516a', 'Followup fix bug 67459: TYPO3 6.2.x has a table sys_refindex which misses the field uid', '', 5006, 0, 0),
