(13579, 0, 'wm_wsbannerplus', 1, '2.0.0', 1244, 335, 'Banner Manager', 'Manages logos, links, names, priority and sorting order of sponsors, counts displays, etc... Plugin "Sponsor Overview" renders all records of a given priority with the use of a HTML-Template and CSS, plugin "Sponsor of the Click" displays a different high', 2, 0, 3, 1201424032, 'a:0:{}', 'Manfred Widmann', 'm.widmann@radclubwels.at', 'mpunktw', '6a0dbe4e22899dcd1be7361811260bf9', ' Provide Display Counter as a marker\n Problem with synchronization of Banner Overview and Banner of the Click\nsolved: When looking on the Overview always a certain banner was displayed by\nthe Banner of the Click  it simply didn', '', 2000000, 0, 0),
(13580, 0, 'wm_wsbannerplus', 1, '2.0.1', 1244, 97, 'Banner Manager', 'Manages logos, links, names, priority and sorting order of sponsors, counts displays, etc... Plugin "Sponsor Overview" renders all records of a given priority with the use of a HTML-Template and CSS, plugin "Sponsor of the Click" displays a different high', 2, 0, 3, 1224276949, 'a:0:{}', 'Manfred Widmann', 'm.widmann@radclubwels.at', 'mpunktw', '1e3efd8a2e2bec84ed5c76bfc23f9a13', '	When adding a record, a record icon is displayed now.\r\n	The record type has got a name.\r\n	It now should work with 4.2.x. There was a problem with a XML file with encodingUTF8 but was encoded ANSI-Latin. TYPO3 4.2.x said EXT:wm_wsba', '', 2000001, 0, 0),
