(13703, 0, 'pmkmp3info', 1, '1.0.0', 574, 204, 'PMK MP3 Info', 'This extension allows you to view/edit the ID3 information embedded in MP3 files directly from the TYPO3 Backend. This is done by adding an item to the Typo3 context sensitive menu when you click on the icon of a MP3 file.', 2, 0, 4, 1172336621, 'a:0:{}', 'Peter Klein', 'peter@umloud.dk', 'pmk65', '7fd2f60d133b6dacf1d9ec3789b352f3', 'First public version.', 'Umloud Untd', 1000000, 0, 0),
