(13843, 0, 'sm_employeelist', 1, '1.0.2', 1936, 191, 'EmployeeList', 'Creates lists of a companys employees (front end users). It offers predefined lists like a (printable) telephone list, a birthday list, a department/position list (sorted by positions priorities) or an image list. There is also a details page for every', 2, 0, 3, 1173261595, 'a:0:{}', 'Stefan Macke', 'typo3@stefanmacke.com', 'stefanmacke', 'b09a53b4a0e7fc2599ccd3cacf8e8a18', ' Removed Subversion-files and _res-folder  :-)\r\n Added a more detailed description of the extension.\r\n Added working hours to employees fields. If working hours are defined for an employee he/she will be considered to be a part-time worker. Working ti', '', 1000002, 0, 0),
(13844, 0, 'sm_employeelist', 1, '1.0.3', 1936, 216, 'EmployeeList', 'Creates lists of a companys employees (front end users). It offers predefined lists like a (printable) telephone list, a birthday list, a department/position list (sorted by positions priorities) or an image list. There is also a details page for every', 2, 0, 3, 1173270868, 'a:0:{}', 'Stefan Macke', 'typo3@stefanmacke.com', 'stefanmacke', 'adcc799e72514be7141d464e491e24f5', 'Updated manual.\r\nStatistics now include number of part-time workers.', '', 1000003, 0, 0),
