(13849, 0, 't3getid3', 1, '1.0.0', 719, 455, 'GetID3 Library', 'GetID3() Library (http://getid3.sourceforge.net) ported to TYPO3. GetID3() extracts information like play time, bitrate, resolution, etc from these file formats: MP3, Ogg Vorbis, WAV, AVI, MPEG-1 video, ASF / Windows Media Audio (WMA)/ Windows Media Video', 2, 0, 4, 1173289571, 'a:0:{}', 'Peter Klein', 'peter@umloud.dk', 'pmk65', '8b23d4fc8d1370235fe1bac3f9dcfd06', '', 'Umloud Untd', 1000000, 0, 0),
