(13920, 0, 'nc_staticfilecache', 1, '1.0.0', 4224, 279, 'Static File Cache', 'Transparent static file cache solution using mod_rewrite and mod_expires. Increase response times for static pages by a factor of 92!', 2, 0, 2, 1173961433, 'a:0:{}', 'Michiel Roos, Tim Lochmller', 'extensions@netcreators.com', 'netcreators', 'bfef4d34d430cfa3b3964917aaeb8f03', 'Initial release. Speed up the serving of static pages using mod_rewrite and mod_expires. Speed increase factor of upto 92.', 'Netcreators', 1000000, 0, 0),
