(14178, 0, 'meta_oscommerce', 1, '0.0.11', 1778, 55, 'Meta OSCommerce', 'OSCommerce for typo3', 0, 0, 3, 1213690321, 'a:2:{s:7:"depends";a:1:{s:3:"cms";s:0:"";}s:9:"conflicts";a:1:{s:4:"dbal";s:0:"";}}', 'Metaphore Multimedia (Christophe Monard, Olivier Saint-Clair)', 'typo3@metaphore.fr', 'cbalisky', '3105ce1d7d26bcdc483e25a09de611f8', 'Advanced shipping price management, easier way to change price for plugin.\r\nUpdated documentation with description of own contribution.', 'Metaphore Multimedia', 11, 0, 0),
