(14412, 0, 'csvdisplay', 1, '0.4.0', 1406, 0, 'CSV Display', 'Displays CSV Data In a HTML Table, options to generate Headers from first data row and display data in multiple pages', 1, 0, 2, 1371993044, 'a:1:{s:7:"depends";a:1:{s:5:"typo3";s:12:"4.5.0-6.1.99";}}', 'Christian Wolff', 'chris@connye.com', '1stmachine', '3ddb6c0912fe230791e63066e46cc001', 'New Feature: CSS Layout,\nThanks to Alexander Merzenich for the patch.\nenables you to set custom CSS classes for each table.\n\n\nAdded Suported versions typo3 TER\n\n\n', '', 4000, 1, 0),
