(14414, 0, 'penguin_chatrobot', 1, '0.0.1', 198, 198, 'penguin_chatrobot', 'A Flash-penguin Chatrobot which is a extended Version of the "Program E",  which is AIML compliant. You can create your own AIML-language files. The included AIML-Files are specfied for an GERMAN LANGUAGE open trade website.', 0, 0, 2, 1178200709, 'a:0:{}', 'Michael Pohlers', 'pohlers@silpion.de', 'michael-pohlers', 'dff931b3fec22fa3e1c43f6f88ff1f4a', 'Ein 3D-Pinguin-Chatbots um Linux, Open Source und den Linux Solution Park zu erklren. Dies ist das Program E von Paul Rydell. Dazu gibt es den 3D-Pinguin.', '', 1, 1, 0),
