(14596, 0, 'l10nmgr', 1, '8.0.0', 1986, 0, 'Localization Manager', 'Module for managing localization import and export', 1, 0, 1, 1499770474, 'a:1:{s:7:"depends";a:2:{s:5:"typo3";s:13:"8.7.0-8.99.99";s:18:"static_info_tables";s:11:"6.4.2-0.0.0";}}', 'Kasper Skaarhoej, Daniel Zielinski, Daniel Poetzinger, Fabian Seltmann, Andreas Otto, Jo Hasenau, Peter Russ', 'kasperYYYY@typo3.com, info@loctimize.com, info@cybercraft.de, pruss@uon.li', 'l10nmgr', 'a6cb5a6806ba0fe4d139a754e05dd2f5', 'New version for TYPO3 CMS 8 LTS only. Lots of changes, fixes and features. See Git log for a detailed list. Consider this as a "make it run" release, which might still use deprecated methods but is supposed to be fully working with CMS 8. Next up will be ', 'Localization Manager Team', 8000000, 0, 0),
