(14849, 0, 'rgsmoothgallery', 1, '1.0.0', 39345, 244, 'SmoothGallery for TYPO3', 'Slideshow & Gallery. Shows images from directory folders, from records, inside tt_content and DAM', 2, -1, 3, 1181090855, 'a:0:{}', 'Georg Ringer', 'http://www.just2b.com', 'just2b', 'c7d085302c297291d6e4091c0abb6fc6', 'Initial upload! Gallery&Slideshow with lightbox. Reads imgs from folders,records,dam and works in tt_content as replacement of the other images! take a look at manualdemos', '', 1000000, 0, 0),
