(15921, 0, 'bh_styleswitcher', 1, '1.0.0', 196, 196, 'BH Styleswitcher', 'A simple javascript-based stylesheet switcher', 2, 0, 2, 1188354760, 'a:0:{}', 'Christopher Torgalson', 'manager@bedlamhotel.com', 'bedlam', '22689f474c3a340ac50b8d97bf09f04c', 'A simple JS powered styleswitcher based on http://www.alistapart.com/stories/alternate. The extension contains a sample implementation as a font-size switcher. To activate, add static template to main TS template and add the cObject "lib.bh_styleswitcher.', '', 1000000, 1, 0),
(15922, 0, 't3mootools', 1, '1.0.0', 12644, 66, 'T3 Mootools', 'Provides a shared version of the Mootools Javascript framework for use in other extensions. See class.tx_t3mootools.php for API and usage. Includes BE module for configuring which parts of Mootools you want included.', 1, -1, 4, 1188410855, 'a:0:{}', 'Peter Klein', 'peter@umloud.dk', 'pmk65', '74f74fca6a53f288f116e88306159525', 'See class.tx_t3mootools.php for API and usage. Includes BE module for configuring which parts of Mootools you want included. Can also analyze javascripts for mootools dependencies.', '', 1000000, 0, 0),
(15923, 0, 't3mootools', 1, '1.1.0', 12644, 745, 'T3 Mootools', 'Provides a shared version of the Mootools Javascript framework for use in other extensions. See class.tx_t3mootools.php for API and usage. Includes BE module for configuring which parts of Mootools you want included.', 1, -1, 4, 1189430571, 'a:0:{}', 'Peter Klein', 'peter@umloud.dk', 'pmk65', '6dcfb99c54be1b65dca8ca5a38a207fd', 'New function to process and analyze t3mootools.txt files located inside extension dirs. This makes it much easier to generate the mootools library with the correct dependencies. Big thanks to Georg Ringer for writing the initial manual a bugreports.', '', 1001000, 0, 0),
(15924, 0, 't3mootools', 1, '1.2.0', 12644, 2133, 'T3 Mootools', 'Provides a shared version of the Mootools Javascript framework for use in other extensions. See class.tx_t3mootools.php for API and usage. Includes BE module for configuring which parts of Mootools you want included.', 2, -1, 4, 1195394700, 'a:0:{}', 'Peter Klein', 'peter@umloud.dk', 'pmk65', '0419221bf8630d3d0edc3083c9a7f735', 'Added a new function to the API, named "addJS" which is a small wrapper for adding javascripts script after the Mootools Library. This is needed in some situations because headerdata added with "page.headerData" is placed BEFORE the headerdata which is ad', '', 1002000, 0, 0),
(15925, 0, 't3mootools', 1, '1.2.1', 12644, 1019, 'T3 Mootools', 'Provides a shared version of the Mootools Javascript framework for use in other extensions. See class.tx_t3mootools.php for API and usage. Includes BE module for configuring which parts of Mootools you want included.', 2, -1, 4, 1212912677, 'a:0:{}', 'Peter Klein', 'peter@umloud.dk', 'pmk65', '711fbd3227582f99abf7cd1567ab2ec8', 'Added support for using paths starting with EXT: in the addJS function.', '', 1002001, 0, 0),
