(15927, 0, 't3mootools', 1, '1.2.3', 12644, 2568, 'T3 Mootools', 'Provides a shared version of the Mootools Javascript framework for use in other extensions. See class.tx_t3mootools.php for API and usage. Includes BE module for configuring which parts of Mootools you want included.', 2, -1, 4, 1219080494, 'a:0:{}', 'Peter Klein', 'peter@umloud.dk', 'pmk65', '2a74786cc8b3e90b68fd54fd02278916', 'The addMooJS function now checks if the mootools lib have already been added.\nThanks to Stano Paska for reporting this bug.', '', 1002003, 0, 0),
