(16441, 0, 'cfa_mooflow', 1, '0.3.3', 1965, 13, 'MooFlow V0.2 integration', 'A Gallery Plugin integrate the MooFlow V0.2 project from Tobias Wetzel (www.outcut.de) CoverFlow / ImageFlow effect. Support Dam / Dam Category as image source. Support dynamic loading (Ajax) from Dam Cat. Demo: www.fassing.eu/demo/mooflow.html', 1, 0, 3, 1227682611, 'a:1:{s:7:"depends";a:3:{s:3:"php";s:11:"5.0.0-0.0.0";s:5:"typo3";s:11:"4.1.0-0.0.0";s:3:"cms";s:0:"";}}', 'Claus Fassing', 'claus@fassing.eu', 'fazzyx', '6cc0039f1225400789d60aba9d8e6cab', 'Add new configuration option Autoplay on Start. If set , autoplay will start immediately after page load. \r\n', '', 3003, 0, 0),
