(17632, 0, 'bitsoffice', 1, '0.9.0', 279, 39, 'Extended Office Import', 'Imports and Displays Open Office Writer documents. This version extends the rlmp_officeimport from Robert Lemke. It render the backend pagetree depending on the headings in your document. Each heading section will render a page with a text element in the', 1, 0, 3, 1219743194, 'a:1:{s:7:"depends";a:1:{s:3:"cms";s:0:"";}}', 'Joachim Karl', 'joachim.karl@bitsafari.de', 'herrandrack', '795ad6a6ba704a127e7ad267c8ea4238', 'Now its possible to import exported global sxw files too. a few changes like hard coded references will come soon ;-)', '', 9000, 0, 0),
(17633, 0, 'bitsoffice', 1, '0.10.0', 279, 30, 'Extended Office Import', 'Imports and Displays Open Office Writer documents. This version extends the rlmp_officeimport from Robert Lemke. It render the backend pagetree depending on the headings in your document. Each heading section will render a page with a text element in the', 1, 0, 3, 1225501076, 'a:1:{s:7:"depends";a:1:{s:3:"cms";s:0:"";}}', 'Joachim Karl', 'joachim.karl@bitsafari.de', 'herrandrack', '866f50d994ed2032142de6bf8620a82c', 'Now it supports importing native odt files and also exported odt files from a global document. You can also use hidden text fields. read the section whats new in the documentation.\r\nIn the previous version i forgot to uncomment the return command in the m', '', 10000, 0, 0),
(17634, 0, 'bitsoffice', 1, '0.11.0', 279, 62, 'Extended Office Import', 'Imports and Displays Open Office Writer documents. This version extends the rlmp_officeimport from Robert Lemke. It render the backend pagetree depending on the headings in your document. Each heading section will render a page with a text element in the', 1, 0, 3, 1230033247, 'a:1:{s:7:"depends";a:1:{s:3:"cms";s:0:"";}}', 'Joachim Karl', 'joachim.karl@bitsafari.de', 'herrandrack', '079f77c839f563cbaa63d0c6d4b004ff', 'Now supports configuration via TS. No hardcoded image-wraps and cross-references anymore.\r\ncleaned up code a bit and fix some bugs. In the past version, some documents did not work properly for import and sometimes there were no images after import. This', '', 11000, 1, 0),
