(17833, 0, 'event', 1, '0.2.0', 420, 37, 'Event', 'Event online booking', 1, -1, 3, 1203014218, 'a:0:{}', 'Joachim Ruhs', 'postmaster@joachim-ruhs.de', 'joachim_ruhs', 'ed3564e67e9e8beb5325279909510607', 'First public release - extension manages event online bookings with confirmation mail, configurable forms see manual, especially for the german lastschriftverfahren.', '', 2000, 0, 0),
