(17928, 0, 'nagios', 1, '1.2.2', 681, 218, 'Nagios TYPO3 Monitoring', 'Monitors TYPO3 instances and warns about insecure extensions, old TYPO3 versions, wrong PHP versions, etc. Requires a Nagios monitoring server.\nDetailed documentation, screenshots and more at: http://schams.net/nagios', 1, 0, 4, 1322733377, 'a:0:{}', 'Michael Schams schams.net', 'schams.net', 'schams.net', '9d67037665ce24154b7f99fac3b14585', 'Compatibility with TYPO3 v4.1.x and TYPO3 v4.2.x implemented, database checks in eID method fixed, line after closing php-end-tag removed, list of allowed Nagios servers improved, admin warning if misconfiguration detected, documentation updated. See Chan', 'http://schams.net', 1002002, 0, 0),
(17929, 0, 'nagios', 1, '1.2.3', 681, 144, 'Nagios TYPO3 Monitoring', 'Monitors TYPO3 instances and warns about insecure extensions, old TYPO3 versions, wrong PHP versions, etc. Requires a Nagios monitoring server.\nDetailed documentation, screenshots and more at: http://schams.net/nagios', 2, 0, 4, 1325734393, 'a:0:{}', 'Michael Schams schams.net', 'schams.net', 'schams.net', '82c72c5a133a61ae985139f5b051f83c', 'New check "disk usage" implemented (requires UNIX/Linux system), option to include site name and server name implemented, documentation updated.', 'http://schams.net', 1002003, 0, 0),
