(17931, 0, 'nagios', 1, '1.2.5', 681, 0, 'Nagios TYPO3 Monitoring', 'Monitors TYPO3 instances and warns about insecure extensions, old TYPO3 versions, wrong PHP versions, etc. Requires a Nagios monitoring server.\nDetailed documentation, screenshots and more at: http://schams.net/nagios', 2, 0, 4, 1352165268, 'a:1:{s:7:"depends";a:1:{s:5:"typo3";s:13:"4.0.0-6.0.999";}}', 'Michael Schams (schams.net)', 'schams.net', 'schams.net', 'ad48cec755a96da3ecfaa7a804d31bfe', 'Include imported (but possibly not loaded) extensions (requires TYPO3 4.5.0 or newer). Minor extension configuration adjustments and various TYPO3 branding updates. See ChangeLog for further details.', 'http://schams.net', 1002005, 0, 0),
