(17939, 0, 'nagios', 1, '2.0.2', 681, 0, 'Nagios TYPO3 Monitoring', 'Monitors TYPO3 instances and warns about insecure extensions, old TYPO3 versions, wrong PHP versions, etc. Requires a Nagios monitoring server.\nDetailed documentation, screenshots and more at: http://schams.net/nagios', 2, 0, 4, 1464689714, 'a:1:{s:7:"depends";a:2:{s:3:"php";s:12:"5.5.0-5.6.99";s:5:"typo3";s:13:"7.0.0-7.6.999";}}', 'Michael Schams (schams.net)', 'schams.net', 'schams.net', '666ec1542eefe85379330e013fc9b08f', 'Compatibility with PHP version 5.5 restored. Note: use version 1.2.x for TYPO3 CMS 4.5 to 6.2 and version 2.0.x for TYPO3 CMS 7 LTS.', 'https://schams.net', 2000002, 0, 0),
