(18542, 0, 'mailform', 1, '0.8.2', 3387, 27, 'Mailform', 'Supports a multi col system, very good choice of field elements, an add-on platform for third developer, a very usable form wizard and a lot more', 1, -1, 3, 1208299314, 'a:0:{}', 'Sebastian Winterhalder Internetgalerie', 'sw@internetgalerie.ch', 'mephistasia', '5cf27dafb64f0364ee876b1e38a38b30', 'Initial Typo3.org release. Please check out other extensions too: mailform_tmpl and mailform_statistics which add functionality to this extension. For further Information view Online Documentation.', 'Internetgalerie', 8002, 0, 0),
