(19755, 0, 'best_getflexfield', 1, '1.0.2', 119, 95, 'Get flex fields', 'Use content of flexforms in TS or filter content by its flexform fields using patterns like "([0-9].12)". E.g. for use with TemplaVoila FCEs. See readme.txt for usage examples.', 2, 0, 4, 1219656449, 'a:0:{}', 'Dennis Geldmacher', 'geldmacher@best-mediaforge.com', '2rapid', 'fbb46f2d0ed2ff1b672d162728c9e51d', 'Now its possible to filter FCEs by any of its flexform fields using patterns like ([0-9].12).', '', 1000002, 1, 0),
