(19871, 0, 'patch1822', 1, '0.0.1', 1377, 34, 'API to list tables in the Web-Page module', 'This implements the patch for bug1822 which is already pending in the Core list since many months.', 2, 0, 0, 1219787979, 'a:0:{}', 'Franz Holzinger', 'contact@fholzinger.com', 'franzholz', '8e7b9d5fdf229a5a605c842725265d46', 'This implements the patch1822 to have an API for the page module. It is used by tt_products to show an enhanced view of the products and also a list of articles and categories.', 'jambage.com', 1, 0, 0),
