(19888, 0, 'dg_headslist', 1, '1.0.5', 112, 50, 'heads list', 'A list of heads pictures with Tooltips and a link to a detail page.', 1, 0, 3, 1260541239, 'a:1:{s:7:"depends";a:1:{s:3:"cms";s:0:"";}}', 'Dennis Grote', 'd.grote@dd-medien.de', 'dennisg', '69f7ab60667027e45b9c207bd311219b', 'For changes look at the ChangeLog.\r\nHINT: If you update from a previous version, in most cases you have to delete the old plugin CEs and make a new one. Because there are many changes in the flexForm and the old config will not work.', '', 1000005, 1, 0),
