(20079, 0, 'typo3_tut_fr', 1, '1.0.0', 84, 84, 'Tutoriel TYPO3 pour les rdacteurs', 'This extension provides a french translation of the documentation extension typo3_tut. This basic tutorial for editors explains how to add or change content on an existing website in TYPO3. It provides the most basic step-by-step instructions to get the j', 2, 0, 8, 1220887561, 'a:0:{}', 'RVVN Web Team (Sbastien Delcroix)', 'web@rvvn.org', 'rvvn', '83b3ea6ebaf4a06cec3d3c27fae331e7', 'First release. All parts are translated into french language except the last chapter, "Multiple langages".', '', 1000000, 1, 0),
