(20224, 0, 'sevenpack', 1, '0.3.0', 634, 16, 'Sevenpack bibliography manager', 'A customizable bibliography and publication reference manager with a convenient frontend editor and BibTeX export and XML import/export.', 1, 0, 3, 1226581185, 'a:0:{}', 'Sebastian Holtermann', 'holtermann@bccms.uni-bremen.de', 'sebotypo', '83f76781a41300d42dc1f3ca96ac5f82', 'Many updates and changes, check the Changelog file.\r\nNew: XML import; Simple Statistics; AND/OR author filter; Style\r\n', '', 3000, 0, 0),
