(20289, 0, 'fe_db_browser', 1, '0.0.4', 184, 31, 'Frontend-Database-Browser', 'Displays content from related tables in the frontend. There are list and single views. You can wrap images as images and every table field with the stdWrap function. The log displays the SQL relation building and every SQL statement among other things. fe', 0, 0, 3, 1222366880, 'a:0:{}', 'Dirk Wildt', 'dirk.wildt.at.think-visually.com', 'dwildt', '0c9f062f9062f3dbbca7eb03bdaa1856', 'Publishing', 'think visually!', 4, 0, 0),
