(20534, 0, 't3m_cumulus_tagcloud', 1, '2.0.0', 2361, 202, 'Cumulus Tagcloud', 'With this extension the awesome cumulus tagcloud from Roy Tanck (originally made for WordPress) can be used in TYPO3. The tags are rotating depending on the mouse movement. The extension is based on a flash file.', 1, 0, 3, 1226303845, 'a:0:{}', 'Christian Philipp', 'cp@typo3-macher.de', 'cp_typo3macher', 'bc8646bb331fe324a5e8789e580db834', '- corrected width and height of the tagcloud, when entering no size', '', 2000000, 0, 0),
