(20735, 0, 'virtualcss', 1, '0.0.6', 127, 12, 'Virtual CSS', 'Easy to use stylesheets for backend-users. Includes a colorpicker. Available CSS Selectors in backend can be predefined.', 0, 0, 1, 1229011102, 'a:0:{}', 'Christof Hagedorn', 'christof.hagedorn@kinea.de', 'kinea', '060d05c527894cab8607399e1d980869', 'Added support for typo3 installations with multiple domains.\r\nThe backend user can oneclick-select a subtree each editing time, from which the virtual css setup is used (predefined styles etc).\r\nThanks to Gregor Schreier for the necessary code to integrat', '', 6, 0, 0),
