(20752, 0, 'gl_pages_cat', 1, '0.1.4', 101, 18, 'Pages categorization', 'Relate pages with tt_news categories.', 1, 0, 0, 1231745594, 'a:1:{s:7:"depends";a:1:{s:7:"tt_news";s:0:"";}}', 'Manuel Rego Casasnovas [Igalia]', 'mrego@igalia.com', 'mrego', 'b0786caa8bcd77b0122497a82839dfdb', ' class.tx_glpagescat_div.php: (getPageCategories) Now this method returns a comma-separted list of uids.\r\n doc/manual.sxw: Added explanation to use this extension with tt_news plugins (thanks to Daniel Huf).\r\n', 'Igalia - http://www.igalia.com', 1004, 0, 0),
