(20768, 0, 'imagemap_wizard', 1, '0.6.0', 1768, 523, 'Imagemap Wizard', 'Provides an TYPO3 Wizard which enables interactive Imagemap-Creation - related to the TYPO3-Linkwizard. Supported by AOE media.', 2, 0, 0, 1298576714, 'a:1:{s:7:"depends";a:4:{s:3:"php";s:12:"5.0.0-5.3.99";s:5:"typo3";s:12:"3.8.0-4.5.99";s:3:"cms";s:5:"0.0.0";s:18:"css_styled_content";s:5:"0.0.0";}}', 'Tolleiv Nietsch', 'extensions@myfirstname.de', 'sfischer', '4265bf4c240e145010bdbb76f1d26750', 'Current version works fine with TYPO3 4.5, Workspace and DAM compatibility improved. Thanks to cron It, AOEmedia and all contributors.', '', 6000, 0, 0),
