(21458, 0, 'browser', 1, '4.9.1', 3146, 0, 'Browser - TYPO3 without PHP', 'Publish your data in list and single views and in maps! You dont need neither any own plugin nor any line PHP code. The Browser - TYPO3 without PHP - provides an index browser (a-z), a page browser, a record browser, a search form, filters, category menus, AJAX, GoogleMaps and OpenStreetMap by default. Your data will be detected as objects, i.e. images will be wrapped automatically. SEO - Search Engine Optimization - is supported. The Browser enables the development of TYPO3-Extensions without any line PHP. TYPO3 developers and TYPO3 integrators  will be eight times faster! The browser is very suitable for database development. Manual: http://typo3-browser.deEXT:browser/doc/manual.pdf', 1, -1, 3, 1399073238, 'a:2:{s:7:"depends";a:2:{s:17:"browser_manual_en";s:0:"";s:5:"typo3";s:12:"4.5.0-6.1.99";}s:9:"conflicts";a:1:{s:14:"be_tablefilter";s:0:"";}}', 'Dirk Wildt (Die Netzmacher)', 'http://wildt.at.die-netzmacher.de', 'dwildt', '44c3a3d3049d3ee3285a87076b197beb', 'Bugfix: var_dump was enabled', '', 4009001, 0, 0),
