(21552, 0, 'sb_portfolio', 1, '2.1.1', 1103, 107, 'SB Portfolio', 'Portfolio for Webdesign and illustration etc.', 2, 0, 3, 1270041626, 'a:1:{s:7:"depends";a:1:{s:5:"typo3";s:11:"4.3.0-0.0.0";}}', 'Stephen Bungert', 'stephenbungert@yahoo.de', 'stephenbungert', '51250575712cfe07b5d2f7cbf81a2ea9', 'Corrected a bug with client filtered lists/grids.\r\n$GLOBALS[TSFE]-set_no_cache() was left in the extension in version 2.1.0. This has been commented out.\r\nAltered ChangeLog.txt to correct some mistakes with dates.', '', 2001001, 0, 0),
(21553, 0, 'sb_portfolio', 1, '2.2.0', 1103, 3, 'SB Portfolio', 'Portfolio for Webdesign and illustration etc.', 1, 0, 3, 1277428008, 'a:1:{s:7:"depends";a:2:{s:5:"typo3";s:11:"4.3.0-0.0.0";s:3:"php";s:9:"5.0-0.0.0";}}', 'Stephen Bungert', 'stephenbungert@yahoo.de', 'stephenbungert', 'd8d3cf62f51d77f5e22786b863940169', ' Language translation now works correctly. You can now just view items/clients/cats in the FE language and not overlay them over the default langauge.\r\n\r\n Category tags, related items and related news.\r\n\r\n GIFBUILDER support\r\n\r\n Associate a folder of ', '', 2002000, 0, 0),
