(21623, 0, 'wm_banner', 1, '1.0.0', 273, 96, 'Banner Manager', 'Manages logos, links, names, priority and sorting order of sponsors, counts displays, etc... Plugin "Sponsor Overview" renders all records of a given priority with the use of a HTML-Template and CSS, plugin "Sponsor of the Click" displays a different high', 2, 0, 3, 1235553528, 'a:0:{}', 'Manfred Widmann', 'm.widmann@radclubwels.at', 'mpunktw', '74ef202202a38e79a558f7ba50db0c62', ' All the logic is transferred to extension wm_banner; many little adaptations and\r\ncorrections has been made to clean the (historical grown) mass up (ws_banner,\r\nwm_wsbannerplus).\r\n All strings are localized now.\r\n Value assignment to template marke', '', 1000000, 0, 0),
