(21625, 0, 'wm_banner', 1, '1.0.2', 273, 0, 'Banner Manager', 'Manages logos, links, names, priority and sorting order of sponsors, counts displays, etc... Plugin "Sponsor Overview" renders all records of a given priority with the use of a HTML-Template and CSS, plugin "Sponsor of the Click" displays a different high-priority banner every time the page is rendered and plugin "Select Sponsor" displays one certain banner selected by uid or name.', 2, 0, 3, 1452531063, 'a:1:{s:7:"depends";a:1:{s:5:"typo3";s:12:"4.5.0-6.2.99";}}', 'Manfred Widmann', 'm.widmann@htl-leonding.ac.at', 'mpunktw', '9ba24dfcbe83313f042855a7d88c9564', '	Ready for TYPO3 6.2', 'HTL Leonding', 1000002, 1, 0),
