(21651, 0, 'w_query2csv', 1, '0.1.5', 111, 81, 'Export db query to file', 'This extension provides exporting given database query to a CSV file. If you have data set in db, that must be quick sent to someone eg. by email, or periodically downloaded by someone,\nthis extension is very useful. Its simple and easy to configure', 1, 0, 3, 1249485891, 'a:0:{}', 'Wolo', 'wolo.wolski@gmail.com', 'wolo', '4da610cf0518d05d539e66631f78742f', '- Last built query is saved and available on debug,\r\n- Quotes in input are escaped to csv-compatible double quotes (was messing whole csv)\r\n- Additional tables added to non_allowed', 'Hint Intermedia', 1005, 0, 0),
