(21772, 0, 'metaext', 1, '0.2.4', 414, 15, ' SEO Features', 'This extension provides you with an editable set of all the important config parameters including multilanguage settings, adds additional metatag fields to the page module and provides global settings for some of them (those who make sense to be filled', 1, 0, 0, 1237201918, 'a:1:{s:7:"depends";a:1:{s:5:"typo3";s:11:"4.2.0-0.0.0";}}', 'Iggy - sensomedia.de', 'info@sensomedia.de', 'sensomedia', '2ce585467ef134368fb062ec01c1dadc', 'Important Bugfix: introducing unicode switch for postprocessing in EM config. if using non unicode content with unicode flag only a white page might get delivered.', 'sensomedia.de', 2004, 0, 0),
(21773, 0, 'metaext', 1, '0.2.5', 414, 5, ' SEO Features', 'This extension provides you with an editable set of all the important config parameters including multilanguage settings, adds additional metatag fields to the page module and provides global settings for some of them (those who make sense to be filled', 1, 0, 0, 1237386652, 'a:1:{s:7:"depends";a:1:{s:5:"typo3";s:11:"4.2.0-0.0.0";}}', 'Iggy - sensomedia.de', 'info@sensomedia.de', 'sensomedia', 'c07411cb576580793e9ccbdac3c4179e', '- Small improvements to the post processor (sparing !--TYPO3SEARCH_start/end-- tags now if remove all html comments is selected and post processing turned on). \r\n- Updated manual.', 'sensomedia.de', 2005, 0, 0),
(21774, 0, 'metaext', 1, '0.2.6', 414, 2, ' SEO Features', 'This extension provides you with an editable set of all the important config parameters including multilanguage settings, adds additional metatag fields to the page module and provides global settings for some of them (those who make sense to be filled', 1, 0, 0, 1237855350, 'a:1:{s:7:"depends";a:1:{s:5:"typo3";s:11:"4.2.0-0.0.0";}}', 'Iggy - sensomedia.de', 'info@sensomedia.de', 'sensomedia', 'a7055e71653f6874baec418d1b5157ed', 'Some new features for the post processor: maintain the copyright comment  by sorting the header tags or by removing all html comments this typo3 copyright notice gets removed. Strictly spoken, the removal of this comment does not break any copyr', 'sensomedia.de', 2006, 0, 0),
(21775, 0, 'metaext', 1, '0.3.0', 414, 2, ' SEO Features', 'This extension provides you with an editable set of all the important config parameters including multilanguage settings, adds additional metatag fields to the page module and provides global settings for some of them (those who make sense to be filled', 1, 0, 0, 1237955356, 'a:1:{s:7:"depends";a:1:{s:5:"typo3";s:11:"4.2.0-0.0.0";}}', 'Iggy - sensomedia.de', 'info@sensomedia.de', 'sensomedia', '34878cbe12846b52615e534f1de734da', 'Sitemap added (documentation is pending - see static template for a short doku at the end.\r\nnew section in the constants editor Sitemap (XML). \r\nall in all pretty easy to include and configure but dies need realURL to work.', 'sensomedia.de', 3000, 0, 0),
(21776, 0, 'metaext', 1, '0.3.1', 414, 5, ' SEO Features', 'This extension provides you with an editable set of all the important config parameters including multilanguage settings, adds additional metatag fields to the page module and provides global settings for some of them (those who make sense to be filled', 1, 0, 0, 1237957310, 'a:1:{s:7:"depends";a:1:{s:5:"typo3";s:11:"4.2.0-0.0.0";}}', 'Iggy - sensomedia.de', 'info@sensomedia.de', 'sensomedia', '9eb842f1cd8771d0f5d40cab7dfaa73e', 'Doh! With adding a xml sitemap, I also added a wrong-ending comment which screwed the whole TS after including the metaext static  darn. This is fixed with this version ;) \r\n', 'sensomedia.de', 3001, 0, 0),
(21777, 0, 'metaext', 1, '0.3.2', 414, 3, ' SEO Features', 'This extension provides you with an editable set of all the important config parameters including multilanguage settings, adds additional metatag fields to the page module and provides global settings for some of them (those who make sense to be filled', 1, 0, 0, 1238149776, 'a:1:{s:7:"depends";a:1:{s:5:"typo3";s:11:"4.2.0-0.0.0";}}', 'Iggy - sensomedia.de', 'info@sensomedia.de', 'sensomedia', 'a94819f3e07eea6bc6967e1ea7e92505', '- BUGFIX an array was left uninitialized so an error was thrown wenn theres no results from the former regex search, this is fixed now. thanx to Matthieu Schapranow for pointing at this :)\r\n- the unicode switch configured in the plugins EM settings doesn', 'sensomedia.de', 3002, 0, 0),
(21778, 0, 'metaext', 1, '0.4.0', 414, 42, ' SEO Features', 'This extension provides you with an editable set of all the important config parameters including multilanguage settings, adds additional metatag fields to the page module and provides global settings for some of them (those who make sense to be filled', 1, 0, 0, 1238219203, 'a:1:{s:7:"depends";a:1:{s:5:"typo3";s:11:"4.2.0-0.0.0";}}', 'Iggy - sensomedia.de', 'info@sensomedia.de', 'sensomedia', 'b390c23a9b88507ec64ba9140f0962b8', '- geotags included - some more location tags included\r\n- its possible now to make metatag fields invisible in pages module (if not used or wanted) - its possible to switch of inclusion of individual metatags eg if fields are used for other purposes. - o', 'sensomedia.de', 4000, 0, 0),
(21779, 0, 'metaext', 1, '0.5.0', 414, 35, ' SEO Features', 'This extension provides you with an editable set of all the important config parameters including multilanguage settings, adds additional metatag fields to the page module and provides global settings for some of them (those who make sense to be filled ', 1, 0, 0, 1255369770, 'a:1:{s:7:"depends";a:1:{s:5:"typo3";s:11:"4.2.0-0.0.0";}}', 'Iggy - sensomedia.de', 'info@sensomedia.de', 'sensomedia', '46c1011c03947bbba2325cad94cd5e86', 'abstract field can now be used as fallback for description. more language options & some other tiny enhancements. misc bugfixes: htmlentities in title string are possible now. using conditional comments in the header while having headersort turned on work', 'sensomedia.de', 5000, 0, 0),
(21780, 0, 'metaext', 1, '0.5.1', 414, 293, ' SEO Features', 'This extension provides you with an editable set of all the important config parameters including multilanguage settings, adds additional metatag fields to the page module and provides global settings for some of them (those who make sense to be filled ', 1, 0, 0, 1255952336, 'a:1:{s:7:"depends";a:1:{s:5:"typo3";s:11:"4.2.0-0.0.0";}}', 'Iggy - sensomedia.de', 'info@sensomedia.de', 'sensomedia', '599b50f08fdbf2abfb3993399a9e453b', '(fix) in some cases, sorting of script tags could break the script tags content. (add) noscript tag included into list of headertags - even if far from standard, some ext use them in the header also.', 'sensomedia.de', 5001, 1, 0),
