(22084, 0, 'gh_fontsize', 1, '0.4.6', 260, 54, 'GH Change Font Size', 'Small menu to  decrease, reset and increase a numerical value, normaly fontsize, via CSS. Uses ajax functionality where possible.', 1, 0, 3, 1253177766, 'a:1:{s:7:"depends";a:1:{s:5:"typo3";s:11:"4.2.0-0.0.0";}}', 'Gregor Hermens', 'gregor@a-mazing.de', 'ghermens', '030ec3d4bf876eea8ec52962e737076e', 'The new JS code from version 0.4.5 requires Prototype 1.6.0, which is shipped with TYPO3 4.2. If you still use TYPO3 4.1 please stay with version 0.4.4.', '', 4006, 0, 0),
(22085, 0, 'gh_fontsize', 1, '0.5.0', 260, 27, 'GH Change Font Size', 'Small menu to  decrease, reset and increase a numerical value, normaly fontsize, via CSS. Uses ajax functionality where possible.', 1, 0, 3, 1265478049, 'a:1:{s:7:"depends";a:1:{s:5:"typo3";s:11:"4.3.0-0.0.0";}}', 'Gregor Hermens', 'gregor@a-mazing.de', 'ghermens', '34e316a8d5b4475d082f8d3bd2e2e198', '   Prototype is now included via page.javascriptLibs, gh_fontsize now depends on TYPO3 4.3.\r\n removed plugin.tx_ghfontsize_pi1.includePrototype from TS setup. \r\n added feature: Mark active links \r\n release of version 0.5.0\r\n', '', 5000, 0, 0),
