(22245, 0, 'blog_example', 1, '1.3.0', 2674, 1227, 'A Blog Example for the Extbase Framework', 'An example extension demonstrating the features of the Extbase Framework. It is the back-ported and tweaked Blog Example package of FLOW3. Have fun playing with it!', 2, 0, 9, 1299501815, 'a:1:{s:7:"depends";a:4:{s:3:"php";s:11:"5.2.0-0.0.0";s:5:"typo3";s:11:"4.5.0-0.0.0";s:7:"extbase";s:11:"1.3.0-0.0.0";s:5:"fluid";s:11:"1.3.0-0.0.0";}}', 'TYPO3 core team', '', 'bwaidelich', 'a99571fe8bdc0d0195dd4afd15c9d731', 'Updated to be compatible to Extbase 1.3.0:\r\n- Updated version from 1.2 to 1.3\r\n- Set dependency to Extbase/Fluid v1.3 and TYPO3 v4.5\r\n- General cleanup according to CGL, some minor tweaks\r\n- Renamed templates & layouts to be UpperCamelCase\r\n- Localization', '', 1003000, 1, 0),
