(22426, 0, 'cag_relatedcontent', 1, '0.1.1', 343, 5, 'Show Related Content', 'Categorize Pages. Display a list of related Pages in Frontend. Originally developed for Connecta AG, Wiesbaden.', 1, 0, 2, 1244623254, 'a:0:{}', 'Jens Eipel', 'j.eipel@connecta.ag', 'j.eipel', '844fa8914dea94c53dfffc9de3ac7298', 'Changes to Manual\r\nFixed an issue with deletd and hidden pages beeing found as related in some cases.\r\nFixed an issue with a trailing ? in Link-URL when realURL is installed.', '', 1001, 0, 0),
