(22740, 0, 'cw_tiltviewer', 1, '1.2.0', 187, 5, 'TiltViewer', 'TiltViewer for TYPO3 with options for TiltViewer Pro. TiltViewer Pro is not included. You have to buy your own lizenz and can use it with this extension.', 2, 0, 3, 1264965410, 'a:0:{}', 'Carsten Walther', 'carsten.walther@d-complex.de', 'd-complex', '84a910568124b89737d34433f165a834', 'cw_tiltviewer now supports TiltViewer Pro!!!\r\n- TiltViewer Pro Support via FlexForms\r\n- wmode fixed\r\n- Default values fixed\r\n\r\nFor TiltViewer Pro use you have to buy your own lizenz. Than you can select it via flexforms.', 'www.d-complex.de', 1002000, 0, 0);
