(22896, 0, 'ab_swiftmailer', 1, '0.1.5', 172, 35, 'Swiftmailer Lib', 'Write Emails using Swiftmailer (www.swiftmailer.org). This only glues swiftmailer to typo3. A simple contact form is provided. \nAdditional features have to be coded by yourself.', 0, 0, 2, 1272356939, 'a:0:{}', 'Alexander Bigga', 'linux@bigga.de', 'albigdd', '55c6f82b159f83bbb663fd563ea8f53a', 'Upgrade to Switmailer 4.0.6. Replace ereg() (deprecated as of PHP 5.3.0)  with preg_match().', '', 1005, 0, 0),
