(22898, 0, 'ab_swiftmailer', 1, '0.1.7', 172, 0, 'Swiftmailer Lib', 'Write Emails using Swiftmailer (www.swiftmailer.org). This only glues swiftmailer to TYPO3. A simple contact form is provided. \nAdditional features have to be coded by yourself. This is obsolete with TYPO3 4.5 which includes swiftmailer as system extension.', 5, 0, 2, 1363078313, 'a:1:{s:7:"depends";a:1:{s:5:"typo3";s:12:"4.2.0-4.4.99";}}', 'Alexander Bigga', 'linux@bigga.de', 'albigdd', 'da51aec35e47bcf5300c415eeeab4d71', 'Mark extension as obsolete. The swiftmailer lib is part of TYPO3 since 4.5. There are much better contact form extensions now.', '', 1007, 1, 0),
