(23070, 0, 'daimi_skinnablepagebrowser', 1, '0.1.0', 141, 141, 'Skinnable Pagebrowser', 'Provides an alternative to the function pi_list_browseresults(), that is more easily skinnable: The buttons for "First", "Last", "Previous" and "Next" can be individually skinned from TypoScript and CSS. We also provide a semantic mark-up default, which c', 0, 0, 2, 1251717856, 'a:0:{}', 'Kasper Ligaard', 'kasperl@cs.au.dk', 'daimi', 'e37a5def7688ba7735ccac1f92baa314', 'Initial upload.', 'Faculty of Science, University of Aarhus', 1000, 1, 0),
