(23329, 0, 'pmkfdl', 1, '0.3.0', 305, 25, 'PMK Forced Download', 'Makes it possible to force download of files like images, PDFs, MP3 ect., overriding the browser settings. Can create secure download links based on usergroup access.', 2, 0, 2, 1258479954, 'a:2:{s:7:"depends";a:2:{s:5:"typo3";s:11:"4.0.0-0.0.0";s:3:"php";s:11:"5.0.0-0.0.0";}s:9:"conflicts";a:3:{s:19:"alternet_securelink";s:11:"0.0.0-0.0.0";s:14:"bzb_securelink";s:11:"0.0.0-0.0.0";s:11:"securelinks";s:11:"0.0.0-0.0.0";}}', 'Peter Klein', 'pmk@io.dk', 'pmk65', '76ae1f0558f322504dad10515d9b515a', 'Added tt_news hook script to enable pmkfdl for filelinks in tt_news. - TypoScript conf var is now saved as a class var, so that it can be accessed from hooks. - Fixed problem with Access check not used in class tx_pmkfdl_download.\r\n', '', 3000, 0, 0),
