(24052, 0, 'abz_eff_labels', 1, '1.0.0', 71, 41, 'Label modifications', 'Example how you can easily modify existing labels compact in one extension. BEWARE: this is just a dummy to give you a clue what to do, nothing will happen if you just install it. Have a look in files ext_typoscript_setup.txt and locallang_db.php', 2, 0, 4, 1258545195, 'a:0:{}', 'Franz Ripfel, Sebastian Mller', 'sebastian.mueller@abezet.de', 'abezet', '6c9bcbdbeaa9db85db822028d1917cbc', 'Improved abz_labels', '', 1000000, 0, 0),
