(24456, 0, 'oneclicklogin', 1, '0.1.0', 162, 21, '1-Click-Login', 'For enabled users a 1-Click-Login link is shown at the Backend login screen to log in via OpenID. WARNING: The usernames and OpenID-Identifiers of the enabled users are shown at the login page and are visible for anyone. This should not be a security prob', 1, -1, 0, 1261259036, 'a:1:{s:7:"depends";a:1:{s:6:"openid";s:0:"";}}', 'Sebastian Gebhard', 'sebastian.gebhard@gmail.com', 'phpprof', '7772d2d00728c4c8448b9d05684ca6c6', 'Initial Release. Notice: Im quite sure that using this Extension is not a security test, but since it is related to the authentification process and not widely tested, I recommend not to use it on productive systems.', 'sgtypo3.de', 1000, 0, 0),
