(24630, 0, 'transactor', 1, '0.1.0', 184, 14, 'Payment Transactor API', 'This is a basic API to develop extensions which connect to different payment transaction gateways.', 0, 0, 4, 1312838910, 'a:1:{s:7:"depends";a:4:{s:3:"cms";s:0:"";s:7:"div2007";s:11:"0.3.2-0.0.0";s:3:"php";s:11:"5.0.4-0.0.0";s:5:"typo3";s:11:"3.8.2-0.0.0";}}', 'Franz Holzinger', 'franz@ttproducts.de', 'franzholz', '1f72a0b75173e33b2751309f83330f25', 'move the call to set the detailsArray to the front because some Gateways need the data to make a verification', '', 1000, 0, 0),
