(26330, 0, 'tsuiseki', 1, '1.0.2', 39, 29, 'Tsuiseki Tracking', 'This extension provides a simple integration method for the Tsuiseki Tracking and Data Analysis System. The Tsuiseki system affords features like click fraud detection, nearly realtime statistics, CTR analysis, path analysis and much more.', 2, 0, 4, 1279109557, 'a:0:{}', 'nexico Consulting GmbH', 'info@nexico.net', 'nexico', '4ba078f3722beef65453b39ab7c6c00f', 'Description added and manual makeover', '', 1000002, 1, 0),
