(26515, 0, 'karussell', 1, '0.2.1', 676, 54, 'Karussell: based on jCarousel', 'This extension is based on the JavaScript plugin "jQuery Carousel" by Jan Sorgalla. It allows you to display any content on a carousel.', 2, 0, 3, 1289765771, 'a:1:{s:7:"depends";a:1:{s:8:"t3jquery";s:0:"";}}', 'Kurt Gusbeth', 'info@myquizandpoll.de', 'bihor', 'd326b00c69e47ff2c740c98f3c8fdb73', 'Dynamic control elements added. Path to jCarousel can be changed now.', '', 2001, 0, 0),
