(26734, 0, 'texy', 1, '1.0.1', 29, 29, 'Texy', 'Texy is a popular text to HTML converter. With Texy you can write structured documents even without knowledge of HTML. You write an easy readable text, Texy converts it into valid HTML or XHTML code by itself.', 2, 0, 2, 1281565693, 'a:1:{s:7:"depends";a:1:{s:3:"cms";s:0:"";}}', 'Tomas J Stehlik', 'tomas@stehlik.sk', 'stehlo', '2d20da44cf23215a006fe5fd7621c725', 'Originally developed for internal use only. Not intended for public use in this shape. Any interest in using it? Let me know, I might improve it if needed and necessary.', '', 1000001, 1, 0),
