(27694, 0, 'co_hyves2typo3', 1, '0.0.1', 26, 26, 'Hyves connector for TYPO3 front end', 'Let you login into TYPO3 front end with your Hyves account. User will be logged in as FE user.', 0, 0, 3, 1287443427, 'a:1:{s:7:"depends";a:1:{s:3:"cms";s:0:"";}}', 'Joost van Berckel', 'joost@contentonline.nl', 'contentonline', '6a23c2245f84bebd396e3ae1a951e769', 'This extension will become obsolete and will be replaced by sociallogin2t3 on october 20th, 2010. The new extension will provide access to TYPO3 front end through social media accounts like Facebook, Hyves, Twitter and LinkedIn using Oauth authentication.', '', 1, 1, 0),
