(28302, 0, 'wildside_extbase', 1, '2.2.2', 662, 14, 'Wildside Extbase Framework', 'Extbase Helper Framework. Provides ViewHelpers and an AS3-for-JS style API for advanced Widget-style AJAX components.', 2, 0, 3, 1300587966, 'a:1:{s:7:"depends";a:2:{s:7:"extbase";s:0:"";s:5:"fluid";s:0:"";}}', 'Claus Due', 'claus@wildside.dk', 'abandoned_extensions', 'c0824a4f958fc8d755fefb11b97d4ec9', 'Fixed a few bugs with recursion depth when Aloha was being used; timed dirty-check implemented. Fixed Event dispatching and bubbling. Improved Fields and main Field class. This revision is primarily a JS update. ', 'Wildside A/S', 2002002, 0, 0),
(28303, 0, 'wildside_extbase', 1, '2.2.3', 662, 5, 'Wildside Extbase Framework', 'Extbase Helper Framework. Provides ViewHelpers and an AS3-for-JS style API for advanced Widget-style AJAX components.', 2, 0, 3, 1300644450, 'a:1:{s:7:"depends";a:2:{s:7:"extbase";s:0:"";s:5:"fluid";s:0:"";}}', 'Claus Due', 'claus@wildside.dk', 'abandoned_extensions', 'e8177f94822360fc57f2c8568a62602e', 'WARNING: AlohaViewHelper removed and replaced with auto-loading features in Field/AlohaViewHelper. Two new arguments for the Field/AlohaViewHelper class to replace AlohaRuleViewHelper: ruleSelector and rule. You may need to update your templates according', 'Wildside A/S', 2002003, 0, 0),
