(28313, 0, 'wildside_extbase', 1, '2.4.5', 662, 12, 'Wildside Extbase Framework', 'For Extbase extension developers. Provides ViewHelpers and an AS3-for-JS style API for Widget-style AJAX components. Includes an injectable CloningService to easily clone (copy) Domain Objects with full control over relations.', 2, 0, 3, 1301180995, 'a:1:{s:7:"depends";a:2:{s:7:"extbase";s:0:"";s:5:"fluid";s:0:"";}}', 'Claus Due', 'claus@wildside.dk', 'abandoned_extensions', '825d14723e1800f24a09aec17ea97db5', 'Extended DisplayObject with addChild() and copy(), allowing you to copy Fields, Widgets and Components and add them on-the-fly as children of other Widgets/Components. Widgets and Components now scan child DisplayObjects to find values for object properti', 'Wildside A/S', 2004005, 0, 0),
(28314, 0, 'wildside_extbase', 1, '2.4.6', 662, 20, 'Wildside Extbase Framework', 'For Extbase extension developers. Provides ViewHelpers and an AS3-for-JS style API for Widget-style AJAX components. Includes an injectable CloningService to easily clone (copy) Domain Objects with full control over relations.', 2, 0, 3, 1301243057, 'a:1:{s:7:"depends";a:2:{s:7:"extbase";s:0:"";s:5:"fluid";s:0:"";}}', 'Claus Due', 'claus@wildside.dk', 'abandoned_extensions', 'deb1f1810c3ca67d4d6a376d9303d710', 'Added Sprite DisplayObject type (ad-hoc HTML). Improved jQuery Event integration - events can now be captured by calling this.captureJQueryEvents(jQueryContext) from a DisplayObject or any subclass. Events share the jQuery Event type value and bubble up', 'Wildside A/S', 2004006, 0, 0),
