(28316, 0, 'wildside_extbase', 1, '2.4.8', 662, 6, 'Wildside Extbase Framework', 'For Extbase extension developers. Provides ViewHelpers and an AS3-for-JS style API for Widget-style AJAX components. Includes an injectable CloningService to easily clone (copy) Domain Objects with full control over relations.', 2, 0, 3, 1302106013, 'a:1:{s:7:"depends";a:2:{s:7:"extbase";s:0:"";s:5:"fluid";s:0:"";}}', 'Claus Due', 'claus@wildside.dk', 'abandoned_extensions', 'a02c565821c2dd680065a6f416f50b29', 'Performance improvement in event handling. Included an ObjectManager to store instance references. Memory footprint lowered considerably. Begun creating a proper method-based Event subclassing API.', 'Wildside A/S', 2004008, 0, 0),
