(28415, 0, 'pw_teaser', 1, '2.2.2', 369, 41, 'Page Teaser (with Fluid)', 'Create powerful, dynamic page teasers with data from page properties and its content elements. pw_teaser based on Extbase and Fluid Template Engine.', 2, 0, 3, 1316175181, 'a:1:{s:7:"depends";a:3:{s:5:"typo3";s:11:"4.5.0-0.0.0";s:7:"extbase";s:11:"1.3.0-0.0.0";s:5:"fluid";s:11:"1.3.0-0.0.0";}}', 'Armin Ruediger Vieweg', 'info@professorweb.de', 'professorweb', 'a7cb73fb03b760a9d65dcf038d812d6d', 'Fixed the getting of images of content elements. Thanks to Klaus Weidenbach', 'Professor Web', 2002002, 0, 0),
