(28417, 0, 'pw_teaser', 1, '2.2.4', 369, 0, 'Page Teaser (with Fluid)', 'Create powerful, dynamic page teasers with data from page properties and its content elements. pw_teaser based on Extbase and Fluid Template Engine.', 2, 0, 3, 1339748271, 'a:1:{s:7:"depends";a:3:{s:5:"typo3";s:11:"4.5.0-0.0.0";s:7:"extbase";s:11:"1.3.0-0.0.0";s:5:"fluid";s:11:"1.3.0-0.0.0";}}', 'Armin Ruediger Vieweg', 'info@professorweb.de', 'professorweb', '0ff099e8c72f281ed966bba4f6b56cda', 'Changed all checkboxes in flexform to select-boxes. It was not possible to define a default for value for a field which is a checkbox, because checkboxes always got a value (0 or 1) and overwrites the typoscript setting.\n\nThanks to Anna-Lena Steines for p', 'Professor Web', 2002004, 0, 0),
