(28850, 0, 'positionit', 1, '2.7.32', 1904, 9, 'drop form generator', 'Creates multilanguage forms, surveys, quizzes, mailforms or whole web processes visually by drag & drop. Easy to use, many features. Form/Process data can be passed to or from programming code at every time. For documentation see http://positionit.org', 2, 0, 4, 1307725304, 'a:1:{s:7:"depends";a:1:{s:18:"static_info_tables";s:0:"";}}', 'Ososoft GmbH', 'info@ososoft.de', 'ososoft', '41e546020b7e16dd5cc5c751fe03e2e7', 'For updaters: please update database in Ext mgr! New features: mail attachments visually  dialog optics improved. Popups can have names now. Caching issues on upgrading resolved. Several minor bug fixes.', '', 2007032, 0, 0),
