(28938, 0, 'templavoila_mobile', 1, '2.2.0', 0, 0, 'Jokers mobile', 'The extension will add mobile featues to the typo3 4.5 version.Change the extension name templavoila_mobile to templavoila. The extension configuration has to be updated to add few columns', 2, 0, 4, 1364131017, 'a:1:{s:7:"depends";a:2:{s:3:"php";s:11:"5.1.0-0.0.0";s:5:"typo3";s:12:"4.2.0-4.5.25";}}', 'Vinay', 'nvinayvinay@gmail.com', 'nvinayvinay', 'b993576cf53e1dc43d37bc7ce620769b', 'Added manual, updated Mobile_Detect.php and changed typo3 version compatability ', '', 2002000, 1, 0),
(28939, 0, 'templavoila_mobile', 1, '2.0.0', 0, 0, 'Jokers mobile', 'The extension will add mobile featues to the typo3 4.5 version.Change the extension name templavoila_mobile  to templavoila', 2, 0, 4, 1359037098, 'a:1:{s:7:"depends";a:2:{s:3:"php";s:11:"5.1.0-0.0.0";s:5:"typo3";s:11:"4.2.0-0.0.0";}}', 'TemplaVoila! Team, Tolleiv Nietsch', 'templavoila@tolleiv.de', 'nvinayvinay', 'b165730b926256821cfc78031c775843', 'Template object (TO) can be changed for devices  (tab,mobile,retina).  No need for any domain based redirection also. Content can be hidden or shown on either devices as required. Please see the screen shot in doc folder of templavoila_mobile. Cache has t', 'AOEmedia', 2000000, 0, 0),
(28940, 0, 'templavoila_mobile', 1, '2.1.0', 0, 0, 'Jokers mobile', 'The extension will add mobile featues to the typo3 4.5 version.Change the extension name templavoila_mobile to templavoila. The extension configuration has to be updated to add few columns', 2, 0, 4, 1360579898, 'a:1:{s:7:"depends";a:2:{s:3:"php";s:11:"5.1.0-0.0.0";s:5:"typo3";s:11:"4.2.0-0.0.0";}}', 'Vinay', 'nvinayvinay@gmail.com', 'nvinayvinay', 'b091bd0690fb8bcdd6410debf99760ba', 'Change in author name and author email id.\r\nImage resizing based on the device(tab,mobile,retina) . See the image mobile_7.JPG in "doc" folder . The image resize based on device is partially tested . ', '', 2001000, 0, 0),
