(29824, 0, 'cenoshop', 1, '0.3.0', 343, 26, 'Cenoshop', 'Typo3 shop system, complete with products, options, price lists, supplier ordes, replenishment calculations, profits and loss, catalog generators.', 0, 0, 3, 1315564796, 'a:0:{}', 'Viktor Bauer', 'typo3@cenotaphe.net', 'cenotaphe', '3e0ac096ce1c140f7db3d75636d6df11', 'replenishment calculation improvement: takes now into account composed products for the replenishment calculation.\r\nVarious other bugfixes and small improvements.', '', 3000, 0, 0),
(29825, 0, 'cenoshop', 1, '0.3.1', 343, 16, 'Cenoshop', 'Typo3 shop system, complete with products, options, price lists, supplier ordes, replenishment calculations, profits and loss, catalog generators.', 0, 0, 3, 1316776670, 'a:0:{}', 'Viktor Bauer', 'typo3@cenotaphe.net', 'cenotaphe', 'ab6ee296f698c58c97df41629a713453', 'Security Fix, please upgrade. Following a review by the typo3 security team, some security issues were fixed, both in the front and the backend.', '', 3001, 0, 0),
(29826, 0, 'cenoshop', 1, '0.4.0', 343, 23, 'Cenoshop', 'Typo3 shop system, complete with products, options, price lists, supplier ordes, replenishment calculations, profits and loss, catalog generators.', 1, 0, 3, 1317418274, 'a:1:{s:7:"depends";a:1:{s:18:"static_info_tables";s:11:"2.2.0-0.0.0";}}', 'Viktor Bauer', 'typo3@cenotaphe.net', 'cenotaphe', 'f9c4531d019915911b201608471d2b05', 'move to beta, realurl hooked, various improvements in reports, stock management, typoscript practices for facebook integration, paypal currency code improvement.', '', 4000, 0, 0),
(29827, 0, 'cenoshop', 1, '0.4.1', 343, 12, 'Cenoshop', 'Typo3 shop system, complete with products, options, price lists, supplier ordes, replenishment calculations, profits and loss, catalog generators.', 1, 0, 3, 1318159870, 'a:0:{}', 'Viktor Bauer', 'typo3@cenotaphe.net', 'cenotaphe', '507b364af76938f26534d2b08fc6eb9e', '- Added graphs for the reports, enhanced the graphs for easier reading.\r\n- added the possibility to configure the single product display page in the typoscript\r\n- all locallang files now also in German, thanks to Alexander Frey\r\n- possibility in the pi1 p', '', 4001, 0, 0),
(29828, 0, 'cenoshop', 1, '0.4.2', 343, 19, 'Cenoshop', 'Typo3 shop system, complete with products, options, price lists, supplier ordes, replenishment calculations, profits and loss, catalog generators. Different approach than tt_products or commerce, more ERP orientated.', 1, 0, 4, 1318622130, 'a:0:{}', 'Viktor Bauer', 'typo3@cenotaphe.net', 'cenotaphe', 'f268fa3df246c3ae5207eec3aef7d562', 'Backend module to generate the list of linked products, fixed a bug that caused the cart to be empty if the user logged in after putting products in the car, various fixes regarding character encoding.', '', 4002, 0, 0),
(29829, 0, 'cenoshop', 1, '0.4.3', 343, 43, 'Cenoshop', 'Typo3 shop system, complete with products, options, price lists, supplier ordes, replenishment calculations, profits and loss, catalog generators. Different approach than tt_products or commerce, more ERP orientated.', 1, 0, 4, 1319408300, 'a:0:{}', 'Viktor Bauer', 'typo3@cenotaphe.net', 'cenotaphe', '809af438f2cd2b93f60705757d7a1c17', '- Generation of all outbound mails achieved through the swiftmail library\r\n- Fixed some bugs on the linked products\r\n- Added the possibility to display in the price both VAT and non VAT prices\r\n- Linked products improvements\r\n- Improved document for shop ', '', 4003, 0, 0),
(29830, 0, 'cenoshop', 1, '0.4.4', 343, 12, 'Cenoshop', 'Typo3 shop system, complete with products, options, price lists, supplier ordes, replenishment calculations, profits and loss, catalog generators. Different approach than tt_products or commerce, more ERP orientated.', 1, 0, 4, 1330865808, 'a:0:{}', 'Viktor Bauer', 'typo3@cenotaphe.net', 'cenotaphe', 'a21ea575e63359fee7adfa4fd5693f96', 'Addition of an invoice date in the order model.', '', 4004, 0, 0),
(29831, 0, 'cenoshop', 1, '0.5.0', 343, 1, 'Cenoshop', 'Typo3 shop system, complete with products, options, price lists, supplier ordes, replenishment calculations, profits and loss, catalog generators. Different approach than tt_products or commerce, more ERP orientated.', 1, 0, 4, 1331062282, 'a:0:{}', 'Viktor Bauer', 'typo3@cenotaphe.net', 'cenotaphe', '5aba955110ddd7ea262cb08e69c17d3e', 'Finally fixed that conversion/encoding issue. Now everything is utf-8 compliant. This is why this release is considered a new sub version.\r\nEmbedded the corrections brought by Urs Maag in the order processing module.\r\n!!!! IMPORTANT !!!! \r\nIf you have pre', '', 5000, 0, 0),
