(30087, 0, 'html5_readykit', 1, '0.3.0', 178, 0, 'HTML5 Readykit', 'Configures Typo3 to render a valid HTML5 document using HTML5 Boilerplate, replaces the necessary tags, removes outdated attributes and sets default meta tags.', 1, 0, 2, 1366397426, 'a:1:{s:7:"depends";a:3:{s:3:"cms";s:0:"";s:3:"php";s:11:"5.2.0-0.0.0";s:5:"typo3";s:13:"4.5.0-4.99.99";}}', 'Christoph Soelder', 'chris@soelder.com', 'feierteifl', '88996cb0691c8e9930821a3eb3a5eaac', '- Update to newest Modernizr and jQuery\n- Now using normalize.css and main.css from newest Boilerplate\n- Added support for hgroup tag for pages with header and subheader\n- Added support for figure and figcaption tag for images\n- Now also removing wi', '', 3000, 0, 0),
