(30339, 0, 'calendarize', 1, '1.9.0', 0, 0, 'Calendarize', 'Create a structure for timely controlled tables and one plugin for the different output of calendar views. The extension is shipped with one default event table, but the aim of the extension is to "calendarize" every table/model. It is completely independent and configurable! Use your own models as event items in this calender. We need feedback about the concept! Development on https://github.com/lochmueller/calendarize', 2, 0, 2, 1449696319, 'a:1:{s:7:"depends";a:3:{s:5:"typo3";s:12:"6.2.0-7.6.99";s:3:"php";s:11:"5.4.0-0.0.0";s:10:"autoloader";s:12:"1.11.2-0.0.0";}}', 'Tim Lochmller', 'tim@fruit-lab.de', 'spyker', '24401eac447acadeaa2db754b6d0dd42', 'Migrate L10N XML to XLF. Fix backend labels. Add missing DE labels. Small code streamlines. New EXT icon (incl. SVG). Fix backend list of events. Add timeshift function to speed up the query cache. Fix one ViewHelper. Thanks for all the feedback!', '', 1009000, 0, 0),
