(30435, 0, 'fed', 1, '4.7.3', 2210, 0, 'Fluid Extbase Development Framework', 'Fluid/Extbase integrations for TYPO3 enabling Fluid page templating, Fluid content elements and Extbase CommandController commands as Scheduler tasks. Contains hundreds of ViewHelpers and Widgets. Web site: http://fedext.net', 2, -1, 4, 1344448787, 'a:1:{s:7:"depends";a:5:{s:5:"typo3";s:9:"4.5-0.0.0";s:3:"cms";s:0:"";s:7:"extbase";s:0:"";s:5:"fluid";s:0:"";s:4:"flux";s:0:"";}}', 'Claus Due', 'claus@wildside.dk', 'namelesscoder', '394bb720b09bd356304459d0f5dc7981', 'Bugfixes, primarily for FCE usage. FCEs now have their own icon and some deprecated methods have been avoided, improving performance on TYPO3 4.6. One major addition: option to switch on page template variable inheritance - read a bit more about this on ', 'Wildside A/S', 4007003, 0, 0),
(30436, 0, 'fed', 1, '4.7.4', 2210, 0, 'Fluid Extbase Development Framework', 'Fluid/Extbase integrations for TYPO3 enabling Fluid page templating, Fluid content elements and Extbase CommandController commands as Scheduler tasks. Contains hundreds of ViewHelpers and Widgets. Web site: http://fedext.net', 2, -1, 4, 1344894955, 'a:1:{s:7:"depends";a:5:{s:5:"typo3";s:9:"4.5-0.0.0";s:3:"cms";s:0:"";s:7:"extbase";s:0:"";s:5:"fluid";s:0:"";s:4:"flux";s:0:"";}}', 'Claus Due', 'claus@wildside.dk', 'namelesscoder', 'bc2fd9ac4d802b791bb574e38ff7240b', 'Improvements to Menu and BreadCrumb ViewHelpers. Behaviors now streamlined and merged, both ViewHelpers now support a merged set of both ViewHelpers arguments. Group access now respected by these ViewHelpers too. And a couple of handfuls of small scale ', 'Wildside A/S', 4007004, 0, 0),
(30437, 0, 'fed', 1, '4.7.5', 2210, 0, 'Fluid Extbase Development Framework', 'Fluid/Extbase integrations for TYPO3 enabling Fluid page templating, Fluid content elements and Extbase CommandController commands as Scheduler tasks. Contains hundreds of ViewHelpers and Widgets. Web site: http://fedext.net', 2, -1, 4, 1344955151, 'a:1:{s:7:"depends";a:5:{s:5:"typo3";s:9:"4.5-0.0.0";s:3:"cms";s:0:"";s:7:"extbase";s:0:"";s:5:"fluid";s:0:"";s:4:"flux";s:0:"";}}', 'Claus Due', 'claus@wildside.dk', 'namelesscoder', '9b68676158cc5bd0323a56fdf9faff2d', 'Hotfix for broken BreadCrumb ViewHelper. One small addition: class name "lvl-1" and so forth is added to the container element of nested menus, making it easier to target those through CSS such as .lvl-1 li { text-indent: 2em; }.', 'Wildside A/S', 4007005, 0, 0),
(30438, 0, 'fed', 1, '4.7.6', 2210, 0, 'Fluid Extbase Development Framework', 'Fluid/Extbase integrations for TYPO3 enabling Fluid page templating, Fluid content elements and Extbase CommandController commands as Scheduler tasks. Contains hundreds of ViewHelpers and Widgets. Web site: http://fedext.net', 2, -1, 4, 1350169481, 'a:1:{s:7:"depends";a:5:{s:5:"typo3";s:9:"4.5-0.0.0";s:3:"cms";s:0:"";s:7:"extbase";s:0:"";s:5:"fluid";s:0:"";s:4:"flux";s:0:"";}}', 'Claus Due', 'claus@wildside.dk', 'namelesscoder', 'eb476af843d58d37caa52e892d930dbd', 'Fixes to Data/SortViewHelper, a few new ViewHelpers and some general updates. Full change log can be found at https://github.com/NamelessCoder/fed/commits/master', 'Wildside A/S', 4007006, 0, 0),
(30439, 0, 'fed', 1, '4.7.7', 2210, 0, 'Fluid Extbase Development Framework', 'Fluid/Extbase integrations for TYPO3 enabling Fluid page templating, Fluid content elements and Extbase CommandController commands as Scheduler tasks. Contains hundreds of ViewHelpers and Widgets. Web site: http://fedext.net', 2, -1, 4, 1350931750, 'a:1:{s:7:"depends";a:5:{s:5:"typo3";s:9:"4.5-0.0.0";s:3:"cms";s:0:"";s:7:"extbase";s:0:"";s:5:"fluid";s:0:"";s:4:"flux";s:0:"";}}', 'Claus Due', 'claus@wildside.dk', 'namelesscoder', '74e57e35f9c262f2e9907b90c42b09a7', 'Almost purely bugfixes. Includes two additions: argument "sortFlags" for Data/SortViewHelper and argument "contentUids" on Page/RenderContentViewHelper. Full changelog: https://github.com/NamelessCoder/fed/commits/master', 'Wildside A/S', 4007007, 0, 0),
(30440, 0, 'fed', 1, '4.7.8', 2210, 0, 'Fluid Extbase Development Framework', 'Fluid/Extbase integrations for TYPO3 enabling Fluid page templating, Fluid content elements and Extbase CommandController commands as Scheduler tasks. Contains hundreds of ViewHelpers and Widgets. Web site: http://fedext.net', 2, -1, 4, 1353720978, 'a:1:{s:7:"depends";a:5:{s:5:"typo3";s:9:"4.5-0.0.0";s:3:"cms";s:0:"";s:7:"extbase";s:0:"";s:5:"fluid";s:0:"";s:4:"flux";s:0:"";}}', 'Claus Due', 'claus@wildside.dk', 'namelesscoder', '487d61e9f774365f1ea759ec7c8d77f4', 'Update consists of coding guideline cleanups thanks to Wouter Wolters, bugfixes for 4.x and 6.0 and compatibility fixes for 6.0 - in that order.', 'Wildside A/S', 4007008, 0, 0),
