(30888, 0, 'tnm_ttnewsfaq', 1, '1.0.1', 107, 14, 'Typoworx  tt-news FAQs', 'Generation of FAQs using tt_news records and dynamic javascript-effects supporting either jQuery or mootools.\n\nFor more informations and support please contact info(at)typoworx.de', 2, 0, 3, 1311783047, 'a:1:{s:7:"depends";a:1:{s:7:"tt_news";s:0:"";}}', 'Gabriel Kaufmann  Typoworx NewMedia', 'info@typoworx.de', 'typoworx-de', '7514cc2630304c58096771e2a44f8df3', 'fixed jQuery / mootools support by switching the js-library using constant-editor. jQuery is not included!', 'Typoworx NewMedia', 1000001, 0, 0),
