(31248, 0, 'gridelements', 1, '3.1.0', 645, 0, 'Grid Elements', 'This extension integrates the grid layout concept also to regular content elements - the grid elements.\r\nIt offers a lot of new features like advanced drag & drop or real references, that improve the usability of the page and list module to speed up the daily work with the backend.', 1, 0, 0, 1424167349, 'a:2:{s:7:"depends";a:4:{s:3:"cms";s:0:"";s:7:"version";s:0:"";s:3:"php";s:11:"5.3.7-0.0.0";s:5:"typo3";s:13:"6.2.0-7.99.99";}s:9:"conflicts";a:2:{s:11:"templavoila";s:0:"";s:14:"jfmulticontent";s:0:"";}}', 'Grid Elements Team', 'info@cybercraft.de', 'cybercraft', '3ad14363617a438e97ce8672d5ef4bc4', 'This is the first version of Gridelements which is widely compatible with the concept of TYPO3 workspaces. To make life easier for developers it can be installed on CMS 7 already, but there might be some issues due to the new layout of page and list modul', '', 3001000, 0, 0),
(31249, 0, 'gridelements', 1, '3.2.0', 645, 0, 'Grid Elements', 'This extension integrates the grid layout concept also to regular content elements - the grid elements.\r\nIt offers a lot of new features like advanced drag & drop or real references, that improve the usability of the page and list module to speed up the daily work with the backend.', 2, 0, 0, 1429356776, 'a:2:{s:7:"depends";a:4:{s:3:"cms";s:0:"";s:7:"version";s:0:"";s:3:"php";s:11:"5.3.7-0.0.0";s:5:"typo3";s:12:"6.2.0-6.2.99";}s:9:"conflicts";a:2:{s:11:"templavoila";s:0:"";s:14:"jfmulticontent";s:0:"";}}', 'Grid Elements Team', 'info@cybercraft.de', 'cybercraft', 'e0482db831b71bbc43157597660ce139', 'Maintenance and bugfix release for CMS 6.2.x that will NOT be compatible with CMS 7.x anymore. From now on please use the 7-1-0-compatibility branch of our Git repository on forge.typo3.org for testing and feedback for the upcoming Gridelements 4.0 releas', 'Cybercraft Media Manufactory', 3002000, 0, 0),
(31250, 0, 'gridelements', 1, '3.3.0', 645, 0, 'Grid Elements', 'This extension integrates the grid layout concept also to regular content elements - the grid elements.\r\nIt offers a lot of new features like advanced drag & drop or real references, that improve the usability of the page and list module to speed up the daily work with the backend.', 2, 0, 0, 1447847536, 'a:3:{s:7:"depends";a:3:{s:3:"cms";s:0:"";s:3:"php";s:11:"5.3.7-0.0.0";s:5:"typo3";s:12:"6.2.0-6.2.99";}s:9:"conflicts";a:2:{s:11:"templavoila";s:0:"";s:14:"jfmulticontent";s:0:"";}s:8:"suggests";a:1:{s:4:"mask";s:0:"";}}', 'Grid Elements Team', 'info@cybercraft.de', 'cybercraft', '80bb599dfc7c5edf4628957c07ce0284', 'Last version for TYPO3 6.2 with lots of fixes and a new feature: Allowed grid types! Next step: Gridelements 4.0 for TYPO3 7 LTS arriving December 7th. TYPO3 6.2 will still be supported regarding security issues. Have fun and use the sponsoring link!', 'Cybercraft Media Manufactory', 3003000, 0, 0),
(31251, 0, 'gridelements', 1, '3.3.1', 645, 0, 'Grid Elements', 'This extension integrates the grid layout concept also to regular content elements - the grid elements.\r\nIt offers a lot of new features like advanced drag & drop or real references, that improve the usability of the page and list module to speed up the daily work with the backend.', 2, 0, 0, 1448292794, 'a:3:{s:7:"depends";a:3:{s:3:"cms";s:0:"";s:3:"php";s:11:"5.3.7-0.0.0";s:5:"typo3";s:12:"6.2.0-6.2.99";}s:9:"conflicts";a:2:{s:11:"templavoila";s:0:"";s:14:"jfmulticontent";s:0:"";}s:8:"suggests";a:1:{s:4:"mask";s:0:"";}}', 'Grid Elements Team', 'info@cybercraft.de', 'cybercraft', 'f80d5175862be6a44b19460f5de5f590', 'Last version for TYPO3 6.2 with lots of fixes and a new feature: Allowed grid types! Next step: Gridelements 4.0 for TYPO3 7 LTS arriving December 7th. This minor version fixes a regression of 3.3.0  Have fun and use the sponsoring link!', 'Cybercraft Media Manufactory', 3003001, 0, 0),
(31252, 0, 'gridelements', 1, '3.3.2', 645, 0, 'Grid Elements', 'This extension integrates the grid layout concept also to regular content elements - the grid elements.\r\nIt offers a lot of new features like advanced drag & drop or real references, that improve the usability of the page and list module to speed up the daily work with the backend.', 2, 0, 0, 1449524035, 'a:3:{s:7:"depends";a:3:{s:3:"cms";s:0:"";s:3:"php";s:11:"5.3.7-0.0.0";s:5:"typo3";s:12:"6.2.0-6.2.99";}s:9:"conflicts";a:2:{s:11:"templavoila";s:0:"";s:14:"jfmulticontent";s:0:"";}s:8:"suggests";a:1:{s:4:"mask";s:0:"";}}', 'Grid Elements Team', 'info@cybercraft.de', 'cybercraft', '4a2fe41d886fdead29436d67e2702884', 'Last version for TYPO3 6.2 with lots of fixes and a new feature: Allowed grid types! Next step: Gridelements 7.0 for TYPO3 7 LTS arriving December 7th. This minor version stabilizes the 3.x branch. Have fun and use the sponsoring link!', 'Cybercraft Media Manufactory', 3003002, 0, 0),
(31253, 0, 'gridelements', 1, '7.0.0', 645, 0, 'Grid Elements', 'This extension integrates the grid layout concept also to regular content elements - the grid elements.\r\nIt offers a lot of new features like advanced drag & drop or real references, that improve the usability of the page and list module to speed up the daily work with the backend.', 1, 0, 0, 1449528252, 'a:2:{s:7:"depends";a:1:{s:5:"typo3";s:13:"7.6.0-7.99.99";}s:9:"conflicts";a:2:{s:11:"templavoila";s:0:"";s:14:"jfmulticontent";s:0:"";}}', 'Grid Elements Team', 'info@cybercraft.de', 'cybercraft', '88f708a10ac4c03fa5e446387b5e3da9', 'This is the first official version for CMS 7 LTS. No new features, but lots of UX changes, bug fixes, streamlined and refactored code and performance improvements. Thanks a lot, everybody who was involved! If its useful for you click our sponsoring link!', '', 7000000, 0, 0),
(31254, 0, 'gridelements', 1, '3.3.3', 645, 0, 'Grid Elements', 'This extension integrates the grid layout concept also to regular content elements - the grid elements.\r\nIt offers a lot of new features like advanced drag & drop or real references, that improve the usability of the page and list module to speed up the daily work with the backend.', 2, 0, 0, 1450259779, 'a:3:{s:7:"depends";a:3:{s:3:"cms";s:0:"";s:3:"php";s:11:"5.3.7-0.0.0";s:5:"typo3";s:12:"6.2.0-6.2.99";}s:9:"conflicts";a:2:{s:11:"templavoila";s:0:"";s:14:"jfmulticontent";s:0:"";}s:8:"suggests";a:1:{s:4:"mask";s:0:"";}}', 'Grid Elements Team', 'info@cybercraft.de', 'cybercraft', '503cd5d28e905bb902992e34626c42d0', 'Last version for TYPO3 6.2 with lots of fixes and a new feature: Allowed grid types! Next step: Gridelements 7.0 for TYPO3 7 LTS arriving December 7th. This minor version stabilizes the 3.x branch. Have fun and use the sponsoring link! ', 'Cybercraft Media Manufactory', 3003003, 0, 0),
(31255, 0, 'gridelements', 1, '7.0.1', 645, 0, 'Grid Elements', 'This extension integrates the grid layout concept also to regular content elements - the grid elements.\r\nIt offers a lot of new features like advanced drag & drop or real references, that improve the usability of the page and list module to speed up the daily work with the backend.', 1, 0, 0, 1450266068, 'a:2:{s:7:"depends";a:1:{s:5:"typo3";s:13:"7.6.0-7.99.99";}s:9:"conflicts";a:2:{s:11:"templavoila";s:0:"";s:14:"jfmulticontent";s:0:"";}}', 'Grid Elements Team', 'info@cybercraft.de', 'cybercraft', '805b45bd48f5de586daa0bcbb93aa80f', 'This is the stabilized official version for CMS 7 LTS. No new features, but lots of UX changes, bug fixes, streamlined and refactored code and performance improvements. Thanks a lot, everybody involved! If its useful for you click our sponsoring link! ', '', 7000001, 0, 0),
(31256, 0, 'gridelements', 1, '7.0.2', 645, 0, 'Grid Elements', 'This extension integrates the grid layout concept also to regular content elements - the grid elements.\r\nIt offers a lot of new features like advanced drag & drop or real references, that improve the usability of the page and list module to speed up the daily work with the backend.', 1, 0, 0, 1450475954, 'a:2:{s:7:"depends";a:1:{s:5:"typo3";s:13:"7.6.0-7.99.99";}s:9:"conflicts";a:2:{s:11:"templavoila";s:0:"";s:14:"jfmulticontent";s:0:"";}}', 'Grid Elements Team', 'info@cybercraft.de', 'cybercraft', '660286ba367f1936e8196314831ee507', 'Stabilization release. Drag & Drop, " Content", "paste" and "copy from another page" buttons have been adjusted to new core way of handling translations. You must set mod.web_layout.allowInconsistentLanguageHandling to get back old behaviour. See notes!', '', 7000002, 0, 0),
(31257, 0, 'gridelements', 1, '7.0.3', 645, 0, 'Grid Elements', 'This extension integrates the grid layout concept also to regular content elements - the grid elements.\r\nIt offers a lot of new features like advanced drag & drop or real references, that improve the usability of the page and list module to speed up the daily work with the backend.', 1, 0, 0, 1450621128, 'a:2:{s:7:"depends";a:1:{s:5:"typo3";s:13:"7.6.0-7.99.99";}s:9:"conflicts";a:2:{s:11:"templavoila";s:0:"";s:14:"jfmulticontent";s:0:"";}}', 'Grid Elements Team', 'info@cybercraft.de', 'cybercraft', '2870553230e1c4cbef47373000978fc2', 'Stabilization release. Drag & Drop, " Content", "paste" and "copy from another page" buttons have been adjusted to new core way of handling translations. You must set mod.web_layout.allowInconsistentLanguageHandling to get back old behaviour. See notes!', '', 7000003, 0, 0),
(31258, 0, 'gridelements', 1, '7.0.4', 645, 0, 'Grid Elements', 'This extension integrates the grid layout concept also to regular content elements - the grid elements.\r\nIt offers a lot of new features like advanced drag & drop or real references, that improve the usability of the page and list module to speed up the daily work with the backend.', 1, 0, 0, 1450971281, 'a:2:{s:7:"depends";a:1:{s:5:"typo3";s:13:"7.6.1-7.99.99";}s:9:"conflicts";a:2:{s:11:"templavoila";s:0:"";s:14:"jfmulticontent";s:0:"";}}', 'Grid Elements Team', 'info@cybercraft.de', 'cybercraft', 'dd79863f374cae0c50b7e01adda0395c', 'Stabilization release. Drag & Drop, "Content", "paste" and "copy from another page" buttons adjusted to new core way of translation handling. Set mod.web_layout.allowInconsistentLanguageHandling to get back old behaviour. See notes! Happy Xmas everybody!', '', 7000004, 0, 0),
(31259, 0, 'gridelements', 1, '3.3.4', 645, 0, 'Grid Elements', 'This extension integrates the grid layout concept also to regular content elements - the grid elements.\r\nIt offers a lot of new features like advanced drag & drop or real references, that improve the usability of the page and list module to speed up the daily work with the backend.', 2, 0, 0, 1454068532, 'a:3:{s:7:"depends";a:3:{s:3:"cms";s:0:"";s:3:"php";s:11:"5.3.7-0.0.0";s:5:"typo3";s:12:"6.2.0-6.2.99";}s:9:"conflicts";a:2:{s:11:"templavoila";s:0:"";s:14:"jfmulticontent";s:0:"";}s:8:"suggests";a:1:{s:4:"mask";s:0:"";}}', 'Grid Elements Team', 'info@cybercraft.de', 'cybercraft', '9368fef6dbe9d4e51c43dc17cb3ca782', 'Minor bugfix for users of news with additional content elements. Will work for TYPO3 version 6.2.x only!', 'Cybercraft Media Manufactory', 3003004, 0, 0),
(31260, 0, 'gridelements', 1, '7.0.5', 645, 0, 'Grid Elements', 'This extension integrates the grid layout concept also to regular content elements - the grid elements.\r\nIt offers a lot of new features like advanced drag & drop or real references, that improve the usability of the page and list module to speed up the daily work with the backend.', 1, 0, 0, 1454069405, 'a:2:{s:7:"depends";a:1:{s:5:"typo3";s:13:"7.6.2-7.99.99";}s:9:"conflicts";a:2:{s:11:"templavoila";s:0:"";s:14:"jfmulticontent";s:0:"";}}', 'Grid Elements Team', 'info@cybercraft.de', 'cybercraft', '9f1e1db3fe46b93f7628ab321da16f80', 'Stabilization release. Code has been cleaned up and some minor bugs have been fixed. PAGE_TSCONFIG_ID can deal with CSV lists of IDs now. Be sure to have at least TYPO3 7.6.2 installed before upgrading.', '', 7000005, 0, 0),
(31261, 0, 'gridelements', 1, '3.4.0', 645, 0, 'Grid Elements', 'This extension integrates the grid layout concept also to regular content elements - the grid elements.\r\nIt offers a lot of new features like advanced drag & drop or real references, that improve the usability of the page and list module to speed up the daily work with the backend.', 2, 0, 0, 1489409378, 'a:3:{s:7:"depends";a:3:{s:3:"cms";s:0:"";s:3:"php";s:11:"5.3.7-0.0.0";s:5:"typo3";s:12:"6.2.0-6.2.99";}s:9:"conflicts";a:2:{s:11:"templavoila";s:0:"";s:14:"jfmulticontent";s:0:"";}s:8:"suggests";a:1:{s:4:"mask";s:0:"";}}', 'Grid Elements Team', 'info@cybercraft.de', 'cybercraft', 'e86ad07b57ee6f4f2fda9fcc1ea7b737', 'This is the final maintenance release of Gridelements for TYPO3 CMS 6 - upcoming releases will only contain security fixes. Please upgrade to CMS 7 or 8 to get new features and bug fixes of Gridelements and checkout the official TYPO3 Git repository for t', 'Cybercraft Media Manufactory', 3004000, 0, 0),
(31262, 0, 'gridelements', 1, '7.1.0', 645, 0, 'Grid Elements', 'This extension integrates the grid layout concept also to regular content elements - the grid elements.\r\nIt offers a lot of new features like advanced drag & drop or real references, that improve the usability of the page and list module to speed up the daily work with the backend.', 1, 0, 0, 1489410177, 'a:2:{s:7:"depends";a:1:{s:5:"typo3";s:13:"7.6.0-7.99.99";}s:9:"conflicts";a:2:{s:11:"templavoila";s:0:"";s:14:"jfmulticontent";s:0:"";}}', 'Grid Elements Team', 'info@cybercraft.de', 'cybercraft', 'ac1fdfa9cf133eacdd0c6692f878e3de', 'This is a maintenance release of Gridelements for CMS 7 LTS which contains lots of fixes and some changes which were available via Git and Composer only. Hopefully none of them is breaking for you. See the Git log linked in Changelog for a detailed list. ', '', 7001000, 1, 0),
