(31484, 0, 'google_auth', 1, '1.0.6', 71, 4, 'Google OpenAuth v2', 'Google OAuth2 implementation. Authorize your fe_users remotely, then creates a local fe_users record with data from Google Account for use in access protection. Login form can be replaced by one button - all auth happens at Google Apps. Requires Google Ap', 1, 0, 5, 1317297263, 'a:1:{s:7:"depends";a:3:{s:3:"cms";s:0:"";s:7:"extbase";s:0:"";s:5:"fluid";s:0:"";}}', 'Claus Due', 'claus@wildside.dk', 'namelesscoder', '161d7e355384b4086ef5f30a0be6cd24', 'Fixed session-related token re-authentication bug. This brings the extension up to a stable level; will keep BETA status until error feedback and edgecase handling is done.', 'Wildside A/S', 1000006, 0, 0),
(31485, 0, 'google_auth', 1, '1.0.7', 71, 14, 'Google OpenAuth v2', 'Google OAuth2 implementation. Authorize your fe_users remotely, then creates a local fe_users record with data from Google Account for use in access protection. Login form can be replaced by one button - all auth happens at Google Apps. Requires Google Ap', 1, 0, 5, 1317304290, 'a:1:{s:7:"depends";a:3:{s:3:"cms";s:0:"";s:7:"extbase";s:0:"";s:5:"fluid";s:0:"";}}', 'Claus Due', 'claus@wildside.dk', 'namelesscoder', '3c18884f19c16f016cee9c20f7d356e4', 'Removed debug statement included by mistake.', 'Wildside A/S', 1000007, 0, 0),
(31486, 0, 'google_auth', 1, '1.0.8', 71, 12, 'Google OpenAuth v2', 'Google OAuth2 implementation. Authorize your fe_users remotely, then creates a local fe_users record with data from Google Account for use in access protection. Login form can be replaced by one button - all auth happens at Google Apps. Requires Google Ap', 1, 0, 5, 1325687713, 'a:1:{s:7:"depends";a:3:{s:3:"cms";s:0:"";s:7:"extbase";s:0:"";s:5:"fluid";s:0:"";}}', 'Claus Due', 'claus@wildside.dk', 'namelesscoder', 'cb0361d41dc5820ff7f1a2b1d255b10e', 'Removed usage of classes from extension fed. Added exception messages at multiple points in the authentication process, giving more detailed error messages (in sys_log) when errors occur.', 'Wildside A/S', 1000008, 0, 0),
(31487, 0, 'google_auth', 1, '1.0.9', 71, 12, 'Google OpenAuth v2', 'Google OAuth2 implementation. Authorize your fe_users remotely, then creates a local fe_users record with data from Google Account for use in access protection. Login form can be replaced by one button - all auth happens at Google Apps. Requires Google Ap', 1, 0, 5, 1326300321, 'a:1:{s:7:"depends";a:3:{s:3:"cms";s:0:"";s:7:"extbase";s:0:"";s:5:"fluid";s:0:"";}}', 'Claus Due', 'claus@wildside.dk', 'namelesscoder', '6f557a4222429aa02d2c060d8b14c1c0', 'Config settings for the HTTP query building parameters numericArrayPrefix and argumentSeparator added, necessary for some endpoints. Default separator changed to unescaped ampersand for compatibility. Thanks to Patrick Bierans for bringing the issue to my', 'Wildside A/S', 1000009, 0, 0),
(31488, 0, 'google_auth', 1, '2.0.0', 71, 0, 'Google OpenAuth v2', 'Google OAuth2 implementation. Authorize your fe_users remotely, then creates a local fe_users record with data from Google Account for use in access protection. Login form can be replaced by one button - all auth happens at Google Apps. Requires Google App registration.', 1, 0, 5, 1335527483, 'a:1:{s:7:"depends";a:3:{s:3:"cms";s:0:"";s:7:"extbase";s:0:"";s:5:"fluid";s:0:"";}}', 'Claus Due', 'claus@wildside.dk', 'namelesscoder', '686e59d4031f79c2e0dc5504723bd106', 'Now uses Google PHP API, some bugfixes and performance boosts. VERY IMPORTANT: New default auth scope, add to your extension config: https://www.googleapis.com/auth/userinfo.profile https://www.googleapis.com/auth/userinfo.email', 'Wildside A/S', 2000000, 0, 0),
(31489, 0, 'google_auth', 1, '3.0.0', 71, 0, 'Google OpenAuth v2', 'Google OAuth2 implementation. Authorize your fe_users remotely, then creates a local fe_users record with data from Google Account for use in access protection. Login form can be replaced by one button - all auth happens at Google Apps. Requires Google App registration.', 1, 0, 5, 1343423509, 'a:1:{s:7:"depends";a:3:{s:3:"cms";s:0:"";s:7:"extbase";s:0:"";s:5:"fluid";s:0:"";}}', 'Claus Due', 'claus@wildside.dk', 'namelesscoder', '8844eaf2b0d4d0959c8c13848788d1db', 'BE login now supported. FE/BE login enables individually. Logout bug fixed. Small user profile (Extbase) editing form plugin added. Demonstration screen cast: http://www.youtube.com/watch?vhllTYB0S34U', 'Wildside A/S', 3000000, 0, 0),
(31490, 0, 'google_auth', 1, '4.0.0', 71, 0, 'Google OpenAuth v2', 'Google OAuth2 implementation. Authorize your fe_users remotely, then creates a local fe_users record with data from Google Account for use in access protection. Login form can be replaced by one button - all auth happens at Google Apps. Requires Google App registration.', 1, 0, 5, 1343423646, 'a:1:{s:7:"depends";a:3:{s:3:"cms";s:0:"";s:7:"extbase";s:0:"";s:5:"fluid";s:0:"";}}', 'Claus Due', 'claus@wildside.dk', 'namelesscoder', '4fd0f29836692a4a4d2c112ac7bf215a', 'BE login now supported. FE/BE login enables individually. Logout bug fixed. Small user profile (Extbase) editing form plugin added. Demonstration screen cast: http://www.youtube.com/watch?vhllTYB0S34U', 'Wildside A/S', 4000000, 1, 0),
