(31612, 0, 'ccm_caretakerapp', 1, '2.0.0', 36, 36, 'ccm_caretakerapp', 'interface for caretaker and an iphone/ipad-App', 2, 0, 4, 1318447761, 'a:0:{}', 'Angela Rush', 'arush@cross-content.com', 'crosscontent', '5cb68b663cfe653d3a912fb0e7d5bd09', 'a TYPO3 extension that must be installed and configured on your Caretaker Server TYPO3-Installation, if you want to use the caretake functionality of the iPhone app T3Info. It is required to establish a connection to your mobile device.', 'Cross Content Media GmbH', 2000000, 1, 0),
