(32236, 0, 'tcemainhooks', 1, '1.0.2', 22, 15, 'SIMPLE interface to hook into tcemain', 'Usually you need four hook methods and some more logic to hook into tcemain to get informed whenever a record is updated, created or deleted.\nThis extension provides a simple interface that informs you on those changes. It provides you with two hooks , on', 0, 0, 0, 1327667138, 'a:0:{}', 'Michael Knabe', 'michael.knabe@e-net.info', 'michi.k', '04585653f6c24796585caaa6d311daf2', ' Manual cleaned up\n Updated e-mail-address', '', 1000002, 1, 0),
