(32516, 0, 't3cufon', 1, '2.1.0', 42, 0, 'cufon for TYPO3', 'An extension for easy usage / integration of cufon fonts.', 2, 0, 2, 1335522111, 'a:0:{}', 'Felix Kiesewetter', 'info@felixkiesewetter.de', 'felixkiesewetter', '1cba70685652ffa56d1f901ecc743a6a', '- External link directly to cufn online generator in font configuration TCA\r\n\r\n- font name is fetched from .JS file directly, no need to specify it explicitly anymore\r\n\r\n- fixed a bug with the included JavaScript libraries', '', 2001000, 0, 0),
