(32522, 0, 't3cufon', 1, '2.3.3', 42, 0, 'cufon for TYPO3', 'An extension for easy usage / integration of cufon fonts.', 2, 0, 2, 1370272351, 'a:1:{s:7:"depends";a:3:{s:3:"cms";s:0:"";s:3:"php";s:12:"5.0.0-5.3.99";s:5:"typo3";s:12:"4.3.0-6.0.99";}}', 'Felix Kiesewetter', 'info@felixkiesewetter.de', 'felixkiesewetter', '4a3c8e2c76314ad111071f6580eaba01', '2013-06-03 Felix Kiesewetter  info@felixkiesewetter.de\n\n	 2.3.3\n	 German Localisation\n	 TS constant "pid" not needed anymore\n	 Language "default" as default for selectbox\n	 Added "title" field to cufon fonts\n\n2013-03-09 Felix Kiesewetter  in', '', 2003003, 0, 0),
