(32532, 0, 'extbase_ajax', 1, '0.0.2', 16, 10, 'AJAX for Extbase', 'Allows calls to controllers/actions via AJAX calls using modal windows and message boxes provided by jQuery. AJAX communication is configured (almost) automatically.', 0, 0, 3, 1330418427, 'a:1:{s:7:"depends";a:3:{s:3:"cms";s:0:"";s:7:"extbase";s:0:"";s:5:"fluid";s:0:"";}}', 'Christoph Balogh', 'cb@lustige-informatik.at', 'cbalogh', 'd27f615361848c49c4e08b156f14f6da', 'Added callback function to modalMessage dialog in order to refresh views.', 'DI Christoph Balogh GmbH', 2, 0, 0),
