(32983, 0, 'dropbox_sync', 1, '0.9.1', 10, 1, 'Dropbox Syncronization', 'Scheduler Task to sync a fileadmin folder with a Dropbox account folder. Sync additional folders/accounts by adding additional Scheduler Tasks.', 0, 0, 4, 1333225564, 'a:0:{}', 'Claus Due', 'claus@wildside.dk', 'abandoned_extensions', 'ffa3cf92ba813ae4de93c2bf05a65d1a', 'ALPHA TEST supports only 5 simultaneous users while awaiting verification from Dropbox. Please set your scheduled task intervals as high as possible (15min is nice) and not below five minutes, in order to leave room for other testers in the alpha phase -', 'Wildside A/S', 9001, 0, 0),
