(33096, 0, 'sf_register', 1, '1.4.0', 0, 0, 'FeUser Register', 'Offers the possibility to maintain the fe_user data in frontend by the user self.', 1, -1, 4, 1334321639, 'a:1:{s:7:"depends";a:4:{s:3:"php";s:11:"5.3.0-0.0.0";s:5:"typo3";s:11:"4.5.0-0.0.0";s:7:"extbase";s:11:"1.3.0-0.0.0";s:5:"fluid";s:11:"1.3.0-0.0.0";}}', 'Sebastian Fischer', 'typo3@evoweb.de', 'sfischer', '1755d7c31f6e983163f709052afa6e4f', 'Initial upload with a version working in TYPO3 4.5. If you have any problems be sure to not have a higher version.', 'evoweb', 1004000, 0, 0),
(33097, 0, 'sf_register', 1, '6.0.0', 0, 0, 'Frontend User Register', 'Offers the possibility to maintain the fe_user data in frontend by the user self.', 2, -1, 3, 1373367124, 'a:1:{s:7:"depends";a:3:{s:5:"typo3";s:12:"6.0.0-6.0.99";s:7:"extbase";s:12:"6.0.0-6.0.99";s:5:"fluid";s:12:"6.0.0-6.0.99";}}', 'Sebastian Fischer', 'typo3@evoweb.de', 'sfischer', '57fcee81c2c4024876984260cf9050cf', 'Complete refactory to achieve compatability to TYPO3 cms 6.0\r\n\r\nCould run in heigher versions if you edit ext_emconf. Havent tested it by now.', 'evoweb', 6000000, 0, 0),
