(33258, 0, 'fluidwidget', 1, '0.1.0', 0, 0, 'Fluid Widgets', 'A collection of standalone Widgets usable in Fluid templates.', 0, 0, 4, 1335716897, 'a:1:{s:7:"depends";a:3:{s:3:"cms";s:0:"";s:7:"extbase";s:0:"";s:5:"fluid";s:0:"";}}', 'Claus Due', 'claus@wildside.dk', 'fluidtypo3', '360fe08c45e43cd9fc75d1f1549500ec', 'Initial version includes file protection Widget and Bootstrap resources which can be easily included. More to come soon.', 'Wildside A/S', 1000, 0, 0),
(33259, 0, 'fluidwidget', 1, '1.0.0', 0, 0, 'Fluid Widgets', 'A collection of standalone Widgets usable in Fluid templates.', 1, 0, 4, 1350169805, 'a:1:{s:7:"depends";a:3:{s:3:"cms";s:0:"";s:7:"extbase";s:0:"";s:5:"fluid";s:0:"";}}', 'Claus Due', 'claus@wildside.dk', 'fluidtypo3', '136bc0daf63ac656cf94d0b22e867980', 'Includes a few Widgets such as a file access protection-, subrequest- and AJAX loader for Flux content elements. Full change log can be found at https://github.com/NamelessCoder/fluidwidget/commits/master', 'Wildside A/S', 1000000, 0, 0),
(33260, 0, 'fluidwidget', 1, '1.0.1', 0, 0, 'Fluid Widgets', 'A collection of standalone Widgets usable in Fluid templates.', 1, 0, 4, 1351346502, 'a:1:{s:7:"depends";a:3:{s:3:"cms";s:0:"";s:7:"extbase";s:0:"";s:5:"fluid";s:0:"";}}', 'Claus Due', 'claus@wildside.dk', 'fluidtypo3', 'f649c5ef7ca4335341cae2882217b1cd', 'Bugfix: replaced usage of FED Path Utility with ported version. Standalone was broken in Uri-based Widgets. Thanks to Tobias Pinnekamp. As always the full changelog can be found at https://github.com/NamelessCoder/fluidwidget/commits/master', 'Wildside A/S', 1000001, 0, 0),
(33261, 0, 'fluidwidget', 1, '1.1.0', 0, 0, 'Fluid Widgets', 'A collection of standalone Widgets usable in Fluid templates.', 1, 0, 4, 1356911872, 'a:1:{s:7:"depends";a:3:{s:3:"cms";s:0:"";s:7:"extbase";s:0:"";s:5:"fluid";s:0:"";}}', 'Claus Due', 'claus@wildside.dk', 'fluidtypo3', '949e617b5b61a91888ffc9b4a20c4b0a', 'New: Abstract Widget Controller and ViewHelper classes to decouple your Widget Controllers from the Singleton pattern - which means that every Widget of the same type no longer share the same Controller instance. Especially useful for AJAX Widgets.', 'Wildside A/S', 1001000, 1, 0),
