(33538, 0, 'flickrimages', 1, '0.0.3', 0, 0, 'Flickr Images', 'Display flickr images on your website, either your own images or other peoples by keywords, or using keywords from the page or a single displayed record.', 1, 0, 3, 1348521263, 'a:1:{s:7:"depends";a:3:{s:3:"cms";s:3:"4.6";s:7:"extbase";s:5:"1.4.1";s:5:"fluid";s:5:"1.4.1";}}', 'Stephen Bungert', 'stephenbungert@yahoo.de', 'stephenbungert', '7f15eef3f2889259dc28ff5f5880fd1e', ' Bug fixed: Sets and caching  the wrong cache attributes were used causing all instances of flickrimages set to show Sets, to show the same content. Thanks to Thomas Blasche for reporting this issue!  Changed the image viewhelper to allow easier addi', '', 3, 0, 0),
