(33589, 0, 'xf_googlepagespeed', 1, '0.0.1', 0, 0, 'Google Pagespeed', 'Google Pagespeed extension get from Google Pagespeed API for statistics form every site in your sitemap(s) and show your mistakes or problems.', 999, 0, 1, 1340982740, 'a:1:{s:7:"depends";a:2:{s:3:"php";s:11:"5.3.0-0.0.0";s:5:"typo3";s:11:"4.5.0-0.0.0";}}', 'Xaver Maierhofer', 'xaver.maierhofer@xwissen.info', 'x--f', 'b9a3ae30e61421b4fe1a3cf808997b33', 'Initial release. It works, you need a API Key, but the Code need some cleanup/translation. Please report problems on forge site or via mail. Big THX2 Google, for higher limit and the service.', 'Sam-City', 1, 0, 0);
