(33721, 0, 'crystalis', 1, '1.3.2', 0, 0, 'Crystalis', 'The Crystalis package project. The goal is to provide an own content rendering-, news- and gallery-system. Rendering will be processed with as many Typoscript as possible. THIS EXTENSION IS WORK IN PROGRESS. ONLY CONTENT RENDERING HAS GOT FINISHED SO FAR.', 0, 0, 2, 1369240619, 'a:1:{s:7:"depends";a:1:{s:5:"typo3";s:9:"6.0-0.0.0";}}', 'Daniel Haring', 'daniel@haring.co.at', 'cirgan', '9934084de7d46aa2e76b0ff335aa9097', 'ADAPTATION: No hgroup tag will be rendered any more when working with HTML5 doctype. This tag was removed from the W3Cs HTML5 specification.', '', 1003002, 0, 0),
