(34027, 0, 'jh_basketballbund_import', 1, '0.0.1', 0, 0, 'basketball-bund.net - import', 'Import tables, results, playing schedules and statistics from basketball-bund.net to your website.', 0, 0, 3, 1347827059, 'a:0:{}', 'Jonathan Heilmann', 'mail@jonathan-heilmann.de', 'roboterfreak', '42c541550e8d0f785cbb32fe0b515d20', 'Very initial version. \nAt the moment just the tables are working, the documentation is missing.\nIm still working on this extension but i want to provide the fully working version as soon as possible!', '', 1, 0, 0),
