(34143, 0, 'autositemap', 1, '0.9.1', 0, 0, 'Auto grouping sitemap and menu', 'Plugin for a sitemap and menu which groups the first four menus in first four columns and all others in a fifth column. Great menus will get a linebreak. Configuration is based on TypoScript HMENU.', 0, 0, 3, 1349032783, 'a:0:{}', 'Dirk Wildt (Die Netzmacher)', 'http://wildt.at.die-netzmacher.de', 'dwildt', '5901037c42a512c1281d27cf81b17eac', 'autositemap generates a sitemap or menu in columns.\nautositemap tries to split menus for the best design. It is usefull for a footer navigation. Ten designs are possible.', '', 9001, 0, 0),
