(34392, 0, 'in2publish_core', 1, '5.3.1', 0, 0, 'in2publish Core', 'Content publishing extension to connect stage and production server', 2, 0, 3, 1479990786, 'a:1:{s:7:"depends";a:2:{s:5:"typo3";s:12:"6.2.0-8.5.99";s:3:"php";s:13:"5.3.0-7.99.99";}}', 'Alex Kellner, Oliver Eglseder, Thomas Scheibitz', 'alexander.kellner@in2code.de, oliver.eglseder@in2code.de, thomas.scheibitz@in2code.de', 'in2code', 'f5bdde8725005c2d0b19c2cdee679af2', '6.2 compat & Travis CI\r\n\r\nThis release fixes a Bug that occurs together with TYPO3 6.2.x. Your installation might be affected even if you did not experience an error in the Publish Tools Tests when your foreign Server runs with production settings.\r\nThe s', 'in2code.de', 5003001, 0, 0),
