(34623, 0, 'schemaker', 1, '2.0.0', 0, 0, 'Schemaker: Fluid ViewHelper Schema Generator', 'Generates XSD schemas (and optional browsable schema as FE plugin) for the ViewHelpers in any installed extension in its current version. See: https://github.com/NamelessCoder/schemaker', 2, 0, 4, 1357149180, 'a:1:{s:7:"depends";a:4:{s:5:"typo3";s:9:"4.5-0.0.0";s:3:"cms";s:0:"";s:7:"extbase";s:0:"";s:5:"fluid";s:0:"";}}', 'Claus Due', 'claus@wildside.dk', 'fluidtypo3', '675e583854d8b40925927051efce3626', 'New: FE plugin to render browsable ViewHelper docs, enable in extension config, used to render the docs on http://fedext.net/viewhelpers.html. Works well with EXT:extbase_realurl.', 'Wildside A/S', 2000000, 0, 0),
