(34693, 0, 'pdf_generator2_hotfix', 1, '0.21.2', 0, 0, ' PHP 5.3)', '[Hotfix for TYPO3 4.6 & PHP 5.3 modified by Oliver Schlbe] This Extension renders the pagecontent to a PDF file.\nIt supports css and does NOT need an external program to perform the conversion. It can use either fpdf or pdflib.', 2, 0, 4, 1354278654, 'a:2:{s:7:"depends";a:2:{s:5:"typo3";s:11:"4.6.0-0.0.0";s:3:"php";s:11:"5.3.0-0.0.0";}s:9:"conflicts";a:2:{s:13:"pdf_generator";s:0:"";s:14:"pdf_generator2";s:0:"";}}', 'Oliver Schlbe', 'scripts@schloebe.de', 'joppnet', '854a7db42f8636fb765cec5b3ee4fae9', 'Hotfix for TYPO3 4.6 & PHP 5.3.\nFixes these PHP/TYPO3 errors:\n- Fatal error: Class t3lib_div not found\n- Error while trying the pdfconversion - Maybe the gen_pdf.php script was not executed at all.', '', 21002, 0, 0),
(34694, 0, 'pdf_generator2_hotfix', 1, '0.21.3', 0, 0, ' PHP 5.3)', '[Hotfix for TYPO3 4.6 & PHP 5.3 modified by Oliver Schlbe] This Extension renders the pagecontent to a PDF file.\nIt supports css and does NOT need an external program to perform the conversion. It can use either fpdf or pdflib.', 2, 0, 4, 1354291437, 'a:0:{}', 'Oliver Schlbe', 'scripts@schloebe.de', 'joppnet', '4e772c4ef1eb9aa2e47e9def89fbc883', 'Enabled cache for pdf generation', '', 21003, 0, 0),
(34695, 0, 'pdf_generator2_hotfix', 1, '0.21.4', 0, 0, ' PHP 5.3)', '[Hotfix for TYPO3 4.6 & PHP 5.3 modified by Oliver Schloebe] This Extension renders the pagecontent to a PDF file.\nIt supports css and does NOT need an external program to perform the conversion. It can use either fpdf or pdflib.', 1, 0, 4, 1354368337, 'a:2:{s:7:"depends";a:2:{s:5:"typo3";s:11:"4.6.0-0.0.0";s:3:"php";s:11:"5.3.0-0.0.0";}s:9:"conflicts";a:2:{s:13:"pdf_generator";s:0:"";s:14:"pdf_generator2";s:0:"";}}', 'Oliver Schloebe', 'scripts@schloebe.de', 'joppnet', '46795841b50907471facbf303bae0c0a', 'Hotfix for TYPO3 4.6 & PHP 5.3. Fixes these PHP/TYPO3 errors:\n- Fatal error: Class t3lib_div not found\n- Error while trying the pdfconversion\n- Maybe the gen_pdf.php script was not executed at all.\n- Enabled no_cache for pdf generation per default for Web', '', 21004, 0, 0),
(34696, 0, 'pdf_generator2_hotfix', 1, '0.21.5', 0, 0, ' PHP 5.3)', '[Hotfix for TYPO3 4.6 & PHP 5.3 modified by Oliver Schloebe] This Extension renders the pagecontent to a PDF file.\nIt supports css and does NOT need an external program to perform the conversion. It can use either fpdf or pdflib.', 1, 0, 4, 1367260347, 'a:2:{s:7:"depends";a:2:{s:5:"typo3";s:11:"4.6.0-0.0.0";s:3:"php";s:11:"5.3.0-0.0.0";}s:9:"conflicts";a:2:{s:13:"pdf_generator";s:0:"";s:14:"pdf_generator2";s:0:"";}}', 'Oliver Schloebe', 'scripts@schloebe.de', 'joppnet', '7f20e3422cd4d13f3351c4a9d0261689', '- Preparations for TYPO3 TER clean up\n- Fixed a bug that still caused the Maybe the gen_pdf.php script was not executed at all. error to show up', '', 21005, 0, 0),
(34697, 0, 'pdf_generator2_hotfix', 1, '0.21.6', 0, 0, ' PHP 5.3)', '[Hotfix for TYPO3 4.6 & PHP 5.3 modified by Oliver Schloebe] This Extension renders the pagecontent to a PDF file.\nIt supports css and does NOT need an external program to perform the conversion. It can use either fpdf or pdflib.', 1, 0, 4, 1367260556, 'a:2:{s:7:"depends";a:2:{s:5:"typo3";s:11:"4.6.0-6.2.0";s:3:"php";s:12:"5.3.0-5.5.99";}s:9:"conflicts";a:2:{s:13:"pdf_generator";s:0:"";s:14:"pdf_generator2";s:0:"";}}', 'Oliver Schloebe', 'scripts@schloebe.de', 'joppnet', '3d3e87633948c7788f5b506220b24d7e', '- Preparations for TYPO3 TER clean up\n- Fixed a bug that still caused the Maybe the gen_pdf.php script was not executed at all. error to show up', '', 21006, 1, 0),
