(34701, 0, 'fluidpages', 1, '1.0.0', 0, 0, 'Fluid Page Templates', 'Fluid Page Template engine - integrates compact and highly dynamic page templates with all the benefits of Fluid.', 2, 0, 4, 1354473654, 'a:2:{s:7:"depends";a:3:{s:5:"typo3";s:9:"4.5-0.0.0";s:3:"cms";s:0:"";s:4:"flux";s:5:"5.0.0";}s:9:"conflicts";a:1:{s:11:"templavoila";s:0:"";}}', 'Claus Due', 'claus@wildside.dk', 'fluidtypo3', 'c39fb5221ae5614dab02327d5df82cf0', 'First TER version. The Fluid Page Templates feature extracted from the FED extension - compatible with existing FED page templates.', 'Wildside A/S', 1000000, 0, 0),
(34702, 0, 'fluidpages', 1, '1.0.1', 0, 0, 'Fluid Page Templates', 'Fluid Page Template engine - integrates compact and highly dynamic page templates with all the benefits of Fluid.', 2, 0, 4, 1355650796, 'a:2:{s:7:"depends";a:3:{s:5:"typo3";s:9:"4.5-0.0.0";s:3:"cms";s:0:"";s:4:"flux";s:5:"5.0.0";}s:9:"conflicts";a:1:{s:11:"templavoila";s:0:"";}}', 'Claus Due', 'claus@wildside.dk', 'fluidtypo3', '9657cf88b303df684128c283240042a7', 'Bugfix to avoid an error when editing page properties.', 'Wildside A/S', 1000001, 0, 0),
(34703, 0, 'fluidpages', 1, '1.1.0', 0, 0, 'Fluid Page Templates', 'Fluid Page Template engine - integrates compact and highly dynamic page templates with all the benefits of Fluid.', 2, 0, 4, 1356913394, 'a:2:{s:7:"depends";a:3:{s:5:"typo3";s:9:"4.5-0.0.0";s:3:"cms";s:0:"";s:4:"flux";s:5:"5.0.0";}s:9:"conflicts";a:1:{s:11:"templavoila";s:0:"";}}', 'Claus Due', 'claus@wildside.dk', 'fluidtypo3', '7ed2d99544843e7fa48a7019ee9fbea0', 'Ported the sample page template to EXT:fluidpages_bootstrap (where more templates will be added). To migrate if you were using the sample page: simply install EXT:fluidpages_bootstrap and include the new static TS.', 'Wildside A/S', 1001000, 0, 0),
(34704, 0, 'fluidpages', 1, '1.1.1', 0, 0, 'Fluid Pages Engine', 'Fluid Page Template engine - integrates compact and highly dynamic page templates with all the benefits of Fluid.', 2, 0, 4, 1357690608, 'a:2:{s:7:"depends";a:3:{s:5:"typo3";s:9:"4.5-0.0.0";s:3:"cms";s:0:"";s:4:"flux";s:5:"5.0.0";}s:9:"conflicts";a:1:{s:11:"templavoila";s:0:"";}}', 'Claus Due', 'claus@wildside.dk', 'fluidtypo3', 'bd482a059b4faec9a7b13c38e2fdb194', 'Purely bugfixes - improves error resilience, mainly in template file resolution.', 'Wildside A/S', 1001001, 0, 0),
(34705, 0, 'fluidpages', 1, '1.1.2', 0, 0, 'Fluid Pages Engine', 'Fluid Page Template engine - integrates compact and highly dynamic page templates with all the benefits of Fluid.', 2, 0, 4, 1357841807, 'a:2:{s:7:"depends";a:3:{s:5:"typo3";s:9:"4.5-0.0.0";s:3:"cms";s:0:"";s:4:"flux";s:5:"5.0.0";}s:9:"conflicts";a:1:{s:11:"templavoila";s:0:"";}}', 'Claus Due', 'claus@wildside.dk', 'fluidtypo3', 'ed1caaa63c30c60fbd70c0ad21441bb5', 'Bugfixes, 6.0 related.', 'Wildside A/S', 1001002, 0, 0),
(34706, 0, 'fluidpages', 1, '1.2.0', 0, 0, 'Fluid Pages Engine', 'Fluid Page Template engine - integrates compact and highly dynamic page templates with all the benefits of Fluid.', 2, 0, 4, 1359909479, 'a:2:{s:7:"depends";a:3:{s:5:"typo3";s:9:"4.5-0.0.0";s:3:"cms";s:0:"";s:4:"flux";s:5:"5.0.0";}s:9:"conflicts";a:1:{s:11:"templavoila";s:0:"";}}', 'Claus Due', 'claus@wildside.dk', 'fluidtypo3', 'f3cfbea421d21ce71c97ebdf66757f52', 'New: page variable inheritance (requires the just released latest Flux update; install it before this one). Added error page template support. And a few bugfixes.', 'Wildside A/S', 1002000, 0, 0),
(34707, 0, 'fluidpages', 1, '1.3.0', 0, 0, 'Fluid Pages Engine', 'Fluid Page Template engine - integrates compact and highly dynamic page templates with all the benefits of Fluid.', 2, 0, 4, 1363561251, 'a:2:{s:7:"depends";a:3:{s:5:"typo3";s:9:"4.5-0.0.0";s:3:"cms";s:0:"";s:4:"flux";s:5:"5.0.0";}s:9:"conflicts";a:1:{s:11:"templavoila";s:0:"";}}', 'Claus Due', 'claus@wildside.dk', 'fluidtypo3', '6c2ef69dde8a5879c66f052de8731a85', 'New: Icon (nicely sized) based selection of page templates. Paste and paste reference for root columns in the BE page module. Colspan can now be used to affect widths of page columns when using the integrated BE layout.', 'Wildside A/S', 1003000, 0, 0),
