(34978, 0, 'comvosfilelist', 1, '1.0.2', 0, 0, 'Frontend Filelist', 'Filelist with DAM support and secure file handling using TYPO3-build-in security-mechanisms.', 2, 0, 2, 1359985303, 'a:2:{s:7:"depends";a:1:{s:5:"typo3";s:12:"4.3.0-4.7.99";}s:9:"conflicts";a:1:{s:15:"mm_dam_filelist";s:0:"";}}', 'comvos online medien GmbH, Nabil Saleh', 'saleh@comvos.de', 'foxer', '4f4394a5434baa7b62e5d9d5f1f1c33c', '    - impproved documentation\r\n    - enhanced mm_dam_filelist compatmode\r\n        - activate fake plugin in extensionmanager\r\n        - Show pluginname prefixed with "Old"\r\n        - added a small TS example\r\n\r\n    - improved cachehandler\r\n    - added fak', '', 1000002, 0, 0),
