(35115, 0, 't3events', 1, '0.4.0', 0, 0, 'Events', 'Manage events, show teasers, list and single views.', 1, 0, 3, 1361912852, 'a:1:{s:7:"depends";a:1:{s:5:"typo3";s:9:"4.5-0.0.0";}}', 'Dirk Wenzel, Michael Kasten', 'wenzel@webfox01.de, kasten@webfox01.de', 'dw', '23ad36dd706582e303965616e5439072', 'New Features. Please update your database and check your plugin settings. \nEvent records now contain new field venue. Quick Menu allows filtering event list by venues (template file QuickMenu.html changed!). Some test cases added.', 'Agentur Webfox, Agentur Webfox', 4000, 0, 0),
(35116, 0, 't3events', 1, '0.5.0', 0, 0, 'Events', 'Manage events, show teasers, list and single views.', 1, 0, 3, 1361974886, 'a:1:{s:7:"depends";a:1:{s:5:"typo3";s:9:"4.5-0.0.0";}}', 'Dirk Wenzel, Michael Kasten', 'wenzel@webfox01.de, kasten@webfox01.de', 'dw', '5c27376b44a6d57e1c546b33fbb62ad9', 'New features - Teaser now contains field for external link (Partial Teaser/Item.html changed). Event List and Quick Menus now allow filtering by event type. Localization of BE improved. Code cleanup.', 'Agentur Webfox, Agentur Webfox', 5000, 0, 0),
(35117, 0, 't3events', 1, '0.6.0', 0, 0, 'Events', 'Manage events, show teasers, list and single views.', 1, 0, 3, 1363537181, 'a:1:{s:7:"depends";a:1:{s:5:"typo3";s:12:"4.5.0-4.7.99";}}', 'Dirk Wenzel, Michael Kasten', 'wenzel@webfox01.de, kasten@webfox01.de', 'dw', 'eb9bdaca9467b01409aa919a1353b9cf', 'New Features: Domain Model Task for automatic update via scheduler and scheduler task implemented. Some localization for backend added.\n', 'Agentur Webfox, Agentur Webfox', 6000, 0, 0),
(35118, 0, 't3events', 1, '0.6.5', 0, 0, 'Events', 'Manage events, show teasers, list and single views.', 1, 0, 3, 1365153556, 'a:1:{s:7:"depends";a:1:{s:5:"typo3";s:11:"4.6.0-6.0.4";}}', 'Dirk Wenzel, Michael Kasten', 'wenzel@webfox01.de, kasten@webfox01.de', 'dw', '585de57a2521dc2e72db2bee4b4596ec', 'All image fields now allow to select existing images. \n\nTCA cleanup. \n\nFE Plugin now allows to select random teaser (Attention! this feature is still experimental. It works only with MySQL DB and without caching!)\n\nTYPO3 version constraint changed: curren', 'Agentur Webfox, Agentur Webfox', 6005, 0, 0),
(35119, 0, 't3events', 1, '0.6.4', 0, 0, 'Events', 'Manage events, show teasers, list and single views.', 1, 0, 3, 1364387129, 'a:1:{s:7:"depends";a:1:{s:5:"typo3";s:11:"4.5.0-6.0.4";}}', 'Dirk Wenzel, Michael Kasten', 'wenzel@webfox01.de, kasten@webfox01.de', 'dw', '1cde57fdcbd2ce51e1c9b216577f73d2', 'Bug Fixes, changes to TCA, TypoScript and default CSS, and code cleanup: \nIssues [Bug 46493], [Bug 46495], [Bug 46499] fixed.\nPlease save the old CSS file before updating and adapt your TypoScript.', 'Agentur Webfox, Agentur Webfox', 6004, 0, 0),
(35120, 0, 't3events', 1, '0.6.6', 0, 0, 'Events', 'Manage events, show teasers, list and single views.', 1, 0, 3, 1365431404, 'a:1:{s:7:"depends";a:1:{s:5:"typo3";s:11:"4.6.0-6.0.4";}}', 'Dirk Wenzel, Michael Kasten', 'wenzel@webfox01.de, kasten@webfox01.de', 'dw', '41a3e7015689173267cba4cda88277aa', 'FE Plugin can now be configured as non-cached.', 'Agentur Webfox, Agentur Webfox', 6006, 0, 0),
