(35141, 0, 't3events', 1, '0.16.0', 0, 0, 'Events', 'Manage events, show teasers, list and single views.', 1, 0, 3, 1417697303, 'a:1:{s:7:"depends";a:2:{s:5:"typo3";s:12:"6.2.0-6.2.99";s:18:"static_info_tables";s:12:"6.1.0-6.1.99";}}', 'Dirk Wenzel, Michael Kasten', 'wenzel@webfox01.de, kasten@webfox01.de', 'dw', '52f60f866fe8c43e725ca54daed635b7', 'From this version on t3events requires TYPO3 version 6.2.\r\nThere are no new features. See Changelog for details.\r\nPlease make shure to clean all caches after update.', 'Agentur Webfox', 16000, 0, 0),
