(35715, 0, 'youtubemovie', 1, '2.0.0', 0, 0, 'A Youtube Movie Gallery', 'This extension embeds youtube channel videos on your website. A two and a three column view is provided.', 1, 0, 3, 1381910650, 'a:1:{s:7:"depends";a:3:{s:5:"typo3";s:13:"4.5.17-4.6.18";s:7:"extbase";s:5:"1.3.3";s:5:"fluid";s:5:"1.3.0";}}', 'Bernhard Mehler', 'Bernhard.Mehler@gmail.com', 'bmehler', '7e7001598136d9d96cb7debe100bba37', '- code review\r\n- static template support (hover color, margin, padding within the constants editor)\r\n- backend language support for english and german (default english)\r\n- frontend language support for english and german (default english)', '', 2000000, 1, 0),
