(36321, 0, 'include_external_content', 1, '1.0.1', 0, 0, 'External content importer', 'The extension allows you to import external content from other sites as a content element in your page. \nIts also possible to manipulation the external content before rendering in your site (e.g. Links can be removed)', 1, 0, 3, 1375374045, 'a:1:{s:7:"depends";a:1:{s:5:"typo3";s:12:"4.5.0-4.7.99";}}', 'Wolfgang Peinbauer', 'w.peinbauer@gmx.at', 'peinbauw', '71302819c4779f6b3c7bce2d2814197a', 'This plugin uses simplehtmldom for creating a DOM Tree from the external Content\n\nFor more information please see\nhttp://sourceforge.net/projects/simplehtmldom/\n\nBe sure your imported content is not copyrighted and make visible where your content comes fr', '', 1000001, 0, 0),
