(36390, 0, 'content_designer', 1, '1.0.0', 0, 0, 'Content Designer', 'Create easy and fast new Content Elements. Based on Flexforms you can define new Elements by Typoscript (FlexForm like) or with an XML Flexform File. Examples like Google static Images and Media Player (Mediaelements.js) included. Donate it if you like it!', 1, 0, 3, 1376373440, 'a:1:{s:7:"depends";a:3:{s:7:"extbase";s:3:"6.0";s:5:"fluid";s:3:"6.0";s:5:"typo3";s:3:"6.0";}}', 'Hendrik Reimers', 'kontakt@kern23.de', 'kern23', '5f8a9312d4a81f9c178ef2e4ccadac1d', 'First release! Based on  my Ext. typoscript_content but for 6.x. See TS Examples for usage. Documentation and optimization of MediaelementJS coming in a few days. Send me Feedback please!', 'KERN23.de', 1000000, 0, 0),
