(36400, 0, 'content_designer', 1, '1.6.1', 0, 0, 'Content Designer', 'Create easy and fast new Content Elements. Based on Flexforms you can define new Elements by Typoscript (FlexForm like) or with an XML Flexform File. Examples like Google static Images and Media Player (Mediaelements.js) included. Donate it if you like it!', 2, 0, 3, 1383300882, 'a:1:{s:7:"depends";a:3:{s:5:"typo3";s:12:"6.0.0-6.1.99";s:7:"extbase";s:10:"6.0-6.9.99";s:5:"fluid";s:10:"6.0-6.9.99";}}', 'Hendrik Reimers', 'kontakt@kern23.de', 'kern23', 'f44ed81aae9a990064c39a257b06b44e', 'Better integration to the Content Element Wizard. Now you can change and configure the Elements with TSconfig (see Manual)', 'KERN23.de', 1006001, 0, 0),
