(36894, 0, 'camaliga', 1, '7.0.0', 0, 0, 'Camaliga: CArousel/MAp/LIst/GAllery', 'A carousel/gallery/map/list extension that can use the TYPO3 categories and different jQuery-plugins like Slick or Isotope. Bootstrap support. Indexer for ke_search. Many features! Big manual (even in german).', 2, 0, 3, 1488643286, 'a:1:{s:7:"depends";a:1:{s:5:"typo3";s:12:"7.0.0-7.6.99";}}', 'Kurt Gusbeth', 'info@quizpalme.de', 'bihor', 'ae2d625de622bdaee5e7095122c34974', 'New SEO and map features added.\r\nNew db-field: contact-person. More disable fields possibilities.\r\nThe CSV-import moved to the Scheduler.\r\n3 templates removed.\r\nRead the changelog of the manual.', '', 7000000, 0, 0),
