(37045, 0, 'solrwidget', 1, '0.9.0', 0, 0, 'Solr Fluid Widget', 'A Fluid Widget for use with EXT:solr - can be used as ViewHelper or as standalone plugin. Uses AJAX for searching and JS-filling of a Fluid-based HTML skeleton for displaying results.', 1, 0, 4, 1390575537, 'a:1:{s:7:"depends";a:4:{s:5:"typo3";s:12:"4.5.0-6.1.99";s:3:"cms";s:0:"";s:7:"extbase";s:0:"";s:5:"fluid";s:0:"";}}', 'Solr Team, Olivier Doberkau, Claus Due', 'opensource@dkd.de', 'oli4', '2eb32fd264bc4811c9b1d9e7d653d925', 'Initial TER release - beta quality.', 'dkd Internet Service GmbH', 9000, 1, 0),
