(37087, 0, 'userlike', 1, '1.0.0', 0, 0, 'Userlike', 'Userlike is a live chat software with which you can chat with the visitors of your website. Offer an outstanding online service, get to know your visitors, and raise your conversion rate! This plugin allows you to embed Userlike into your Typo3 website within seconds. Please be aware that you need an account with Userlike to use this plugin. You can enter the secret key found in your Userlike dashboard in the plugin settings.', 2, 0, 3, 1392021439, 'a:1:{s:7:"depends";a:3:{s:7:"extbase";s:3:"1.3";s:5:"fluid";s:3:"1.3";s:5:"typo3";s:12:"4.5.0-4.7.99";}}', 'Martin Salles', 'martin@userlike.com', 'sallesma', 'bb4ae6819a341f3ade76ed1ef7d887be', 'Userlike is a live chat software with which you can chat with the visitors of your website. Offer an outstanding online service, get to know your visitors, and raise your conversion rate! This plugin allows you to embed Userlike into your Typo3 website wi', '', 1000000, 0, 0),
