(37111, 0, 'operations', 1, '1.0.6', 0, 0, 'Operations', 'Manage firefighter operations with detailed reports and images. This extension were build to manage firefighter operations from "Freiwillige Feuerwehr Thale". Use slider and lightbox for images. Possibly to use it for other reportable events like THW and so on.', 0, 0, 3, 1397068742, 'a:1:{s:7:"depends";a:3:{s:7:"extbase";s:3:"6.0";s:5:"fluid";s:3:"6.0";s:5:"typo3";s:12:"6.1.0-6.2.99";}}', 'Karsten Nowak', 'captnnowi@gmx.de', 'nowi', '63133fc3e340d8987c07d334e8408990', 'Google Maps view in list and single view for operations added. In single view a little map is build when coordinates are given. For list view you can set  a checkbox in plugin form to render the list result in a map view. You can change data in infowindow', 'undkonsorten', 1000006, 0, 0),
(37112, 0, 'operations', 1, '1.0.7', 0, 0, 'Operations', 'Manage (firefighter) operations with detailed reports, images used resources or vehicles, google map view for locations and more. This extension was build to manage firefighter operations from "Freiwillige Feuerwehr Thale". Slider and lightbox for images. Possibly to use it for other reportable events like THW and so on.', 1, 0, 3, 1397415578, 'a:1:{s:7:"depends";a:3:{s:7:"extbase";s:3:"6.0";s:5:"fluid";s:3:"6.0";s:5:"typo3";s:12:"6.1.0-6.2.99";}}', 'Karsten Nowak', 'captnnowi@gmx.de', 'nowi', '59389481c104728a92b57f51bdf6c232', 'Add new field for teaser. Please go to installTool and compare database to add the new field. Extend documentation because of new map views. Set status to beta.', 'undkonsorten', 1000007, 0, 0),
(37113, 0, 'operations', 1, '1.0.8', 0, 0, 'Operations', 'Manage (firefighter) operations with detailed reports, images used resources or vehicles, google map view for locations and more. This extension was build to manage firefighter operations from "Freiwillige Feuerwehr Thale". Slider and lightbox for images. Possibly to use it for other reportable events like THW and so on.', 1, 0, 3, 1397416585, 'a:1:{s:7:"depends";a:3:{s:7:"extbase";s:3:"6.0";s:5:"fluid";s:3:"6.0";s:5:"typo3";s:12:"6.1.0-6.2.99";}}', 'Karsten Nowak', 'captnnowi@gmx.de', 'nowi', '3fda23f4adb6399cdaa633d9669c70d2', 'Fix problem with version number in documentation.', 'undkonsorten', 1000008, 0, 0),
