(37285, 0, 'news_ttnewsimport', 1, '1.0.0', 0, 0, 'tt_news importer', 'Importer of ext:tt_news items to ext:news', 2, 0, 0, 1396334104, 'a:1:{s:7:"depends";a:3:{s:5:"typo3";s:12:"6.2.0-6.2.99";s:3:"php";s:11:"5.3.0-0.0.0";s:4:"news";s:7:"2.999.0";}}', 'Frans Saris', 'frans@beech.it', 'minifranske', 'b673d6ad8b8358dc3979b419aca9a56c', 'First release to TER. This is the tt_news import functionality from ext:news extracted in an own extension enhanced with ext:DAM and ext:jg_youtubeinnews support. The tt_news import is removed from ext:news in the latest version.\r\nThe DAM part is optional', '', 1000000, 0, 0),
