(37460, 0, 'js_contact_form', 1, '1.1.0', 0, 0, 'Simple Contact Form', 'This is a simple contact form extensions for TYPO3 where user can send his contact information to admin & copy of that is also sent to user on their email. Admin can select required fields & can also manage the mandatory fields for the form via typo script. All dynamic stuffs can easily managed from typoscript. This Form has both server & client side validations.', 2, 0, 3, 1401709857, 'a:1:{s:7:"depends";a:3:{s:7:"extbase";s:3:"6.0";s:5:"fluid";s:3:"6.0";s:5:"typo3";s:14:"6.0.0 - 6.2.99";}}', 'Jainish Senjaliya, Jainish Senjaliya', 'jainish.online@gmail.com, jainish.online@gmail.com', 'jainish', '3539254ec78b7353c2e47070b178e9c3', 'We can select required fields & can also manage the mandatory fields for the form via typoscript. \r\n\r\nAll dynamic stuff will be manage from typescript and from plugin options.', '', 1001000, 0, 0),
(37461, 0, 'js_contact_form', 1, '1.1.1', 0, 0, 'Contact Form', 'This is a simple contact form extensions for TYPO3 where user can send his contact information to admin & copy of that is also sent to user on their email. Admin can select required fields & can also manage the mandatory fields for the form via typoscripts. All dynamic stuffs can easily managed from typoscript. This Form has both server & client side validations.', 2, 0, 3, 1402665003, 'a:1:{s:7:"depends";a:3:{s:7:"extbase";s:3:"6.0";s:5:"fluid";s:3:"6.0";s:5:"typo3";s:14:"6.0.0 - 6.2.99";}}', 'Jainish Senjaliya', 'jainish.online@gmail.com', 'jainish', '44fb0f34240aea0d5b90b40141561720', 'Added option to enable/disble client side validation,\r\nAdded another option for CSS/JS to be included in header or footer,\r\nAdded option to enable/disble Mobile compatible Layout.', '', 1001001, 0, 0),
