(37671, 0, 'arc_fbconnect', 1, '1.0.0', 0, 0, 'Archriss Facebook Connection to fe_users', 'Help you to connect to front-end using Facebook, configurable through TypoScript. Display login/logout link where the plugin is placed.', 2, 0, 2, 1405084446, 'a:1:{s:7:"depends";a:3:{s:5:"typo3";s:12:"4.5.0-6.2.99";s:3:"php";s:11:"5.3.3-0.0.0";s:3:"cms";s:0:"";}}', 'Christophe Monard', 'cmonard@archriss.com', 'thorfin', 'cc47a86ba58f60b55afb6457a8213b34', 'Initial release on the TER\r\nProvide a link that help to connect user of TYPO3 with their Facebook account.\r\nReturn a simple link with class to help to style the button.\r\nYou can activate debug and call page type 301 to see all active informations \r\nPlease', 'Archriss', 1000000, 1, 0),
