(37933, 0, 'includekrexx', 1, '2.0.0', 0, 0, 'kreXX Debugger', 'kreXX is a php debugger with a fatal error handler. It displays debug information about objects and variables in its own draggable output.', 2, 0, 4, 1472572029, 'a:1:{s:7:"depends";a:2:{s:5:"typo3";s:12:"4.5.0-8.3.99";s:3:"php";s:12:"5.3.0-7.0.99";}}', 'BRAINWORXX GmbH', 'tobias.guelzow@brainworxx.de', 'moorth', 'a363d9bb5a08bde990275a8b1b84e68b', '- Refactored almost everything resulting in a a major increase in speed.\r\n- Added source code to the closure analysis.', 'BRAINWORXX GmbH', 2000000, 0, 0),
(37934, 0, 'includekrexx', 1, '2.0.1', 0, 0, 'kreXX Debugger', 'kreXX is a feature rich php debugger with a neatly arranged debug window, featuring backend access to logfiles, code generation to reach the displayed values and much more.', 2, 0, 4, 1477125173, 'a:1:{s:7:"depends";a:2:{s:5:"typo3";s:12:"4.5.0-8.4.99";s:3:"php";s:12:"5.3.0-7.0.99";}}', 'BRAINWORXX GmbH', 'tobias.guelzow@brainworxx.de', 'moorth', 'dcc426652940da763523b3c4b20cb311', '- Added a IP mask to the configuration\r\n- Removed config options that nobody was editing anyway\r\n- Added the method arguments to the method analysis in the smokygrey skin\r\n- Fixed the source generation for array-objects\r\n- Minor bugfixes', 'BRAINWORXX GmbH', 2000001, 0, 0),
