(37940, 0, 'nr_session', 1, '2.0.1', 0, 0, 'Netresearch session module.', 'Provides a more secure, stable and scalable session handler which uses caching framework.', 2, 0, 2, 1408948547, 'a:2:{s:7:"depends";a:2:{s:3:"php";s:12:"5.3.0-5.5.99";s:5:"typo3";s:12:"4.5.0-6.2.99";}s:8:"suggests";a:2:{s:8:"nr_cache";s:6:"1.0.4-";s:7:"nr_lock";s:6:"1.0.0-";}}', 'Sebastian Mendel', 'sebastian.mendel@netresearch.de', 'netresearch', '73f290a079dcf7b26a48fb318334f3cd', 'Initial TYPO3 TER release.\r\n\r\nOverview:\r\n\r\nAlternative session handler. Provides an interface to a more secure, faster and\r\nscalable session data storage. And more secure session id handling.\r\n\r\n\r\nFeature:\r\n\r\nUses caching framework to store session data.\r', ' Co.KG', 2000001, 1, 0),
