(37946, 0, 'nr_cache', 1, '1.3.0', 0, 0, 'Netresearch CachingFramework module.', 'Provides a Redis and Couchbase CachingFramework backend and code and functionresult frontend.', 0, 0, 2, 1409055311, 'a:1:{s:7:"depends";a:2:{s:3:"php";s:13:"5.3.0-5.99.99";s:5:"typo3";s:12:"4.5.0-6.2.99";}}', 'Sebastian Mendel', 'sebastian.mendel@netresearch.de', 'netresearch', '777598b0761a5d75305b46402a3ff817', 'Provides functionality to store cache data in memory based caching\r\nsystems like Couchbase, Redis, Memcache or Amazon ElastiCache.\r\nIncluding PHP code cache and function results - move your typo3temp cache\r\nfolders into Redis.', ' Co.KG', 1003000, 0, 0),
