(37949, 0, 'findtypo3', 1, '0.0.1', 0, 0, 'Find TYPO3', 'This extension help to search in TYPO3 files.', 2, 0, 3, 1409301350, 'a:1:{s:7:"depends";a:3:{s:7:"extbase";s:3:"6.0";s:5:"fluid";s:3:"6.0";s:5:"typo3";s:14:"6.0.0 - 6.2.99";}}', 'Maulik Bhojani', 'maulikbhojani4444@gmail.com', 'maulikbhojani', '25d2e599ce43a0ee5c45ace9e4b4a2d0', 'findtypo3 extension is for searching the keyword, code or any text in all files of TYPO3.\r\nIt also have custom options like search in fileadmin, typo3conf etc.\r\n\r\nNote : This will work only in Linux or Ubuntu server. \r\n\r\nThis will be helpful for DEVELOPER', 'Maulik Bhojani', 1, 0, 0),
