(37966, 0, 'moox_core', 1, '0.9.0', 0, 0, 'MOOX Bootstrap Responsive', 'Makes TYPO3 fully responsive using Bootstrap, HTML5 Boilerplate, jQuery and Superfish. Needed for all MOOX Design Templates, MOOX News & Blog System and other MOOX Extensions. Best way to use the MOOX Core Extension is to install a Design Template, as moox_core will be autoinstalled by the dependencies.', 1, 0, 4, 1409605474, 'a:2:{s:7:"depends";a:9:{s:5:"typo3";s:12:"6.2.0-6.2.99";s:3:"cms";s:12:"6.2.0-6.2.99";s:7:"extbase";s:12:"6.2.0-6.2.99";s:5:"fluid";s:12:"6.2.0-6.2.99";s:4:"flux";s:12:"7.1.0-7.1.99";s:3:"vhs";s:12:"2.0.0-2.0.99";s:12:"fluidcontent";s:12:"4.1.0-4.1.99";s:10:"fluidpages";s:12:"3.1.0-3.1.99";s:7:"realurl";s:14:"1.12.8-1.12.99";}s:9:"conflicts";a:1:{s:18:"css_styled_content";s:0:"";}}', 'MOOX Team', 'moox@dcn.de', 'dcngmbh', '833e5e50c0fcaa85498ac6648df5a16d', 'Corrected Dependencies and set the State to Beta. \r\n\r\nAnd it is a real Beta as MOOX Core depends on VHS 2.0 and Flux 7.1. Currently both Extensions are only on Github, not in TER. As there are some known bugs and behaviours depending on the Version of the', 'DCN GmbH', 9000, 0, 0),
(37967, 0, 'moox_core', 1, '0.9.1', 0, 0, 'MOOX Bootstrap Responsive', 'Makes TYPO3 fully responsive using Bootstrap, HTML5 Boilerplate, jQuery and Superfish. Needed for all MOOX Design Templates, MOOX News & Blog System and other MOOX Extensions. Best way to use the MOOX Core Extension is to install a Design Template, as moox_core will be autoinstalled by the dependencies.', 1, 0, 4, 1409788958, 'a:2:{s:7:"depends";a:8:{s:5:"typo3";s:12:"6.2.0-6.2.99";s:7:"extbase";s:12:"6.2.0-6.2.99";s:5:"fluid";s:12:"6.2.0-6.2.99";s:4:"flux";s:12:"7.1.0-7.1.99";s:3:"vhs";s:12:"2.0.0-2.0.99";s:12:"fluidcontent";s:12:"4.1.0-4.1.99";s:10:"fluidpages";s:12:"3.1.0-3.1.99";s:7:"realurl";s:14:"1.12.8-1.12.99";}s:9:"conflicts";a:1:{s:18:"css_styled_content";s:0:"";}}', 'the MOOX Team', 'moox@dcn.de', 'dcngmbh', '949b6602e5d442606ccb6f3fb66d435b', 'Improved documentation, some minor fixes.\r\n\r\nPlease get the development-versions of FluidTYPO3 Extensions from Github and install MOOX on a fresh installed TYPO3. moox_core is Beta, not for production.', 'DCN GmbH', 9001, 0, 0),
(37968, 0, 'moox_core', 1, '0.9.5', 0, 0, 'MOOX Bootstrap Responsive', 'Makes TYPO3 fully responsive using Bootstrap, HTML5 Boilerplate, jQuery and Superfish. Needed for all MOOX Design Templates, MOOX News & Blog System and other MOOX Extensions. Best way to use the MOOX Core Extension is to install a Design Template, as moox_core will be autoinstalled due dependencies.', 1, 0, 4, 1411244130, 'a:2:{s:7:"depends";a:8:{s:5:"typo3";s:12:"6.2.4-6.2.99";s:7:"extbase";s:12:"6.2.4-6.2.99";s:5:"fluid";s:12:"6.2.4-6.2.99";s:4:"flux";s:12:"7.1.0-7.1.99";s:3:"vhs";s:12:"2.0.0-2.0.99";s:12:"fluidcontent";s:12:"4.1.0-4.1.99";s:10:"fluidpages";s:12:"3.1.0-3.1.99";s:7:"realurl";s:14:"1.12.8-1.12.99";}s:9:"conflicts";a:1:{s:18:"css_styled_content";s:0:"";}}', 'MOOX Team', 'moox@dcn.de', 'dcngmbh', '4d4c4a8f240b41419e94ae5927f255d6', 'Installation should now be possible without Github-Extensions as Flux 7.1 is in TER. moox_core is Beta, but you may develop projects with MOOX (as we do).', 'DCN GmbH', 9005, 0, 0),
