(38001, 0, 'moox_news', 1, '0.8.6', 0, 0, 'MOOX news', 'Adaptation of extension "news" (by Georg Ringer) for MOOX. Optimized Backend Module, Responsive Output with MOOX Templates and Social Media Integration.', 0, 0, 2, 1409608137, 'a:1:{s:7:"depends";a:2:{s:5:"typo3";s:12:"6.2.3-6.2.99";s:3:"vhs";s:0:"";}}', ' the MOOX Team', 'moox@dcn.de', 'dcngmbh', 'c21b47f2638cf74c06904fe4215c9ed6', 'Initial Upload of moox_news, Social Media Integration is currently not implemented. For Frontend Output moox_core is recommended, but there is no restrict dependency. As moox_news is not well tested and documented by now, please do not use this Ext in pro', 'DCN GmbH', 8006, 0, 0),
(38002, 0, 'moox_news', 1, '0.8.9', 0, 0, 'MOOX news', 'Adaptation of extension "news" (thanks to Georg Ringer) for MOOX. Optimized Backend Module, Responsive Output with MOOX Templates and Social Media Integration.', 0, 0, 2, 1411254679, 'a:1:{s:7:"depends";a:2:{s:5:"typo3";s:12:"6.2.3-6.2.99";s:3:"vhs";s:0:"";}}', ' the MOOX Team', 'moox@dcn.de', 'dcngmbh', '224e4edd211b28c7eb10c433057cf3cc', 'Corrected Backend Module, Alpha-Release!', 'DCN GmbH', 8009, 0, 0),
(38003, 0, 'moox_news', 1, '0.9.0', 0, 0, 'MOOX news', 'Adaptation of extension "news" (thanks to Georg Ringer) for MOOX. Optimized Backend Module, Responsive Output with MOOX Templates and Social Media Integration.', 1, 0, 2, 1411689286, 'a:1:{s:7:"depends";a:2:{s:5:"typo3";s:12:"6.2.3-6.2.99";s:3:"vhs";s:0:"";}}', ' the MOOX Team', 'moox@dcn.de', 'dcngmbh', 'd486f59ef578cfb6074a2f963023e7dd', 'Added Bootstrap classes to news template\r\nInstallations without moox_core can enable bootstrap via constants\r\nImproved file security mechanism\r\nRemoved old css-rules', 'DCN GmbH', 9000, 0, 0),
(38004, 0, 'moox_news', 1, '0.9.5', 0, 0, 'MOOX News', 'Adaptation of extension "news" (thanks to Georg Ringer) for MOOX. Optimized Backend Module, Responsive Output with MOOX Templates and Social Media Integration.', 1, 0, 2, 1419241774, 'a:1:{s:7:"depends";a:2:{s:5:"typo3";s:12:"6.2.3-6.2.99";s:3:"vhs";s:0:"";}}', ' the MOOX Team', 'moox@dcn.de', 'dcngmbh', 'a61bbb274d4545d4d802f45c1ba8236c', 'Many bugfixes and improvements in BE and FE, improved bootstrap-output incl. pagination, fixed some compatibility issues with Seminars and Mailer', 'DCN GmbH', 9005, 0, 0),
(38005, 0, 'moox_news', 1, '0.9.6', 0, 0, 'MOOX News', 'Adaptation of extension "news" (thanks to Georg Ringer) for MOOX. Optimized Backend Module, Responsive Output with MOOX Templates and Social Media Integration.', 1, 0, 2, 1424790039, 'a:1:{s:7:"depends";a:2:{s:5:"typo3";s:12:"6.2.3-6.2.99";s:3:"vhs";s:0:"";}}', ' the MOOX Team', 'moox@dcn.de', 'dcngmbh', '2a9667c386952d9b7383834c82b213f8', 'Some bugfixes and compatibility issues solved', 'DCN GmbH', 9006, 0, 0),
