(38101, 0, 'groupdocs_viewer_for_java', 1, '1.0.0', 0, 0, 'GroupDocs.Viewer for Java  HTML5 Document Viewer', 'This extension allows you to integrate the downloadable Java version of the GroupDocs.Viewer into TYPO3 CMS. Once installed, you will be able to embed and display over 50 types of documents and images on any page within your TYPO3 website. Supported file formats include: PDF, Microsoft Word, Excel, PowerPoint, Visio, Outlook, Project, OpenDocument, AutoCAD and raster images. Some of the key benefits of the GroupDocs.Viewer are: 1. Clear native text rendering (users can select/copy text right from documents embedded to a web-page); 2. Cross-browser support; 3. Users can view documents without having to install any software or plugins; 4. Convenient UI for seamless navigation of large documents in a web-browser. Please note that this plugin requires the GroupDocs.Viewer for Java library to be installed on your server first. You can download a free evaluation copy of the library from the GroupDocs website: http://groupdocs.com/java/document-viewer-library', 1, 0, 3, 1410940226, 'a:1:{s:7:"depends";a:1:{s:5:"typo3";s:12:"4.5.0-6.1.99";}}', 'GroupDocs Marketplace Team', 'support@groupdocs.com', 'groupdocs', '42b24435c4ea58ac0ead947c415df195', 'This extension allows you to integrate the downloadable Java version of the GroupDocs.Viewer into TYPO3 CMS. Once installed, you will be able to embed and display over 50 types of documents and images on any page within your TYPO3 website. Supported file ', '', 1000000, 1, 0),
(38102, 0, 'groupdocs_viewer_for_dotnet', 1, '1.0.0', 0, 0, 'GroupDocs.Viewer for .Net', 'This extension allows you to integrate the downloadable .NET version of the GroupDocs.Viewer into TYPO3 CMS. Once installed, you will be able to embed and display over 50 types of documents and images on any page within your TYPO3 website. Supported file formats include: PDF, Microsoft Word, Excel, PowerPoint, Visio, Outlook, Project, OpenDocument, AutoCAD and raster images. Among key benefits of the GroupDocs.Viewer are: 1. Clear native text rendering (users can select/copy text right from documents embedded to a web-page); 2. Cross-browser support; 3. Users can view documents without having to install any software or plugins; 4. Convenient UI for seamless navigation of large documents in a web-browser. Please note that this plugin requires the GroupDocs.Viewer for .NET library to be installed on your server first. You can download a free evaluation copy of the library from the GroupDocs website: http://groupdocs.com/dot-net/document-viewer-library', 1, 0, 3, 1410941248, 'a:1:{s:7:"depends";a:1:{s:5:"typo3";s:12:"4.5.0-6.1.99";}}', 'GroupDocs Marketplace Team', 'support@groupdocs.com', 'groupdocs', 'dde382c24ca1d9e205a92a9c188ccfb1', 'This extension allows you to integrate the downloadable .NET version of the GroupDocs.Viewer into TYPO3 CMS. Once installed, you will be able to embed and display over 50 types of documents and images on any page within your TYPO3 website. Supported file ', '', 1000000, 0, 0),
