(38384, 0, 'clear_t3cache', 1, '0.9.1', 0, 0, 'clear_t3cache', 'extension with cli-script which clears the TYPO3-cache', 1, 0, 0, 1417118842, 'a:1:{s:7:"depends";a:1:{s:5:"typo3";s:12:"6.1.0-6.2.99";}}', 'Francisco J. Lpez Sanhueza', 'fjlopezs87@gmail.com', 'fjlopezs', 'a7655c5dececb2123c72383ea3235075', 'STEPS:\r\n\r\n1. Install the extension using extension_manager\r\n2. Create a user backend with the following name: "_cli_lowlevel" with a random password without any additional privileges.\r\n3. Now, to clear the cache using the command line in the root typo3 di', '', 9001, 0, 0),
(38385, 0, 'clear_t3cache', 1, '0.9.2', 0, 0, 'clear_t3cache', 'extension with cli-script which clears the TYPO3-cache', 1, 0, 0, 1417119785, 'a:1:{s:7:"depends";a:1:{s:5:"typo3";s:12:"6.1.0-6.2.99";}}', 'Francisco J. Lpez Sanhueza', 'fjlopezs87@gmail.com', 'fjlopezs', 'cf48f19f307664129585f31920982979', 'STEPS: 1. INSTALL the extension 2. CREATE a user backend with the following name: "_cli_lowlevel" with a random password, without any additional privileges. 3. Now, in the root typo3 directory, EXECUTE: php typo3/cli_dispatch.phpsh clear_t3cache', '', 9002, 0, 0),
(38386, 0, 'clear_t3cache', 1, '0.9.3', 0, 0, 'clear_t3cache', 'extension with cli-script which clears the TYPO3-cache', 2, 0, 0, 1427393415, 'a:1:{s:7:"depends";a:1:{s:5:"typo3";s:12:"6.1.0-6.2.99";}}', 'Francisco J. Lpez Sanhueza', 'fjlopezs87@gmail.com', 'fjlopezs', '6a236a6db1d4771544ef2e2be005e368', 'STEPS: 1. INSTALL the extension 2. CREATE a user backend with the following name: "_cli_lowlevel" with a random password, without any additional privileges. 3. Now, in the root typo3 directory, EXECUTE: php typo3/cli_dispatch.phpsh clear_t3cache', '', 9003, 0, 0),
(38387, 0, 'clear_t3cache', 1, '0.9.4', 0, 0, 'clear_t3cache', 'extension with cli-script which clears the TYPO3-cache', 2, 0, 0, 1427396577, 'a:1:{s:7:"depends";a:1:{s:5:"typo3";s:12:"6.1.0-6.2.99";}}', 'Francisco J. Lpez Sanhueza', 'fjlopezs87@gmail.com', 'fjlopezs', '0415a13b397b6805f1c582de82124f18', 'STEPS: 1. INSTALL the extension 2. CREATE a user backend with the following name: "_cli_lowlevel" with a random password, without any additional privileges. 3. Now, in the root typo3 directory, EXECUTE: php typo3/cli_dispatch.phpsh clear_t3cache', '', 9004, 0, 0),
