(38389, 0, 'mapsapi3', 1, '0.3.0', 0, 0, 'Google Maps API 3', 'Add a Google Map based on Googles API 3 to your page. You can use multiple markers easily. No TypoScript required.', 999, 0, 3, 1417168552, 'a:1:{s:7:"depends";a:3:{s:3:"cms";s:0:"";s:3:"php";s:12:"5.0.0-5.5.99";s:5:"typo3";s:12:"4.5.0-6.2.99";}}', 'Felix Kiesewetter', 'info@felixkiesewetter.de', 'felixkiesewetter', 'df2c1b2a250c10a05e3bb054e40ff2ab', 'First official release via the TER', 'Felix Kiesewetter', 3000, 0, 0),
