(38494, 0, 'cookie_consent', 1, '2.0.1', 0, 0, 'Cookie consent', 'Show information and get consent for tracking cookies. Handles "doNotTrack" setting from browser if configured. Filter out unwanted tracking scripts by using a TypoScript condition or by javascript AOP. Needs jQuery', 2, 0, 2, 1449764038, 'a:1:{s:7:"depends";a:1:{s:5:"typo3";s:12:"7.6.0-7.6.99";}}', 'Patrick Broens', 'patrick@patrickbroens.nl', 'patrick', 'bdd3f042f4dde23a790de455c8fecc35', 'Replaced the controller with TypoScript call to FLUIDTEMPLATE\r\nAdded the possibility to deny the browser DNT setting\r\nAdded the possibility to hide/show the deny button, which is new as well\r\nAdded a TypoScript condition to check if cookie is accepted', '', 2000001, 1, 0),
(38495, 0, 'cb_ink', 1, '1.0.0', 0, 0, 'Ink responsive HTML email', 'Integrates Ink responsive HTML emails (from Zurb) to TYPO3. Also includes CSS inliner and HTML to text converter.', 0, 0, 6, 1419278779, 'a:2:{s:7:"depends";a:1:{s:5:"typo3";s:12:"6.2.0-6.2.99";}s:8:"suggests";a:1:{s:11:"direct_mail";s:12:"4.0.0-4.0.99";}}', 'Charles Brunet', 'charles@cbrunet.net', 'cbrunet', '7ddb2b048fbb70f00b6a31240668dbb5', 'This extension provides CSS file from Zurb Ink responsive email template.\r\nIt also includes tools to inline CSS code (based on Emogrifier),\r\nand tools to convert HTML to plain text (based on html2text), to help generating email templates  to use with mass', '', 1000000, 0, 0),
(38496, 0, 'cb_ink', 1, '1.0.1', 0, 0, 'Ink responsive HTML email', 'Integrates Ink responsive HTML emails (from Zurb) to TYPO3. Also includes CSS inliner and HTML to text converter.', 0, 0, 6, 1486322748, 'a:2:{s:7:"depends";a:1:{s:5:"typo3";s:13:"6.2.0-7.99.99";}s:8:"suggests";a:1:{s:11:"direct_mail";s:12:"4.0.0-5.1.99";}}', 'Charles Brunet', 'charles@cbrunet.net', 'cbrunet', 'a91f31b77e887ea197986b9b22ba1721', 'Minor compatibility fixes for TYPO3 7', '', 1000001, 1, 0),
