(38625, 0, 'geopicker', 1, '0.0.2', 0, 0, 'GeoPicker', 'BE extension that allows to handle GPS coordinate fields in your own extensions.\nIt will help you to manage your latitude, longitude and elevation fields via popup wizard which will allow you to geolocate the position on the Google Map.\nAlso there are ViewHelpers, format converters, TCA validations which will help you to point the point.\nFor more details check included manual', 2, 0, 1, 1434025514, 'a:1:{s:7:"depends";a:1:{s:5:"typo3";s:12:"6.2.0-6.2.99";}}', 'Marcus Biesioroff', 'marcus@biesioroff.com', 'biesior', 'c78d8079b361573d66308abd27b0f618', 'Fixed bug: Inline styles in BE view causes occasionally problems with Fluid argumentss rendering', 'Marcus Biesioroff Group', 2, 1, 0),
