(38737, 0, 'subpageteaser', 1, '1.0.0', 0, 0, 'Subpage Teaser', 'Shows a teaserlist of all subpages. Uses the content element of the subpages. You can choose which is used as teaser. Fully customizable with fluid and css. Easy to use with many possible settings.', 2, 0, 3, 1424794981, 'a:1:{s:7:"depends";a:3:{s:5:"typo3";s:12:"6.2.0-7.9.99";s:5:"fluid";s:12:"6.2.0-7.9.99";s:7:"extbase";s:12:"6.2.0-7.9.99";}}', 'Mark Kirstein', 'mark.kirstein@sector12.de', 'sector12', 'fc557815f2a13a741d69f9f4db26597e', 'Easy to use a fully customizable. First upload of this extension, if you find a bug please use forge.....', '', 1000000, 0, 0),
(38738, 0, 'subpageteaser', 1, '1.1.0', 0, 0, 'Subpage Teaser', 'Shows a teaserlist of all subpages. Uses the content element of the subpages. You can choose which is used as teaser. Fully customizable with fluid and css. Easy to use with many possible settings.', 2, 0, 3, 1425629805, 'a:1:{s:7:"depends";a:3:{s:5:"typo3";s:12:"6.2.0-7.9.99";s:5:"fluid";s:12:"6.2.0-7.9.99";s:7:"extbase";s:12:"6.2.0-7.9.99";}}', 'Mark Kirstein', 'mark.kirstein@sector12.de', 'sector12', '47139fd0065d63d359468bceadfd1674', 'Easier and better handling for mulitilanguage sites. You can use an option in settings to display only translated pages or use the installtool with [FE][hidePagesIfNotTranslatedByDefault]  1\r\nYou can add your own css file by just one click!', '', 1001000, 0, 0),
