(38906, 0, 'toctoccommentsce', 1, '1.0.0', 0, 0, 'AJAX Social Network Components CE', 'AJAX Social Network Components CE allows your website visitors to leave comments on content elements (CE) using the toctoc_comments-plugin. It is the easiest way to deploy toctoc_comments in the TYPO3 backend', 1, 0, 3, 1427451489, 'a:1:{s:7:"depends";a:3:{s:15:"toctoc_comments";s:14:"7.1.8-99.99.99";s:5:"typo3";s:12:"6.0.0-7.9.99";s:3:"php";s:12:"5.3.7-5.6.99";}}', 'Gisle Wendl', 'gisele.wendl@toctoc.ch', 'giselew', 'b8e01adbd3d2df6fa9d77e7f8deed833', 'Initial release\nAdds toctoc_comments after a content element. Adds a new tab to content elements in backend\nCompatible TYPO3 newer than version 6, no need for EXT:compatibility6 under TYPO3 7.x\nRequires and automatically installs EXT:toctoc_comments versi', 'TocToc Internetmanagement', 1000000, 0, 0),
