(39201, 0, 'rteconfig', 1, '0.2.0', 0, 0, 'RTE Configuration', '', 1, 0, 0, 1439578579, 'a:1:{s:7:"depends";a:2:{s:5:"typo3";s:13:"6.2.00-6.2.99";s:11:"rtehtmlarea";s:12:"6.2.0-6.2.99";}}', 'Felix Kiesewetter', 'info@felixkiesewetter.de', 'felixkiesewetter', '51052287c5d7b3663ecc3739f3f869f7', 'You can now add own allowed classes and blockstyles to the RTE. As of version 0.2.0 it should work with links as well as tables and table rows. Will test and add more blockstyles soon. The defined styles used in the RTE are also automatically added to the', '', 2000, 1, 0),
