(39209, 0, 'retrostats', 1, '0.0.1', 0, 0, 'Retro Statistics - Re-introduce the goodol apache', 'Re-introduces the good old apache-style logfile written by TYPO3. This should make extensions like AWstats work again with TYPO3 versions 6 and higher. Place the [FE][logfile_dir] setting in AdditionalConfiguration.php instead of LocalConfiguration!', 1, 0, 2, 1434372409, 'a:1:{s:7:"depends";a:1:{s:5:"typo3";s:12:"6.0.0-7.9.99";}}', 'Loek Hilgersom', 'typo3extensions@netcoop.nl', 'loek', '890eaccf3cdbf32ab07d8a620173bcb8', 'Re-introduces the good old apache-style logfile written by TYPO3. This should make extensions like AWstats work again with TYPO3 versions 6 and higher. Place the [FE][logfile_dir] setting in AdditionalConfiguration.php instead of LocalConfiguration!\r\n\r\nBe', '', 1, 0, 0),
