(40150, 0, 't3wrapper', 1, '0.0.4', 0, 0, 'TYPO3 Wrapper', 'A typoscript route generator to run into extbase controller actions via typenum. Warning: Be able to run every typo3 frontend plugin action via url, like newsletter subscription, contact forms, sitemap xml, login or other. Let me hear what for you use it.', 0, 0, 1, 1460488081, 'a:2:{s:7:"depends";a:1:{s:5:"typo3";s:13:"6.2.0-8.99.99";}s:8:"suggests";a:1:{s:10:"tt_address";s:12:"2.3.0-3.0.99";}}', 'Salvatore Eckel', 'salvaracer@gmx.de', 'salvaracer', 'c75d491122ad0075fe75756ec2009b78', 'Version 6.- 7.- 8.x compatibility. Add Wrapper to get Facebook Page Likes. New: Use f:cObject or use Ajax like before. Add wrapper for dynamic sitemaps with realurl configuration.', '', 4, 1, 0),
