(40802, 0, 'dataviewer', 1, '1.6.0', 0, 0, 'MageDeveloper DataViewer', 'Build easy and intuitive TCA-records (e.g. News, Jobs, Events and more) on the fly without developing a new extension. Only templating is needed; includes many plugins for all kinds of usage!', 2, 0, 3, 1487009919, 'a:1:{s:7:"depends";a:4:{s:5:"typo3";s:12:"7.6.5-8.3.99";s:3:"cms";s:0:"";s:7:"extbase";s:0:"";s:5:"fluid";s:0:"";}}', 'Bastian Zagar', 'kontakt@magedeveloper.de', 'breep', '7817b0b85b686a8ce6b7735f3ba4d1ea', 'Big fat feature update! Lots of features, bugfixes and improvements. (Caching, Paging, UserFunc Field, Suggest Wizard, Direct Fluid Code rendering) See changelog for more details. Please re-install the extension in the Extension Manager for best results w', '', 1006000, 0, 0),
