(41412, 0, 'cps_shortnr', 1, '2.0.0', 0, 0, 'Url Shortener', 'Builds links to pages and extension records with a tiny url', 1, 0, 2, 1490939963, 'a:2:{s:7:"depends";a:1:{s:5:"typo3";s:12:"7.6.0-8.6.99";}s:8:"suggests";a:1:{s:20:"pagenotfoundhandling";s:0:"";}}', 'Nicole Cordes', 'cordes@cps-it.de', 'cpsitgmbh', 'ce5587c36c94821e5350c26b3336c728', 'Generate links like P42 for pages or N42 for news. You can extend the configuration to add every record type you use in your installation.\r\n\r\nRewritten shortener with new configuration. \r\nNow there is an API to retrieve a shortlink for records by TypoScri', '', 2000000, 0, 0),
