(41433, 0, 'yoast_seo', 1, '1.0.0', 0, 0, 'Yoast SEO', '', 2, 0, 4, 1492638765, 'a:1:{s:7:"depends";a:1:{s:5:"typo3";s:13:"7.6.13-8.7.99";}}', 'Yoast SEO for TYPO3', '', 'yoast', 'eebd579b41fbd9e2630f8df9e969577b', 'This plugin integrates text analysis and assessment from YoastSEO.js. Content analysis can generate interesting metrics about a text and give you an assessment which can be used to improve the text.', 'MaxServ B.V., Yoast', 1000000, 0, 0),
