(41489, 0, 'ipm_cline', 1, '1.1.0', 0, 0, 'IPM C-Line', 'Add copyright lines to your TYPO3 project. With the "today"-Feature you must never rewrite the year (e.g. 2017 to 2018) at New Year.', 1, 0, 3, 1494403725, 'a:1:{s:7:"depends";a:1:{s:5:"typo3";s:12:"7.6.0-8.7.99";}}', 'more GmbH', 'developer@ipandmore.de', 'ipandmore', '77281d77a91b8bd1bae587b047ce588b', '- [TASK] Set version to 1.1.0\r\n- [FEATURE] Add TypoScript configuration to include/exclude extension CSS\r\n- [TASK] Update template and CSS\r\n- [BUGFIX] Respect page-specific RTE configuration\r\n- [TASK] Update extension description', 'more GmbH', 1001000, 0, 0),
