(41792, 0, 'ns_all_chat', 1, '1.0.0', 0, 0, '[NITSAN] All in One Chat  Real Time Chat', 'One of the only TYPO3 extension which provides to use most popular chat tool at your website. This TYPO3 extension provides to configure many live chat tools eg., zopim.com, livechatinc.com, purechat.com, livezilla.net, clickdesk.com, tidiochat.com, visitlead.com, onwebchat.com, userlike.com, hipchat.com & more will be available in an upcoming version.', 2, 0, 3, 1505990637, 'a:1:{s:7:"depends";a:1:{s:5:"typo3";s:12:"6.0.0-8.9.99";}}', 'Sanjay Chuahan [NITSAN Technologies]', 'sanjay@nitsan.in', 'nitsan', '120738363e41df9a0f8271a89cf0718f', 'One of the only TYPO3 extension which provides to use most popular chat tool at your website. It includes chat tools like zopim.com, livechatinc.com, purechat.com, livezilla.net, clickdesk.com, tidiochat.com, visitlead.com, onwebchat.com, userlike.com, hi', '', 1000000, 1, 0),
